2 CONT John Osborne II was born about 1600, in England. He married Cicely in 1620, in England, United Kingdom. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 3 daughters. He died on 27 October 1686, in Newport, Rhode Island, British Colonia
2 CONC l America, at the age of 87.
