2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Daniel Prior
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Mary (Geer) Prior — married 15 Apr 1686 in Enfield, Massachusetts Bay Colony at age 22
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Anna (Prior) Jones, John Prior, Daniel Prior, Nathaniel Prior, Azariah Prior, Ezekiel Prior, Thankful (Prior) Chapin and Ebenezer Prior
2 CONT
2 CONT PARENTS
2 CONT
