1 NOTE Benjamin Eggleston II was born on 27 May 1687 at Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut. He married  Mary Dibble on 2 December 1708 and died 30 Oct 1732 (Will probated 24 Nov 1732). Mary Dibble was born on 22 July 1689 at Windsor, Hartfor
2 CONC d County, Connecticut, the daughter of Thomas Dibble and Mary Tucker. Mary's father, Thomas Dibble, was born on 3 September 1647 and her mother, Mary Tucker was born on 4 October 1653. Thomas Dibble married Mary Tucker on 10 Octob
2 CONC er 1676.  Benjamin Eggleston and Mary Dibble had ten children, all born at Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut.
2 CONT Benjamin Eggleston II (son of Benjamin Eggleston and Hannah Osborn) was born 27 Mar 1687 in Windsor, Hartford, CT, and died 30 Oct 1732. He married Mary Dibble on 2 Dec 1708, daughter of Thomas Dibble and Mary Tucker.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Benjamin Eggleston II and Mary Dibble:
2 CONT Marriage: 2 Dec 1708
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Benjamin Eggleston II and Mary Dibble are:
2 CONT i. +Abigail Eggleston, b. 21 Jun 1710, d. 17 Jun 1758.
2 CONT ii. Benjamin Eggleston III, b. 28 Sep 1713, d. 9 Aug 1733.
2 CONT iii. Joseph Eggleston, b. 12 Jul 1715, d. date unknown.
2 CONT iv. Joseph Eggleston, b. 9 Apr 1716, d. 9 May 1797.
2 CONT v. Mary Eggleston, b. 1 Feb 1717/18, d. 28 Jun 1761.
2 CONT vi. Hannah Eggleston, b. 9 Apr 1722, d. date unknown.
2 CONT vii. +Biggett Eggleston, b. 17 Mar 1723/24, Windsor, Hartford, CT, d. date unknown.
2 CONT viii. Abiah Eggleston, b. 29 Apr 1728, d. date unknown.
2 CONT ix. Sarah Eggleston, b. May 1753, d. date unknown.
2 CONT x. Rebecca Eggleston, d. 11 Oct 1718.
