2 CONT
2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT
2 CONT "<strong>OSBORNE, Sir Peter (1585-1654), of Chicksands Priory</strong>, Beds. and Castle Cornet, Guernsey - 
2 CONT *b.1585,[1] 1st son of Sir John Osborne of Ivy Lane, London and Chicksands, and Dorothy, daughter of Richard Barlee of Elsenham, Essex.[2] 
2 CONT *educ. Emmanuel, Cambridge 1603;[3] 
2 CONT *embassy, Madrid 1617.[4] 
2 CONT *marriage settlement 14 Nov. 1614,[5] Dorothy (d.1650), daughter of Sir John Danvers of Dauntsey, Wiltshire, 8 sons (5 d.v.p.) 4 daughter [6] 
2 CONT *knighted 7 Jan. 1611;[7] 
2 CONT *succeeded father 1628.[8] 
2 CONT *buried 13 Mar. 1654.
2 CONT
2 CONT === Offices Held ===
2 CONT * Lt.-gov. Guernsey 1621-46.
2 CONT * Treas.’s remembrancer, Exch. 1628-42.
2 CONT *Justice of the Peace, Bedfordshire 1630-?43, 
2 CONT *Commissioner oyer and terminer, Norfolk circuit 1630-42, 
2 CONT *Bedfordshire 1640, 
2 CONT *Commissioner of sewers 1636, 
2 CONT *Commissioner of assessment 1641-2, 
2 CONT *Commissioner of array 1642."
2 CONT
