2 CONT LCX8-XRF
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Isaac
2 CONT
2 CONT When Isaac Pease II was born on 2 May 1693, in Enfield, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Isaac Pease, was 20 and his mother, Mindwell Osborn, was 20. He married Amy Ann French on 8 November 1722, in 
2 CONC Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 7 daughters. He died on 8 March 1757, in Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 
2 CONC 63, and was buried in Enfield Street Cemetery, Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut, United States.
2 CONT
