2 CONT Abraham Pease was born 2 Nov 1695 in Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut to Isaac Pease and Mindwell (Osborn) Pease. He is the brother of Isaac Pease, Mindwell (Pease) Bull, Abigail Pease, Israel Pease, Ann (Pease) Prior, Benjamin Peas
2 CONC e, Ezekiel Pease, Timothy Pease and	Cummings Pease
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Mary (Booth) Pease — married 1719 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Abigail (Warriner) Pease — married 28 Aug 1733 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT His children are Mary (Pease) Lord, John Pease, Abraham Pease, Moses Pease, Lemuel Pease, Samuel Pease, Joel Pease, Nathan Pease, Desire (Pease) Parsons, Gideon Pease, William Pease and Zebulon Pease Abraham died on  2 Jun 1750 in
2 CONC  Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut Profile manager: Tayler Mccormick  Profile last modified 3 Dec 2018 | Created 10 Jul 2013
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham Pease was born in 1695. He was the son of Isaac and Mindwell Pease. He married firstly Mary Booth on 3 December 1719. They had 4 children. He married secondly Abigail Warner. They had 10 children. Intention of Marriage - M
2 CONC assachusetts, Springfield Vital Records: Name	Abraham Pease Marriage: 03 Aug 1733 Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts Gender	Male Spouse's Name	Abigail Warner Actual Marriage - Massachusetts, Springfield Vital Records:
2 CONT
2 CONT Name	Abraham Pease Marriage: 28 Aug 1733 Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts Gender	Male Spouse's Name	Abigail Warner He passed away in 1750 at the age of 55.
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Enfield Street Cemetery, Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT
