2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Israel Pease was born in 1702 in Enfield CT son of Isaac Pease and Mindwell Osborn [1] He married Sarah Booth,[2] the sister of his brother Abraham's wife and had 10 children. Died in 1771[3] and buried in Enfield,[4]
