2 CONC My Estate, which is but Small, this is my will; My house and land after my decease I give to my son Benjamin, he being the staff of my age, on this condition, that he shall maintaine his Mother during her life and pay my Debts. An
2 CONC d in case yt my son Joseph should come and demand a portion, his brother shall pay him forty shi llings as he is able with conveniency. Also to my son James and my son Samuel & my son Thomas , And Daughters Mary, Sarah & Abagail, 
2 CONC to eyther of these three shillings apiece. All ye rest of my estate I give to my son Benjamin, and doo make him my exsequitor.
2 CONT
