1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth Gibbs was the wife of John Osborn[e] (1670-1740) and not the wife of Israel Boardman (1697-1725).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources are available in the bibligraphical note which you can find here:
2 CONT https://osborne-origins.org/linkrecs/f7883.htm#R7895
2 CONT
2 CONT Israel Boardman was 27 years younger. She has been incorrectly linked as his wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the book "Search for the Passengers of the Mary & John, 1630" (page 36), the wife of Israel Boardman (1697-1725) was born on 08/26/1697.
2 CONT - Info provided by Maria Mikaelyan, Ph.D. 11/8/2022
