2 CONC ohn, 1789-1838; Dexter, O. P. (Orrando Perry), 1854-1903. (Publication date 1860-62).  Page 324.  <[https://archive.org/details/genealogicaldic03savarich/page/325/mode/1up?view=theater Archive.Org]>
