2 CONT *''' No Extant Record.''' His date of death is ''Not'' known.
2 CONT * '''He is ''Not'' Nathaniel Owen of Braintree,''' which this [https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LCZ2-T2Y/nathaniel-owen-1655-1733 FamilySearch Bio] represents or https://www.geni.com/people/Nathaniel-Owen/6000000206761731473 
2 CONC on Geni.
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Birth
2 CONT * Entry for Nathanel Owen and John, 9 August 1656. – "Connecticut, Vital Records, Prior to 1850", [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:QP4Y-DJRK FamilySearch] (pub. Wed Mar 06 09:44:54 UTC 2024), Entry for Nathanel Owen an
2 CONC d John, 9 August 1656.
2 CONT * Phelps, Noah Amherst.1845. ''History of Simsbury, Granby, and Canton: From 1642 to 1845''. Hartford, Connecticut: Case, Tiffany and Burnham. [https://www.google.com/books/edition/History_of_Simsbury_Granby_and_Canton/ZmZZAAAAcAA
2 CONC J?hl=en&gbpv=1&pg=PA171&printsec=frontcover Google Books].
2 CONT * Welles, Edwin Stanley ed. 1898. ''Births, Marriages, and Deaths Returned from Hartford, Windsor, and Fairfield, and Entered in the Early Land Records of the Colony of Connecticut'': Volumes I and II of Land Records and No. D of 
2 CONC Colonial Deeds. Hartford, Connecticut: Case, Lockwood & Brainard. [https://www.google.com/books/edition/Births_Marriages_and_Deaths_Returned_fro/0woWAAAAYAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&pg=PA40&printsec=frontcover Google Books].
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Marriages
2 CONT * Torrey, Clarence Almon. New England Marriages Prior to 1700. [https://www.ancestry.com/sharing/29375024?h=623da5&ranMID=50138&ranEAID=4026539&ranSiteID=Xib7NfnK11s-gjRu2sRQxvDd2Sv9obWAUg&o_xid=0004026539&o_lid=0004026539&o_sch=A
2 CONC ffiliate%20External Ancestry.com]
2 CONT ** OWEN, Nathaniel (1656– ) & 1/wf Mary GAYLORD ( -1696); 14 Jun 1694; Windsor, CT
2 CONT ** OWEN, Nathaniel & 2/wf Sarah PALMER (1675-1731); 2 Feb 1697 (not 22 Feb 1697/8): Windsor, CT
2 CONT *** https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:QP4Y-DJR5
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Book
2 CONT * Owen, Ralph Albert Dornfeld. 1891. ''Descendants of John Owen of Windsor, Connecticut (1622-1699): A Genealogy.'' Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. Owen Family Association. [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=wu.89069617892&view=1
2 CONC up&seq=30&skin=2021 Babel.HathiTrust.org]:—
2 CONT ** NATHANIEL OWEN2 (John1), was born 9 Aug. 1656 at Windsor, Conn. and probably died there. He married (1) 14 June 1694 at Windsor, MARY GAYLORD, who died 23 Jan. 1696; and (2) 22 Feb. 1698 at Windsor, SARAH PALMER, who was born 1
2 CONC 2 April 1675 and died 25 April 1731, daughter of Timothy and Hannah (Buell) Palmer.
2 CONT ** '''Children by second wife born at Windsor:''' 
2 CONT *** i. HANNAH, b. March 1699, baptized 11 Nov. 1699 at Simsbury. 
2 CONT *** ii. SARAH, b. 3 May 1700; m. 29 Sept. 1737 to Nathaniel Gillett, son of Jonathan (?); a son, Samuel, b. 7 Nov. 1754. "They moved to Westfield" (Stiles).
2 CONT *** iii. NATHANIEL, b. 31 Dec. 1702.
2 CONT *** iv. ANNE, b. 17 July 1705; prob. d. yg.
2 CONT *** v. ABNER, b. 17 Mar. 1707; d. 1709
2 CONT *** vi. ANNE, b. 3 July 1709
2 CONT **** Auth.: H. R. Stiles, VoL. II, D. 209; W. A. Owen, N.. E. H. G. R., Vol. 88, p. 41.
