1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sgt Samull “Samuel” Clark BIRTH	10 Nov 1688, Suffield, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA DEATH	10 Nov 1749 (aged 61) BURIAL	East Granby Cemetery, East Granby, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA, MEMORIAL ID 58875128
2 CONT
2 CONT Photos added by CroBear
2 CONT
2 CONT Clark, Sargent Samull - d. 10 Nov 1749, age 61.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Samuel and Mehitable (Thrall) Clark. He was married abt. 1715 to Abigail Owen who was born 8 Dec 1741 in Simsbury. She was the daughter of Josiah and Mary (Osborn) Owen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Descendants of John Owen of Windsor, Connecticut, p. 30
2 CONT
2 CONT The family Clark monument in West Suffield Cemetery (#127423512) provides his death date as 6 Nov 1749
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents	 Samuel Clark, 1661–1736 Mehitable Thrall Clarke, 1664–1723
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings Ann Clarke Foote, 1687–1726	 David Clark, 1695–1777
2 CONT
2 CONT Children	 PhotoAnn Clark Higley, 1729 – unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/58875128/samull-clark
