2 CONT
2 CONT *  Title: The Clark genealogy; some descendents of Daniel Clark, of Windsor, Conn., 1639-1913 (1913)
2 CONT * Author: Walton, Emma Lee, b. 1874
2 CONT * Subject: Clark, Daniel, 1622-1710; Clark family
2 CONT * Publisher: New York, Frank Allaben genealogical company
2 CONT * Possible copyright status: NOT_IN_COPYRIGHT
2 CONT * Language: English
2 CONT * Call number: 1114500
2 CONT * Digitizing sponsor: Boston Public Library
2 CONT * Book contributor: Boston Public Library
2 CONT * Collection: bostonpubliclibrary; americana
2 CONT * Full catalog record: MARCXML
2 CONT
2 CONT 40 Samuel Clark (Samuel 2, Daniel 1), born Nov. 10, 1688; died Nov. 6, 1749; married Abigail Owen, 
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter of Josiah Owen, born Dec. 8, 1681. Simsbury, Ct. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 110 i Joel, born March 19, 1717; died Oct. 5, 1777; married April 7, 1742, Lydia Forbes,
2 CONT
2 CONT 111 ii Abigail, born May 5, 1719. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 112 iii '''Samuel''', born Dec. 15, 1720; died June 14, 1807; married Nov. 3, 1748, Eunice Lyman. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 113 iv Hannah, born May 5, 1723; married March 24, 1744, Charles Thrall. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 114 v David, born July 17, 1725 ; died Oct. 26, 1819; married, 1749, Rachel Moore. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 115 vi Ann, born July 1, 1729; died Jan. 5, 1741. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 59
2 CONT
2 CONT 112 '''Samuel Clark''' (Samuel 3, Samuel 2, Daniel 1),  born Dec. 15, 1720; died June 14, 1807; married (1)  Nov. 30, 1748, Eunice Lyman, daughter of Joseph and  Abigail (Lewis) Lyman, born May 30, 1728, and died  April 23, 1785; 
2 CONC (2) Mary Minot, who died Oct. 31, 1816.  Hartford, Conn., and Northampton, Mass., and Hatfield,  Mass. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 231 i Joseph, born Oct. 8, 1749; died Dec. 18, 1828; married (1) Anna Barnard; (2) Lydia  Cook. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 232 ii Richard, born Nov. 7, 1751 ; killed at Ticonderoga Sept. 11, 1776. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 233 iii Thomas, born Xov. 13, 1753; died young. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 234 iv Susannah, born Feb. 7, 1756; died Feb. 15, 1806. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 235 v Samuel, born July 2, 1758; died July 10, 1847, married (1) Jerusha Phillips; (2) Lucretia Sheldon. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 236 vi Thomas, born April 2, 1761 ; died Jan. 25, 1840; married Lucinda Birge. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 237 vii Mercy, born Nov. 26, 1763; married Edward Yeamons. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 238 viii Eunice, born July 20, 1766; died May 8, 1843; married Ebenezer Parsons. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 239 ix Henry, born Jan. 5, 1768-9; married Polly Pitt. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Stiles' Windsor, Appendix, Miss Anna B. Clarke,  Northampton.) 
2 CONT
