1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary, daughter of Thomas Dibble Jr & Mary Tucker, was born on July 22, 1689 and married Benjamin Eggleston, Jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin Eggleston was born on May 27, 1687 at Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut and died on October 30, 1732. His will was probated on November 24, 1732. He married Mary Dibble on December 2, 1708. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin Eggleston and Mary Dibble had ten children, all born at Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut.
2 CONT # Abigail Eggleston was born on June 21, 1710 and died on 17 June 17, 1758 at Windsor, Connecticut. She married Isaac Bancroft on December 17, 1741.
2 CONT # Benjamin Eggleston, III was born on September 28, 1713 and died on August 9, 1733 at Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut.
2 CONT # Joseph Eggleston was born on July 12, 1715 and died young.
2 CONT # Joseph Eggleston was born on April 9, 1716 and died on May 9, 1797 at Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut. He probably married widow Hannah Blodget. They lived at East Windsor.
2 CONT # Rebecca Eggleston was born in 1717 and died on October 11, 1718.
2 CONT # Mary Eggleston was born on February 1, 1718 and died on June 28, 1761. She married Daniel Roberts.
2 CONT # Hannah Eggleston was born on April 9, 1722. She married Joseph Pierce.
2 CONT # Biggett Eggleston was born on 12 March 12, 1724 at Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut. He married Mary Corning of Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut on November 7, 1743. See below.
2 CONT # Abiah Eggleston was born on April 29, 1728.
2 CONT # Sarah Eggleston was born on November 25, 1730 and died on October 30, 1741
2 CONT
