2 CONT   Mary Dibble was born on 22 July 1689 at Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, the daughter of Thomas Dibble and Mary Tucker. Mary's father, Thomas Dibble, was born on 3 September 1647 and her mother, Mary Tucker was born on 4 O
2 CONC ctober 1653. Thomas Dibble married Mary Tucker on 10 October 1676.  Benjamin Eggleston and Mary Dibble had ten children, all born at Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut.
