2 CONT ===John Brooks 
2 CONT * born say 1618 
2 CONT * died  3 September 1682
2 CONT
2 CONT He married (1), 25 May 1652 at Windsor (both of W., also rec. Springfield, Massachusetts), Susanna Hanmore, with whom he had 8 children.7,8 "He bo't the N. part of the Hubbard lot on Backer Row, abt. 1655, built and was res. there
2 CONC  1668…."6,9 In 1667 and 1669 Dr. John Winthrop treated Susan Brooks, wife of John of Winsor.10 John was a head of household at Windsor, 1670.11 
2 CONT
2 CONT John's wife Susanna died at Windsor 7 Nov 1676.13,14 He removed to Simsbury, and married a second time, perhaps to Elizabeth Hayden.15,16 John Brooks, inhabitant of Simsbury, was complained of for ill-treating this 2nd wife. After
2 CONC  the selectmen intervened to remove her from his home, he applied to the Governor and Magistrates in the County Court.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died at Simsbury 3 Sep 1682.19,20 The inventory of his estate, taken by John Case, Thomas Barber and Peter Buell and presented the same month, was £199-08-09. His living children were named21, and administration was granted to 
2 CONC son-in-law John Peirce, who presented the inventory, and Thomas Barber.19,22 6 Mar 1684, "the administrator of John Brookes estate being departed, & the estate being in a wasteing state, none to look after it," the court granted a
2 CONC dministration to John Higley.19 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Brooks and Susannah Hanmore
2 CONT #John Brooks1,3 b. 16 Mar 1660, d. 1674
2 CONT # Samuel Brooks+1,3 b. 6 Sep 1662, d. c 1723
2 CONT #Elizabeth Brooks1,3 b. 27 Jun 1664, d. date unknown
2 CONT #Mary Brooks1,3 b. 21 Mar 1665, d. 3 Aug 1690
2 CONT #Joanna Brooks1,3 b. 2 Feb 1668, d. date unknown
2 CONT #Marcy Brooks1,3 b. 25 Nov 1670, d. date unknown
2 CONT # Lydia Brooks+1,6,3 b. 7 Aug 1673, d. 7 May 1747
2 CONT #Susannah Brooks1,3 b. 22 Sep 1675, d. c 1721
2 CONT
