1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lydia/2g Brooks, born 7 Aug 1673 at Windsor, Connecticut1,2, was mentioned (a. 10) in her father's inventory, Sep 1682.3,4 She married, by 1689, Nathaniel/3 Cook Jr. of Windsor, son of Nathaniel/2 Cook and Lydia/2 
