1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anne, daughter of Dr. John Blythe and his wife Alice Cheke (sister of Sir John Cheke). She married Peter Osborne (1521 - 1592), second son of Richard Osborne, citizen and Grocer of London (died 1544), and his wife 
2 CONC Elizabeth (née Coke), of Tyle or Tyled Hall, Latchingdon, Essex.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had eleven sons and eleven daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
