2 CONT Note from Bill Lyman: Dr. Elias Loomis records that he d. Jan. 2, 1763; but the following appeared in the "Hartford Courant." on Dec. 9, 1783: "On Friday last. (Dec. 5), as Mr. Benjamin Loomis was chopping wood at his door, he was
2 CONC  seiged with a fit which instantly put a period to this mortal state, in the 87th year of his age. Windsor, Conn."  No other Benjamin appears who so nearly complies with these dates, as No. 130 above. But was it he? See Burke Gen.
2 CONC , p. 172.
