2 CONT *   Wife: Elizabeth Wild Born:                  at:     Died: AFT 1718   Father:John Wild  Mother:Priscilla Gould<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT From [https://www.werelate.org/wiki/Transcript:Savage%2C_James._Genealogical_Dictionary_of_the_First_Settlers_of_New_England/v2p560 Savage] <br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT BENJAMIN, Gloucester, s. of Thomas, m. 22 Jan. 1678, Elizabeth Wills, says Babson, wh. adds, they had four ch. there, but he does not name them, and only says, none of the fam. were there aft. 1686.
2 CONT
2 CONT CHILDREN
2 CONT
