2 CONT *  Name: Pricilla Jones   Born: 10 JUN 1681      at: Gloucester, Essex Co., MA 2  Married: 13 JUN 1704      at:  2     Died:                  at:   Spouses: John Howard  
2 CONT *   Name: Benjamin Jones   Born: 1683             at: Gloucester, Essex Co., MA 3  Married: 1710             at:  4     Died: 5 FEB 1754       at: Somers CT 2  Spouses: Ann Prior  
2 CONT *   Name: Ebenezer Jones   Born: 17 APR 1684      at: Gloucester MA 2  Married:                  at:     Died:                  at:    Spouses: Mehitable Unknown  Elizabeth Unknown  Pricilla Smith  
2 CONT *   Name: Elizabeth Jones   Born: 26 JAN 1685/86   at: Gloucester, Essex Co., MA 2  Married: 8 SEP 1715       at:  2     Died:                  at:   Spouses: Isaac Osborn  
2 CONT *   Name: Ephriam Jones  Born: 31 JUL 1688      at: Enfield, Tolland Co., CT 2  Married:                 at:     Died: 3 SEP 1688       at:  2  Spouses: 
2 CONT *   Name: Samuel Jones   Born: 22 SEP 1690      at: Enfield, CT 2  Married:                  at:      Died: ABT 4 NOV 1691   at:  2  Spouses: 
2 CONT *   Name: Eleazer Jones Born: 12 APR 1693      at: Enfield, CT 3  Married: 10 DEC 1719      at:  3     Died: 20 APR 1755      at: Somers CT 3  Spouses: Mehitable Gary  
