2 CONC 3Q&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwigsrTIur3oAhXMV98KHaRZBgIQ6AEwB3oECAoQAQ#v=onepage&q=hannah%20Spencer%20jones%201630&f=false GoogleBooks]  (Marriage record)
