2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT <references />*<span id='Jones'></span> Jones, George Robert ''[[Space:Genealogy of the Jones Family|Genealogy of the Jones Family]]'' (Jones, Los Angeles, California, 1912), [https://archive.org/details/genealogyofjones00jone/pag
2 CONC e/6 p.6-7]
