2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/94090214/john-pease Find-A-Grave] Immigrated to America in 1639 with his Grandmother to join his father, Robert Pease, who had immigrated in 1634. Was one of the founders of Enfiel
2 CONC d, CT.
2 CONT
