2 CONT Brief Life History of Amy Ann
2 CONT
2 CONT When Amy Ann French was born on 6 May 1700, in Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Richard French Sr, was 23 and her mother, Elizabeth Fearing, was 20. She married Isaac Pease II on 8 Novem
2 CONC ber 1722, in Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 7 daughters. She died on 8 March 1757, in her hometown, at the age of 56.
