1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Genealogy of the descendants of Thomas Gleason of Watertown, Mass. 1607-1909
2 CONT Page 67 of 672: 131. JOB GLEASON, 4 (Isaac, 3 Isaac, 2 Thomas, 1) b. Jan 28, 1731; m. Feb. 28, 1754, Hannah Pease. Resided in Enfield.
2 CONT Children : All born in Enfield, Conn.
2 CONT 378. i. Job, b. Dec. 21, 1754.
2 CONT 379. ii. James, b. Nov. 4, 1756.
2 CONT 380. in. Hannah, b. Jan. 21, 1759; m. Thomas Ward.
2 CONT 381. iv. Elzie, b. Mch. 24, 1761.
2 CONT 382. v. Jane, b. Feb. 23, 1763.
2 CONT
2 CONT A genealogical and historical record of the descendants of John Pease, Sen., last of Enfield, Conn. by Rev. David Pease, Springfield, Mass. 1869.
2 CONT PART I - FOURTH GENERATION. page 20 of 568
2 CONT FAMILY OF EZEKIEL, 4
2 CONT 50.
2 CONT EZEKIEL PEASE,4 (Isaac,3 John,2 Robert,1) fifth son of Deacon Isaac and Mindwell (Osborn) Pease, and brother of the preceding, was born at Enfield, June 20, 1710; married Hannah Chandler, daughter of Henry Chandler, one of the ear
2 CONC ly settlers of Enfield, February 10, 1732. He was a man highly esteemed as a citizen and Christian; a man of prayer and consistent life. He was by occupation a tailor and school-teacher; — for some fifteen years Town Clerk, and wa
2 CONC s known by the title of " Master," and "Clerk" Pease. He settled in the eastern part of the town of Enfield, near "Scantic River;" died there, with his son Isaac, in 1799, aged 89. [Town and Family Records.]
2 CONT His children were:
2 CONT 158. 1. Hannah, b. at Enfield, January 11, 1733. m. Job Gleason. NFI.
2 CONT 159. 2. Ezekiel, b. at Enfield, August 18, 1734.*
2 CONT 160. 3. Abiah, b.at Enfield, August 11, 1736. m. Samuel Gowdy.
2 CONT 161. 4. Henry C., b. at Enfield February 11, 1738.* 
2 CONT 162. 5. Eleanor, b. at Enfield, March 15. 1741. m. Mr. Holt. 
2 CONT 163. 6. Jane, b. at Enfield, August 13, 1743. m. Obadiah Hurlburt.
2 CONT 164. 7. Mehitabel, b. at Enfield, September 23, 1745. m. Edward Parsons.
2 CONT 165. 8. Sarah, b. at Enfield, February 2, 1747. m. Jehiel Markham.
2 CONT 166. 9. Abigail, b. at Enfield, March 15, 1749.
2 CONT 167. 10. Isaac, b. at Enfield, June 1, 1752.*
2 CONT 168. 11. Oliver, b. at Enfield, September 6, 1754.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/80392387/hannah-gleason Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 20 2023, 23:07:3
2 CONC 0 UTC''
