2 CONT
2 CONT David was born in 1760. He is the son of Cummings Pease and Sarah Hale. [1] David married Jerusha Spencer 1783 at Somers where Jerusha was born, but the record of Marriage Banns is found in Branford Massachusetts[2] which may be o
2 CONC ne of the places he practiced medicine after the Revolutionary war. This David Pease is the Father of the Author of the Pease Genealogy referred to below. He last practiced at New Shoreham Rhode Island where he died 1803.
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Note: David and Jerusha's names appear in the Revolutionary war pension application index. More research is needed to confirm his service as described in the David Pease Genealogy. Help is invited.
