1 NOTE Children of Bygod Eggleston and Mary (Sarah) are:
2 CONT    i.   Mary Eggleston, born January 19, 1612/13 in St. Margaret's, Norwich.; died Unknown; married Edward Saunderson October 15, 1645 in Watertown, Massachusetts; died Unknown.
2 CONT   Notes for Mary Eggleston:
2 CONT Birth date is date of baptism.
2 CONT Her death has not been found. She may have returned to England.
2 CONT   Notes for Edward Saunderson:
2 CONT His and wife Mary's deaths have not been found. They may have returned to England.
2 CONT    ii.   James Eggleston, born Abt. 1620 in England; died December 01, 1679; married Hester Williams; died Unknown.
2 CONT   Notes for James Eggleston:
2 CONT James was a freeman in 1637 and he fought in the Pequot War, for which he was granted 50 acres in 1671. Came to America with his father Bigod.
2 CONT    iii.   Samuel Eggleston, born Abt. 1620 in England; died February 1690/91 in Connecticut; married Sarah Disbrough; died Unknown.
2 CONT   Notes for Samuel Eggleston:
2 CONT Possibly a twin.
2 CONT He came in 1630 with his father Bigod. In 1651 he beat the meetinghouse drums and was a freeman in 1655. He moved to Middletown, Connecticut. Estate: 105 pounds.
2 CONT    iv.   Thomas Eggleston, born August 26, 1638 in Windsor, Connecticut; died May 1697.
2 CONT   Notes for Thomas Eggleston:
2 CONT He was a freeman in 1658 and lived in E. Windsor on land bought from John Terry.
2 CONT    v.   Mary Eggleston, born May 29, 1641; died August 29, 1684 in Windsor, Connecticut; married John Denslow June 07, 1655 in Windsor, Connecticut; died Unknown.
2 CONT    vi.   Sarah Eggleston, born March 28, 1643 in Windsor, Connecticut; died July 18, 1713; married John Pettibone February 16, 1663/64 in Simsbury, Connecticut (Prob); died Unknown.
2 CONT   Notes for John Pettibone:
2 CONT First of his name to come to America.
2 CONT He perhaps came from Wales and may have been a soldier under Oliver Cromwell. Freeman-1658. Res; Simsbury, Conn. In 1876 his house was still in the possession of the Pettibone family.
2 CONT    vii.   Rebecca Eggleston, born December 08, 1644; died Unknown.
2 CONT    viii.   Abigail Eggleston, born June 12, 1648; died Unknown; married John Osborne, Jr. October 14, 1669; died Unknown.
2 CONT    ix.   Joseph Eggleston, born March 30, 1651; died Unknown.
2 CONT   Notes for Joseph Eggleston:
2 CONT 30 March 1651 is baptismal date.
2 CONT Moved to N. Stonington, Connecticut about 1670.
