2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Bigod EGGLESTON b: 20 FEB 1586 in Settringham,Yorkshire,England
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. Dorothy EGLESTON b: Abt 1588
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. Jane EGLESTON b: Abt 1590
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. Elizabeth EGLESTON b: Abt OCT 1592 c: 8 OCT 1592 in Settrington,Yorkshire,England
2 CONT
2 CONT    5. Janet EGLESTON c: 2 NOV 1595 in Settrington,Yorkshire,England
2 CONT
2 CONT    6. James EGLESTON b: Abt 1603 in Settrington,East Riding,England c: 19 JUN 1603 in Settrington,Yorkshire,England
