1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Jacob Gibbs'''
2 CONT * BIRTH	20 Mar 1629 - Exeter, City of Exeter, Devon, England
2 CONT * DEATH	18 Mar 1708 (aged 78) - Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL	Burial Details Unknown 
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID	54824493 · View Source
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/54824493/jacob-gibbs
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob Gibbs was born in 1629/1630 in Devon, Exeter, England. He was christened on 28 Mar 1629/1630 in St Sidwells, Exeter, England. He died on 18 Mar 1708/1709 in Hartford, Connecticut. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://www.gordongridley.us/genealogy/gridleylo/pafg876
2 CONT * http://wellsgenealogy.net/paf/pafg70.htm
2 CONT JACOB, 1st known child of Giles & Katheryn (Carwithe) Gibbs, was baptized St. Sidwell, Exeter, 28 March 1629/30. He married at Windsor 4 December 1657, Elizabeth Androus.
2 CONT Source: Anderson's Great Migration Begins.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married December 4, 1657 Windsor, Hartford CO CT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT * Ancient Windsor - The Gibbs Family.  "Jacob in 1651 was fined 40s for misdemeanor, and warned to expect more severe penalty in future; m. 04 Dec 1657 Elizabeth Andros."
