2 CONT *Birth:	September 13, 1672  Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, British America
2 CONT *Death:	1721 (48) Litchfield, Litchfield County, Connecticut, British America Colony
2 CONT *Daughter of Jacob Gibbs and Elizabeth Andrus / Andrews 
