2 CONT
2 CONT Deborah (Davis) Geer (1645 - 1736)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Deborah Geer formerly Davis===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born Jan 1645 in Yarmouth, Barnstable, Massachusetts
2 CONT
