2 CONT Sarah Palmer, the daughter of Timothy and Hannah Palmer, was born April 12, 1675, in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut. On February 22, 1697/8 she married Nathaniel Owen at Windsor. She died April 25, 1731.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Her birth and marriage are recorded in Ricker[2], on page 9574, with a marriage date of February 2, 1696. Her marriage is also rec
