1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====Birth Record====
2 CONT >"Connecticut Births and Christenings, 1649-1906" [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:F74M-F42 '''FamilySearch'''].
2 CONT >Name: Isaac Gillet – Sex: Male
