1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Mehitable Thrall===
2 CONT
2 CONT * Born Mar 1665 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT * Died 15 Aug 1723 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT * Daughter of Timothy Thrall and Deborah Gunn
2 CONT * Wife of Samuel Clark — married 6 Oct 1687 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===biography===
2 CONT Samuel Clark, of Windsor, Conn., was married to Mehitabel Thrall, daughter of Timothy Thrall, of the same town, 1687.  She was born in March 1664 and she died 15 Aug 1723, age 59.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Children, found on Record.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Samuel, b. 10 Nov 1688
2 CONT * David, b. 7 Apr 1696
2 CONT * Joseph, b. 13 Jul 1697
2 CONT * Nathaniel, b. 11 Oct  1699
2 CONT
