2 CONT 112 Samuel Clark (Samuel 3, Samuel 2, Daniel 1), born Dec. 15, 1720; died June 14, 1807; married (1) Nov. 30, 1748, Eunice Lyman, daughter of Joseph and Abigail (Lewis) Lyman, born May 30, 1728, and died April 23, 1785; (2) Mary M
2 CONC inot, who died Oct. 31, 1816. Hartford, Conn., and Northampton, Mass., and Hatfield, Mass.
2 CONT
2 CONT 231 i Joseph, born Oct. 8, 1749; died Dec. 18, 1828; married (1) Anna Barnard; (2) Lydia Cook.
2 CONT
2 CONT 232 ii Richard, born Nov. 7, 1751 ; killed at Ticonderoga Sept. 11, 1776.
2 CONT
2 CONT 233 iii Thomas, born Xov. 13, 1753; died young.
2 CONT
2 CONT 234 iv Susannah, born Feb. 7, 1756; died Feb. 15, 1806.
2 CONT
2 CONT 235 v Samuel, born July 2, 1758; died July 10, 1847, married (1) Jerusha Phillips; (2) Lucretia Sheldon.
2 CONT
2 CONT 236 vi Thomas, born April 2, 1761 ; died Jan. 25, 1840; married Lucinda Birge.
2 CONT
2 CONT 237 vii Mercy, born Nov. 26, 1763; married Edward Yeamons.
2 CONT
2 CONT 238 viii '''Eunice''', born July 20, 1766; died May 8, 1843; married Ebenezer Parsons.
2 CONT
2 CONT 239 ix Henry, born Jan. 5, 1768-9; married Polly Pitt.
2 CONT
2 CONT (Stiles' Windsor, Appendix, Miss Anna B. Clarke, Northampton.) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 85
2 CONT
2 CONT 238 '''Eunice Clark''' (Samuel 4, Samuel 3, Samuel 2,  Daniel 1), born July 21, 1766; died May 8, 1843; married Ebenezer Parsons. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 449 i Mary (Parsons), born Dec. 21, 1804; married Nathaniel Gorham. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 450 ii Susannah (Parsons), born Sept. 17, 1806; married James B. Porter. 
