1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.holcombegenealogy.com/g0/p95.htm#i4747
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Westover was born circa 1675. She was the daughter of Jonas Westover and Hannah Griswold. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Westover married Samuel Case, son of John Case and Sarah Spencer. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Westover died on 27 September 1713 at Simsbury, Hartford Co., CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary Westover and Samuel Case
2 CONT # Samuel Case Jr.+ b. 24 Jan 1695, d. 23 Sep 1768
2 CONT # Mary Case+ b. 15 Nov 1697, d. 12 Nov 1781
2 CONT # Hannah Case+ b. 30 Jan 1698/99, d. 10 Jan 1769
2 CONT # Mercy Case+ b. 12 Jan 1699/0, d. 1793
2 CONT # Abigail Case b. 21 Feb 1701/2, d. in infancy
2 CONT # Nathaniel Case+ b. 26 Apr 1702, d. 8 Jun 1753
2 CONT # Eunice Case+ b. Jul 1703
2 CONT # Caleb Case d. 10 May 1746
2 CONT # Jonas Case+ b. Aug 1704, d. 1744
2 CONT # Azrikrim Case b. 16 Feb 1709
2 CONT # Benjamin Case+ d. 19 Feb 1798
2 CONT # Pelatiah Case d. 1733
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
