1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Alford/6000000022321064499
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Mary Case
2 CONT * Born 15 Nov 1697 in Simsbury, Hartford, Connecticut Colony
2 CONT * Died 12 Nov 1781 at age 83 in Turkey Hill, Now Granby, Connecticut, United States 
2 CONT * Buried Simsbury Cemetery, Simsbury, Hartford County, Connecticut (no tombstone image) 
2 CONT * Daughter of Samuel Case and Mary (Westover) Case
2 CONT * Wife of John Drake IV (1688-1725) — married 20 Apr 1721 in Connecticut 
2 CONT * Wife of Josiah Alvord (d. 1768)  — married 20 Oct 1726 in Simsbury, Hartford, Connecticut Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.holcombegenealogy.com/g0/p259.htm#i12907
2 CONT
2 CONT Don Barber notes an error in his book. Thomas Barber married Mercy/Marcy. Mary Barber, Mercy's sister, married John Drake and then Josiah Alford. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Case was born on 15 November 1697 at Simsbury, Hartford Co., CT.2 She was the daughter of Samuel Case and Mary Westover. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Case was baptized on 21 November 1697 at Simsbury, Hartford Co., CT.2,3 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John Drake, son of John Drake and Mary Watson, on 20 April 1721 at Simsbury, Hartford Co., CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Case married Josiah Alford, son of Josiah Alford and Hannah Westover, on 20 October 1726 at Simsbury, Hartford Co., CT. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Case died on 12 November 1781 at East Granby, Hartford Co., CT, at age 83.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary Case and John Drake
2 CONT # Mary Drake b. 4 Feb 1722
2 CONT # Hannah Drake b. 8 Feb 1724, d. Oct 1724
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary Case and Josiah Alford
2 CONT # Josiah Alford b. 13 Aug 1727, d. 22 Feb 1808
2 CONT # Hannah Alford b. 2 Apr 1730
2 CONT # Elijah Alford b. 14 Dec 1732, d. 16 Jan 1771
2 CONT # Eunice Alford b. 29 Oct 1735
2 CONT # Pelatiah Alford b. 14 Apr 1739
2 CONT # Jesse Alford b. Sep 1741, d. 4 Jun 1783
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # Josiah Alvord in Connecticut, U.S., Town Birth Records, pre-1870 (Barbour Collection).  (Simsbury Vital Records) Page 35.  < [https://www.ancestry.com/sharing/7361576?mark=7b22746f6b656e223a223130432f7163546543635366776841504e61
2 CONC 305672545161616478396f623369694e6c7763462b794b446f3d222c22746f6b656e5f76657273696f6e223a225632227d AncestrySharing] > “Alvord … Alford.  Josiah, s. Josiah [& Hanah] b. Dec. 27, 1696.  … Josiah m. Mary DRAKE, alias Mary CASE, Oct. 
2 CONC 20, 1726. … Josiah, d. [ ], 1768.”
2 CONT #https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/202542917/mary-alford
2 CONT # https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Case-87 “She m. her first cousins, Josiah Alvord.” Cites 
