2 CONC 1&filterQuery= AmericanAncestors] > Samuel Case (1667-?) married Mary Westover. They “had a daughter Mary Case (1697-?) In 1726 Mary married her cousin, Josiah Alford (1647-1722). [??] … As mentioned, there are many Alfords. …”
