1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Simsbury Vital Records [NEHGS], in Connecticut, United States. ''The Barbour Collection of Connecticut Town Vital Records'', 28.
2 CONT >"Case, … Eliezer, s. Samuel, b. Nov. 6, [____] [LR1-A:6]" — Year 1703 "estimate based on dates of births of siblings." [https://www.werelate.org/wiki/Person:Eleazer_Case_%281%29 WeRelate.org]
2 CONT
2 CONT I disagree on the year of his birth being 1703. Eunice was born on 8 Jul 1703. Jonas was born in Aug 1704. I estimate his birth to to have been about 6 Nov 1705. He probably died in infancy. No further record. — (Ken Shelley, 8 Ja
2 CONC n 2025)
