1 NAME John /Case/
2 GIVN John
2 SURN Case
2 _MARNM Case
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Hopmeadow Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 CITY Simsbury
3 STAE Connecticut
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE 5 NOV 1662
2 ADDR
3 CITY Windsor
3 STAE Connecticut
1 DEAT
2 DATE 22 MAY 1733
2 ADDR
3 CITY Simsbury
3 STAE Connecticut
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.holcombegenealogy.com/g0/p41.htm#i2040
2 CONT
2 CONT John Case was born on 5 November 1662 at Windsor, Hartford Co., CT.3,4 He was the son of John Case and Sarah Spencer. John Case married Mary Olcott, daughter of Thomas Olcott Jr. and Mary (?), on 12 September 1684 at Simsbury, Har
2 CONC tford Co., CT.5 John Case married Sarah Holcombe, daughter of Joshua Holcombe and Ruth Sherwood, in 1693. John Case died on 22 May 1733 at Simsbury, Hartford Co., CT, at age 70.4 
2 CONT
2 CONT John moved with his family to Simsbury when he was seven years old. With the exception of one year spent in Windsor during the King Philip War, John lived all his life in Simsbury and died there. He is buried in the Simsbury cemet
2 CONC ery next to his mother. He lived and worked on his fahter's farm at Weatogue until he married at age 22. (Charles Case, p. 116)
2 CONT
2 CONT John's wife Mary and their son John both died in 1685, presumably at childbirth.
2 CONT
2 CONT For a numbr of years after the death of Mary and John, he remained single farming his property on Bissell Brook and living on his home lot nearby, acquiring additional lands.
2 CONT
2 CONT Two years after his mother died, John married Sarah, and within a span of ten years, John and Sarah had six children.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Updated 29 October 2023''.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children are listed in Goodwin and Savage's Genealogical Dictionary.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of John Case and Mary Olcott:
2 CONT # John Case b. 6 Aug 1685, d. young
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Case and Sarah Holcomb:
2 CONT # John Case+ b. 22 Aug 1694, d. 2 Dec 1752. Married Abigail Humphrey,   
2 CONT # Sgt. Daniel Case+ b. 7 Mar 1695/96, d. 28 May 1733. Married Penelope Buttolph.  
2 CONT # Mary Case b. 1698, d. 1732.  Married Josiah Alford.
2 CONT # Sarah Case+ b. 14 May 1699, d. 5 Oct 1750.  Married John Alderman.
