2 CONT John Case was buried in the Simsbury Cemetery, Simsbury, Hartford County, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT John Case 2d
2 CONT Died May 24
2 CONT 1733-Aged 74-
2 CONT [Years] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Based on his recorded date of birth, on the day John Case, Jr. died he was 70 years old, and Ætatis suæ (i.e., Æ, "Aged," in the XX year of his Age) 71, not 74 as inscribed.
