1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Case-231
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail Case, youngest daughter of John Case, was born 4 May 1682.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jonah Westover, Jr. on Sept 1, 1701. Jonah Westover died June 3, 1714. His widow died ____ [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Dermot lists her death as June 14, 1714.[2] This is the date listed by Goodwin for her husband's death. They probably did not die on the same day.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT # Nathaniel born about 1704
2 CONT # Jonah born about 1709
2 CONT # John born about 1712
2 CONT # Abigail born about 1714.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Case-231
2 CONT # Goodwin, Nathaniel. Genealogical Notes: or, Contributions to the Family History of Some of the First Settlers of Connecticut and Massachusetts (Google eBook p 300 & ). F.A. Brown, 1856
2 CONT # Dermot, Henry Sage. Some Descendants of John Case of Simsbury, Connecticut 1656-1909. Albany, 1909
2 CONT # CASE lineage https://www.wikitree.com/photo.php/f/f2/Case-280.jpg
