2 CONT
2 CONT ===Thomas Root
2 CONT * Gender 	Male
2 CONT * Birth[1] 	Abt 1648 	Farmington, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT * Alt Birth? 	18 May 1655 	Farmington, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT * Parents:    John Roote (1608 - 1684) and  Mary Kilbourne (abt 1619 - 1697) m. abt 1640
2 CONT * Marriage 	Oct 1670 	Westfield, Hampden, Massachusetts - to Mary Gridley
2 CONT * Marriage 	7 Oct 1675 	Westfield, Hampden, Massachusetts - to Mary Spencer
2 CONT * Marriage 	25 Jan 1691/92 	Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts - to Sarah Dumbleton
2 CONT * Death[2][3] 	16 Aug 1709 	Westfield, Hampden, Massachusetts
2 CONT * Burial[2] 		North Cemetery, Somers, Tolland, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT Root, James Pierce. Root Genealogical Records, 1600-1870: Comprising the General History of the Root and Roots Families in America. (New York: R.C. Root, Anthony & Co., 1870), 318-319.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Roote, son of John Sen., of Farmington, Ct., b. a. 1648, in Farmington, Ct. He removed from Farmington, Ct., to Westfield, Mass., with his brothers John and Samuel. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. (1) 1670, Mary Gridley. She d. 1673. 
2 CONT He m. (2) Oct. 7, 1675, Mary Spencer. She d. Nov. 4, 1690. 
2 CONT He m. (3) Jan. 25, 1692, Sarah, widow of Josiah Leonard, and dau. of John Dumbleton. She d. Jan. 3, 1694. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He d. Aug. 16, 1709. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT (By first marriage.)
2 CONT #     I. Thomas, b. Sept. 1, 1671 ; d. Feb. 25, 1689, ae. 17.
2 CONT #     II. Mary, b. Oct. 21, 1673; m. Dec. 12, 1700, Isaac Meecham.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT (By second marriage.)
2 CONT #     III. John, b. Dec. 25, 1676, f. ; d. Oct. 1, 1744, ae. 67.
2 CONT #     IV. Samuel, b. Feb. 16, 1679, f. ; d. Dec. 8, 1712, ae. 33.
2 CONT #     V. Elizabeth, b. Feb. 16, 1681 ; m. Dec. 20, 1705, Nathaniel, son of Nathaniel and Hannah (Williams) Bancroft, b. Sept. 23, 1680. She d. Jan. 10, 1706.
2 CONT #     VI. Sarah, b. July 27, 1683 ; m. ____ Wright.
2 CONT #     VII. Timothy, b. Dec. 3, 1685, f. ; d. Nov. 2, 1743.
2 CONT #     VIII. Joseph, b. June 16, 1688, f ; d. Feb. 10, 1750, ae. 61.
2 CONT
2 CONT (By third marriage.)
2 CONT #     IX. Thankful, [twin] b. Nov. 12, 1693.
2 CONT #     X. Mercy, [twin] b. Nov. 12, 1693 ; prob. d. young, as she is not mentioned in her father's will.
2 CONT
