2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Martin Root was born in Massachusetts in 1784. He moved to Benson, Vermont where he met
2 CONT Abigail. They married in 1814. By 1821 they had six children, Emily, Maria, James, Amos, and
2 CONT twins Elijah and Elisha. By 1843, the family decided to move west to Lisle where land was still
2 CONT available for a good price. Buried here in the Main Street Cemetery along with Martin are his
2 CONT wife Abigail Stearns Root, son Amos and three grandchildren, Albert, James, and Helen. The
2 CONT grandchildren were the children of Elijah.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/11500034/martin-root Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 29 2021, 16:11:44 UTC''
