1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 12th child of Amos Root and Azubah Hubbard
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=21951481-1-324&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-c285e03816893f750cd255a225a6ba7c&mrid=8548e9340f976df2e7ea888ed52a6401 MyHerit
2 CONC age Family Trees] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''May 19 2016, 3:08:18 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth was the twelfth of fourteen children born to Amos Root and his second wife Azubah Hubbard. She and her siblings were the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1)  Lucy Root (1765-?), who married Nathaniel Torrey;
2 CONT 2)  Rhoda Root (1766-1859), who married Jonathan Taylor;
2 CONT 3)  Justin Root ((1766-?) - lost at sea, who married Cassandra Flower;
2 CONT 4)  Naomi Root (1769-1772), who married John Turner;
2 CONT 5)  Irene Root (1771-1857), who married Elias Baker;
2 CONT 6)  Azubah Root (1771-?);
2 CONT 7)  Silas Root (1774-1867), whose first wife was Mary Polly Bostwick, and whose second wife was Electa Bushnell;
2 CONT 8)  Elijah Root (1775-1809), who married Lola Cook Bogue;
2 CONT 9)  Desire Root (1776-?), who married Lewis Wilkinson;
2 CONT 10) Ashley Root (1778-1780);
2 CONT 11) Martin Root (1783-?), who married Abigail Stearns;
2 CONT 12) Elizabeth Root (1785-1858), who married Joel Gibbs;
2 CONT 13) Ashley Root (1787-1787) - twin to Abigail;
2 CONT 14) Abigail Root (1787-1787) - twin to Ashley. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth also had two half-siblings who were the children of her father Amos Root and his first wife Abigail Sheldon:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1)  Amos Root (1757-1813), whose first wife was Anna Baker, and whose second wife was Sarah Hichock;
2 CONT 2)  Abigail Root (1758-?) - died young; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Amos Root had no known children by his third wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married Joel Gibbs in Benson, Rutland County, Vermont on February 11, 1810.  They were the parents of ten children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1)  Edwin Gibbs (1810-1874), who married Caroline Coats;
2 CONT 2)  Melvin Gibbs (1812-1891), whose first wife was Mary E. Benson, and whose second wife was Clarissa A. Crowell;
2 CONT 3)  Orren Alexander Gibbs (1814-1887), who married Elizabeth Watts;
2 CONT 4)  Sabin Gibbs (1817-1817);
2 CONT 5)  Harriet Gibbs (1818-1875), who married Daniel Bradley;
2 CONT 6)  Elizabeth Gibbs (1820-1858, who married Ranson J. Beldin;
2 CONT 7)  Azubah Gibbs (1821-1898), who married Allen Leet:
2 CONT 8)  Sabin Gibbs (1823-1905), whose first wife was Harriet Watts, and whose second wife was Adaline C. (Black) Hewes;
2 CONT 9)  Ozell Gibbs (1825-1872), who married Sarah _______;
2 CONT 10) Ami D. Gibbs (1828-1887), who married Aradell Worden.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/68774831/elizabeth-gibbs Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 14 2023,
2 CONC  0:19:35 UTC''
