1 NOTE {geni:about_me} from:  https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/130426646/elizabeth-old 
2 CONT
2 CONT "Elizabeth Atchinson Old BIRTH:	22 Apr 1672 Hatfield, Hampshire County, Massachusetts, USA DEATH:	8 Mar 1699 (aged 26) Springfield, Hampden County, Massachusetts, USA BURIAL:	Unknown MEMORIAL ID:	130426646 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1st husband:  Daniel Lamb and Elizabeth Atchinson were married on June 12, 1690 in Springfield, Mass. Their child:   John Lamb born March 28, 1691 in Springfield, Mass.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd husband:  Robert Old and Elizabeth Atchinson were married on January 28, 1696 in Springfield, Mass. Their Children born in Sprinfield, Mass:  Jonathan Old born November 30, 1697 &  Elizabeth Old born March 19, 1698.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members: Parents: John Atchinson 1636–1677, Deliverence Mason Atchinson 1647–1704. Spouse: Daniel Lamb 1666–1691 (married in the year of 1690).
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings: Mercy Atchinson Rust 1673–1754, John Atchinson 1676–1738, Benoni Atchinson 1677–1704. Children:	 John Lamb 1691–1749,	 Elizabeth Old Ball 1698 – unknown.".
