2 CONT * Reference: [https://old.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=41559408 Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 13 2018, 9:34:00 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Zadock Hitchcock, son of Joseph Hitchcock and Mary Burt, was born 26 August 1767 in Brimfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay, British Colonial America. See Hitchcock Book, pages 228 and 257. [1] [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT On 30 September 1794 in Rockingham, Windham, Vermont, Zadock Hitchcock married Bulah Stearns. [1] [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a soldier in Shay's Rebillion under Capt Joseph Hoar and was one of the early settlers in Westminster, Windham, Vermont and a farmer. He also carried the mail for many years between Westminster and Saxton's River. See Hitch
2 CONC cock Book, page 257. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Zadock and Bulah were the parents of 14 children including triplets (all born in Westminster):
2 CONT
2 CONT Randilla Hitchcock
2 CONT Derexa Hitchcock
2 CONT Sally Hitchcock
2 CONT Abigail Hitchcock
2 CONT Persia Hitchcock
2 CONT William Stearns Hitchcock
2 CONT Mary Burt Hitchcock
2 CONT Amenta Hitchcock
2 CONT Belenta Hitchcock
2 CONT Cementa Hitchcock
2 CONT Jehiel H Hitchcock
2 CONT Josiah Hitchcock
2 CONT Eunice Howard Hitchcock
2 CONT Joseph Hitchcock
