1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Phebe WATERS 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 was christened 6 7 Oct 1629 in St. Dunstan, Stepney, Middlesex, England. She died 11 Apr 1674 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * parents:  Richard Waters & Joyce Plasse. [2 Nov 2012] Will of Richard Waters in Essex County MA does not mention Phoebe nor any of her marriage family. Phoebe died 2 years previous to the Will, however, her children and possibly
2 CONC  John were still alive to recieve legacies. Her brother William apparently was ill as he was to receive extra support during his lifetime Married
2 CONT # Thomas WEST on 11 Oct 1658 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *  		M	i	 Samuel WEST was born 23 Mar 1660 and died Apr 1691.
2 CONT *  		M	ii	 Joseph WEST 1, 2 was born 3 Sep 1663 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts.
2 CONT *  		M	iii	 Benjamin WEST 1, 2 was born 1 Oct 1665 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts.
2 CONT *  		M	iv	 John WEST 1, 2 was born 9 Sep 1667 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
