1 NOTE Children of Bigot Eggleston and Mary Corning are:
2 CONT    i.   Child Eggleston, born October 30, 1741; died Unknown.
2 CONT    ii.   Jehiel Eggleston, born February 17, 1744/45 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut; died November 07, 1804 in Westfield, Hampden, Connecticut; married Catherine Wilkens August 12, 1790 in Westfield, Hampden, Connecticut; died 
2 CONC Unknown.
2 CONT    iii.   Benjamin Eggleston, born January 02, 1746/47 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut; died June 01, 1832 in Aurora, Portage Co., Ohio; married Mary Gordon; died Unknown.
2 CONT   Notes for Benjamin Eggleston:
2 CONT Arr. Portage Co., Ohio in 1806, "The Aurora Story" p. 15.
2 CONT Obit Western Courrier, Ohio, date June 7, 1832
2 CONT  Notes for Benjamin Eggleston:
2 CONT Arr. Portage Co., Ohio in 1806, "The Aurora Story" p. 15.
2 CONT Obit Western Courrier, Ohio, date June 7, 1832
2 CONT    iv.   Sarah Eggleston, born July 10, 1750 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut; died Unknown; married John Taggart January 10, 1777 in Chester, Massachusetts; died Unknown.
2 CONT    v.   Oliver Eggleston, Sr., born 1768 in Middlefield, Hampshire Co., Massachusetts; died 1850 in Mantua, Portage Co., Ohio; married (1) Elizabeth Eggleston; married (2) Synthia Skinner November 27, 1787 in Washington, Hampshire
2 CONC  County, Massachusetts; married (3) Mary Lewis June 27, 1848.
2 CONT    vi.   Samuel Eggleston, born May 30, 1751 in Massachusetts; died Unknown; married Mary Taylor May 04, 1774 in Murrayfield, Massachusetts; died Unknown.
2 CONT    vii.   Hannah Eggleston, born in Middlefield, Hampshire Co., Massachusetts; died Unknown; married Herrin; died Unknown.
2 CONT    viii.   Mary Eggleston, died Unknown; married David Wardwell September 30, 1784 in Washington, Massachusetts; died Unknown.
2 CONT    ix.   Moses Eggleston, born Bet. 1750 - 1760 in Middlefield, Hampshire Co., Massachusetts; died Unknown; married Mary Dickerson; died Unknown.
2 CONT    x.   Aaron Eggleston, born Bet. 1760 - 1770; died Unknown; married Hannah Collins January 06, 1785 in Middlefield, Hampshire Co., Massachusetts; died Unknown.
2 CONT    xi.   Darius Eggleston, born September 24, 1778 in Madison Co., New York; died Abt. 1840 in New York; married Mary Brown April 1794; died Unknown.
