2 CONT # Entry for '''Aaron''' Cooke and Nathaniel Cooke, 22 April 1715. – "Connecticut, Vital Records, Prior to 1850", [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:QP7B-CFZ2 FamilySearch] (pub. Sat Mar 09 19:09:02 UTC 2024).
