2 CONT '''Gulbangi.com: [http://www.gulbangi.com/5families-o/p355.htm#i8857 Nathaniel Cook]'''1,2
2 CONT '''b'''. 13 May 1658, '''d'''. 28 February 1724/25
2 CONT '''Nathaniel Cook''' was born on 13 May 1658 in Windsor, Connecticut Colony, Hartford County.3,2 He was the son of Nathaniel Cook and Lydia Vore.1 Nathaniel Cook married Lydia Brooks, daughter of John Brooks and Susannah Hanmore, 
2 CONC circa 1688 in Windsor, Connecticut Colony.3,2 Nathaniel Cook died on 28 February 1724/25 in Windsor, Connecticut Colony, at age 66.3,2
2 CONT '''Letters of administration''' for his estate were given to his widow and son Richard 12 April 1725.4
2 CONT '''Compiler's notes:''' "The relationships in the family of Nathaniel Cook are sketchy. Stiles lists a wife "Lydia" as the mother of all of Nathaniel's children. Evidence that Lydia Brooks married Nathaniel comes from the nuncupat
2 CONC ive will of her sister Susanna who refers to her sister Lydia Cook. If Lydia Brooks was Nathaniel's only wife, then she would have been 16 at the birth of her first child - not impossible but uncommon. I have found several on-line
2 CONC  databases that show a marriage between Lydia and Nathaniel, but only show the last 8 children. I had previously hypothesized that this was a second marriage after the death of Nathaniel's first wife but have since become convince
2 CONC d that Lydia Brooks was Nathaniel's only wife."
2 CONT ====Children of Nathaniel Cook and Lydia Brooks
2 CONT # Nathaniel Cook+3 b. 8 Apr c, d. 11 Jan 1751/52
2 CONT # Sarah Cook+1,5 b. 10 Feb 1690/91, d. 28 Feb 1777
2 CONT # Ebenezer Cook3 b. Jun 1692, d. date unknown
2 CONT # Daniel Cook3 b. 9 Jan 1693, d. date unknown 
2 CONT # Lydia Cook3 b. 13 Mar 1696/97, d. 1747
2 CONT # Mary Cook3 b. 16 Jan 1700/1, d. 1747
2 CONT # Richard Cook3 b. 30 Aug 1703, d. 5 Dec 1760
2 CONT # Abigail Cook3 b. 12 Jan 1705/6, d. date unknow
2 CONT # Elizabeth Cook3 b. 3 Oct 1707, d. date unknown
2 CONT # Jemima Cook3 b. 23 Sep 1709, d. 1791
2 CONT # Benjamin Cook3 b. 26 Mar 1711, d. 1791
2 CONT # Joseph Cook3 b. 1 Apr 1713, d. date unknown
2 CONT # Aaron Cook3 b. 22 Apr 1715, d. 1743
2 CONT
