1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Married June 30, 1720 in Simsbury, Hartford Co, CT. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT JOSEPH3 ALDERMAN (*WILLIAM2, JOHN1) was born 30 Jan 1696/97 in Simsbury, CT, and died 23 Sep 1782.He married MINDWELL CASE 30 Jan 1719/20 in Simsbury, CT.She was born 21 Mar 1699/00, and died 06 Oct 1775.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOSEPH ALDERMAN and MINDWELL CASE are:
2 CONT  	i.	 	MINDWELL4 ALDERMAN, b. 25 Dec 1721, Simsbury, CT; m. REUBEN HURLBREST. 	ii.	 	DORCAS ALDERMAN, b. 28 Feb 1722/23, Simsbury, Hartford, CT.
2 CONT  	iii.	 	AZUBAH ALDERMAN, b. 13 Feb 1723/24, Simsbury, Hartford, CT; m. ELIJAH ADAMS. 	iv.	 	JOSEPH ALDERMAN, JR., b. 26 May 1725, Simsbury, CT; d. 15 Dec 1806.
2 CONT  	v.	 	MARY ALDERMAN, b. 08 Feb 1726/27, Simsbury, CT; m. JOSEPH GRISWOLD.
2 CONT  	vi.	 	SUSANNAH ALDERMAN, b. 05 Sep 1728, Granby, CT; m. HEZEKIAH HOLCOMB, 29 Sep 1748.
2 CONT  	vii.	 	JAMES ALDERMAN, b. 1730, Simsbury, CT; d. 1775; m. JEMIMA GRIFFIN.
2 CONT  	viii.	 	RACHEL ALDERMAN, b. 22 Feb 1731/32, Simsbury, CT; m. (1) ?NEGUS; m. (2) BENJAMIN SALTER, 10 Aug 1763. 	ix.	 	ELNATHAN ALDERMAN, b. 31 Mar 1734, Simsbury, Hartford, CT; d. 1805.
2 CONT  	x.	 	TIMOTHY ALDERMAN, b. 14 Jul 1735, Simsbury, CT; d. 26 Jul 1757.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://www.genealogy.com/ftm/p/e/t/Virginia-E-Pettett/GENE2-0003.html
