2 CONT Ichabod Woodworth
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 12 Mar 1691 in Little Compton, Newport, Rhode Island
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Benjamin Woodworth and Hannah (Damon) May
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Elizabeth (Woodworth) Southworth [half], Deborah (Woodworth) Sprague [half], Mary (Woodworth) Sprague [half], Benjamin Woodworth, Ebenezer Woodworth, Ruth (Woodworth) Owen, Ezekiel Woodworth, Margaret (Woodworth) Owen, 
2 CONC Judith (Woodworth) Newcomb, Caleb Woodworth and	Priscilla (Woodworth) Fuller
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Sarah (Bass) Woodworth — married 26 Mar 1718 in Lebanon, New London, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Lebbeus Woodworth, Silas Woodworth, Jehiel Woodworth and Reuben Woodworth
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 26 Nov 1768 in Lebanon, New London, Connecticu
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 17 Apr 2019 | Created 31 Dec 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Benjamin & Hannah (Damon) Woodworth - Twin of Ebenezer
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Sarah Bass 16 Mar 1717 in CT - parents of Lebbeus, Silas, Jehiel & Reuben Woodworth
2 CONT
