1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth:  Aug. 12, 1766 Ashford Windham County Connecticut, USA  Death:  1842 Marshall County Illinois, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Elizabeth Dana June 1, 1794 in Mansfield, Tolland, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Timothy and Keziah Owen
2 CONT
2 CONT Amasa and Elizabeth Owen were among the first to be buried in the Old Salem Cemetery In Richland Twp, Marshall Co, IL. It was established on land given by Nathan Owen and originally called the Nathan Owen Cemeterey on Crow Creek B
2 CONC luff.
2 CONT
2 CONT Amasa and Elizabeth were my 3rd great grand parents.
