1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [46]  Soloman Knickerbocker (John, Laurens, Harmen Jansen), b. 12 Oct., 1754, at Salisbury, Conn.; m. Anna Heath, dau. of Bartholomew Heath and Mehitable Crippen of Sharon, Conn. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 22 Oct., 1789, according to agreement between the heirs of John Knickerbocker of Salisbury, that part of the real estate willed to Solomon was distributed among the other heirs.  (Book E, Probate Records, p. 267.)   
