2 CONT On 12 Jan., 1799, Solomon Knickerbocker and Anna, his wife, of the town of Freehold, County of Albany and State of New York, sell to Thomas Heath of Sharon, land in Sharon, Conn., set off by heirship from the estate of Bartholomew
2 CONC  Heath, deceased, our father.  (Land Records Book 12, p. 398.)
