1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daughter of Matthew Beckwith (d 1727) & Elizabeth, his 1st wife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Prudence died 16 June 1737 and was buried at Green Cemetery, Glastonbury, Connecticut. Her memorial has a photo of her headstone with the inscription: "Here lies the body of Mrs. Prudence Dewoolf who Deceased June 16, 1737 in y 61
2 CONC  year."
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Charles DeWolff, son of Edward deWolf & Rebecca Tinker.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 
2 CONT # Joseph DeWolf 
2 CONT # Charles DeWolf 
2 CONT # Mathew Nathan DeWolf 
2 CONT # Prudence DeWolf
2 CONT # John DeWolf 
2 CONT # Elizabeth DeWolf 
2 CONT # Stephen DeWolf 
2 CONT # Sarah DeWolf 
2 CONT # Simon DeWolf 
2 CONT # Rebekah DeWolf 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===notes===
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~villandra/momf/f617.htm#1
2 CONT
2 CONT * Maginnis gives the wife as Prudence Beckwith, daughter of Matthew and Elizabeth Beckwith, who was born 22 Auigust 1676 in Lyme, CT.
2 CONT **in a Lyme deed, Prudence is referred to as daughter of Matthew Beckwith and wife of Charles De Wolf.
2 CONT **Prudence was the daughter of Thomas (SIC: Matthew) Beckwith Sr. by his first wife, Elizabeth. In his will he names his seven children, including Prudence, by his first wife. He later married another Elizabeth, the daughter of Ma
2 CONC tthew Griswold, and had a daughter, Griswold.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===comments===
2 CONT
2 CONT Not to be confused with the [http://www.geni.com/people/Prudence-Dart/6000000036677496428 Prudence Beckwith] who married Roger Dart
2 CONT
