1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Life Summary of Jehiel
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jehiel Stewart was born on 22 October 1750, in Blandford, Hampden, Massachusetts, United States, his father, Paul Stewart, was 27 and his mother, Jerusha Spencer, was 23. He married Rachel Williams on 7 January 1776, in Norwi
2 CONC ch, Huntington, Hampshire, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 11 sons and 10 daughters. He lived in Middletown, Saratoga, New York, United States in 1790. He registered for military service in 1775. He
2 CONC  died on 18 March 1813, in Roscoe, Rockland, Sullivan, New York, United States, at the age of 62, and was buried in Roscoe, Rockland, Sullivan, New York, United States.
2 CONT
