2 CONT ** Reference: [https://familysearch.org/tree/person/details/LHW9-YQ5 FamilySearch Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 8 2024, 23:50:27 UTC''
