1 NOTE {geni:about_me} STEWART
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the tradition in the Stewart family Luther Stewart was the son of James Stewart, a native of Scotland who left his home at the beginning of the 18th century and settled in Massachusetts.   The wife of James is unknown
2 CONC  and only one son is known; Luther born April 2, 1762 in Blandford, Massachusetts. Luther married Ester Smith March 18, 1784. Their descendants are listed in the Avery portion of this book. (See page 3)
2 CONT
2 CONT Exerpt is from "Some Colonial Families" by Eloise Anna Mae Roberts
