2 CONC beth Kelsey, was probably born about 1689, at Windsor, died after 1726, probably at the same place. She married Jan. 22, 1707/8, JOSIAH LOOMIS, born Nov. 28, 1684, at Simsbury; son of Daniel Loomis and his wife, Mary Ellsworth.
2 CONT
