2 CONT    E-mail from Steven Chain: My GG Grandmother was Eleanor Angeline Loomis.  Born Dec. 6, 1823 in Dutchess County, New York.  My information gives her father as David Loomis (1795-1858) and mother as Hannah Norwood.  Her brother w
2 CONC as Reuben Loomis who rode with Grierson's Raiders in the Civil War.  I have a lineage for Eleanor but no documentation.  The lineage is: David LOOMIS 1795-1858 Reuben LOOMIS 1741-1817 Ebenezer LOOMIS 1736-1792 Josiah LOOMIS 1684- 
2 CONC Sergeant Daniel LOOMIS 1657- John LOOMIS 1622-1688 Joseph LOOMIS, Sr 1590-1685
2 CONT    Comment; Elisha Loomis, in the 1908 edition, indicates that another Azubah Loomis was born to this couple on 30 Sep 1738; however, since the first daughter named Azubah had not died as of then, it may have been the daughter of 
2 CONC one of Ebenezer's brothers or cousins.
