1 NOTE From John Allaben: It appears that Hanna Loomis has been confused in various records. The death of a Widow Hannah Burr, is recorded in the Wintonbury Church records, but it is uncertain whose wife she was. Some researchers assume 
2 CONC it was Nathaniel's wife; others that it was Noahdiah Burr's wife. The Marriage Record for Hanna Loomis and Nathaniel Burr has been located in the Wintonbury Church records [July 8, 1740- Vol 71, page 277, item 7). Her birth & deat
2 CONC h dates are in question.
2 CONT
2 CONT On August 2, 1740 Hannah Loomis wife of Nathaniel Burr joined the Wintonbury Congregational Church; she transferred from the Windsor church.
