1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nathaniel was born in East Windsor, CT  on March 6, 1746. He moved to Weathersfield, VT in February of 1781. He was town clerk, for may years the only justice of the peace, represented Weathersfield in the state le
2 CONC gislature from 1795-1795 and 1802-3, and was a member of the Constitutional Convention in 1793. He was a Revolutionary soldier. He married Abigail Potwine on September 3, 17773 and had eleven children with her. 
