2 CONT ## Jones (Thomas), in Pitman, H. Minot (Harold Minot); Donald Lines Jacobus; and G. Andrews Moriarty. Comstock - Thomas Ancestry of Richard Wilmot Comstock. (Bronxville, New York: H.M. Pitman, 1964). 157. “Mary Jones of Gloucester
2 CONC  dying intestate, Benjamin Jones, her son, presented an inventory of her estate and was appointed Administrator in March 1682. A cow was due to Thomas Howard from his mother. [Essex County Court Records, vol. 8, pp. 290, 371.]”
2 CONT # Seen: “Circa 1672 in Gloucester, Massachusetts, America, Mary North married Nathanial Wensley. Her married name was Mary Wensley (North).”  Need evidence.
