1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Meacham-157
2 CONT
2 CONT >Multiple people may be conflated in this profile, i.e. information about different people may be combined and confused.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Meacham was born 12 Jan 1685 in Enfield, Hartford, Connecricut. Her parents were Isaac Meacham and Deborah Browning.
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings
2 CONT
2 CONT * Ichabod b 1679 d 1766
2 CONT * Deborah b 1681 d 1761 - Married a Markham
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Lt. Thomas Jones on 24 Apr 1708 in New London, New London, Connecticut.[1][2] They had two children. Mary died on 8 Nov 1744 in Enfield, Connecticut. She is buried in Enfield Street Cemetery in Enfield, Hartford, Conne
2 CONC cticut. [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary and Thomas[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT # Mary b 1709, m 1731, d 1780 - Abraham Whipple
2 CONT # Jerusha b 1711, m 1731, d bef 1765 - Jonathan Spencer
2 CONT # Thomas b 11712/13, m 1742, d abt 1745 - Sarah Parsons
2 CONT # Bathsheba b 1714/15, d 1715
2 CONT # Israel b 171516, m 1744, d 1798 - Jemima Clark
2 CONT # Isaac b 1717/18, d 1784 - Elizabeth Unknown - (2) Elilzabeth Colt
2 CONT # Bathsheba b 1718/19, m 1751/52, d 1775 - John Pease
2 CONT # Elizabeth b 1727, m 1747 - David Kellog
2 CONT # Samuel b 1724, d 1743
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/26648841/mary-jones
2 CONT
2 CONT late wife of Lieu't Thomas Jones in her 60th year [from "History of Enfield," Vol. III, by Francis Olcott Allen, c. 1900, page 2343]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 9 children: Mary Whipple, Jerusha Spencer, Thomas Jr, Bathsheba dy, Israel, Isaac, Bathsheba Pease, Elizabeth Kellogg, Samuel.
2 CONT
