2 CONT
2 CONT From Genealogy of the Jones family; ... the descendants of Benajmin Jones who immigrated from South Wales more than 250 years ago by Jones, George Russell Publication date [c1912] [https://archive.org/details/genealogyofjones00jon
2 CONC e/page/6 Archive.Org]
2 CONT
2 CONT (3.) THOMAS JONES, oldest son of Benjamin Jones, the second, and Elizabeth Jones, was born in 
2 CONT A. D. 1686, at Enfield, Conn. He was married to Mary Meacham in 1708. Mary, his wife, died in 1744. Thomas Jones was the most wealthy and highly respected citizen of Somers, Conn. He died in 1763. The deceased had two sons, Israel
2 CONC  was one, the other was a clergyman.
2 CONT
