1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From https://www.geni.com/documents/view/6000000009687285398?doc_id=6000000025596459463, page 12 of pdf<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT 7.  Priscilla 2  Wildes (John 1  Wild) was born 06 Apr 1658 in Topsfield, Massachusetts, and died 23 Mar 1687/88 in Topsfield, Massachusetts.  She married Henry Lake 09 May 1681.  He died 22 May 1733 in Topsfield, Massachusetts.<b
2 CONC r/>
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Henry Lake: Occupation: Weaver<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Henry Lake and Priscilla Wildes:<br/>
2 CONT Marriage: 09 May 1681<br/>
2 CONT Children of Priscilla Wildes and Henry Lake are:
2 CONT * + 41 i. Gershom 3  Lake.
2 CONT * '''+ 42 ii. Priscilla Lake, born 05 Sep 1684; died 1792.'''
2 CONT * + 43 iii. Eleazer Lake, born 09 Jul 1686; died 29 Apr 1773 in "An aged man".
2 CONT * + 44 iv. Martha Lake, born 23 Feb 1686/87.
2 CONT
2 CONT Same source pages 15-16 of pdf<br/>
2 CONT 14.  Ebenezer 3  Jones (Elizabeth 2  Wild, John 1 ) was born 17 Apr 1684.  He married (1) Mehitable Jones He married (2) Elizabeth Jones.    He married''' (3) Priscilla Lake 22 May 1712, daughter of Henry Lake and Priscilla Wildes
2 CONC .  She was born 05 Sep 1684, and died 1792.'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Priscilla Lake: Burial: Pine Grove Cemetery, Topsfield, Essex County, Massachusetts<br/>
2 CONT More About Ebenezer Jones and Priscilla Lake: Marriage: 22 May 1712<br/>
