1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Samuel Wardwell, II''' was born on February 24, 1676, in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-33222660 Samuel Wardwell] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-76863124 Sarah W
2 CONC ardwell]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-102788921 Returne Wardwell] on December 20, 1716, in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-27524237 Samuel Wardwell, III]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736471725 Samuel Wardwell]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on March 15, 1756, in Somers, Tolland, Connecticut, United States.  ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Wardwell-5
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Wardwell II (1677 - 1756)
2 CONT Born 24 Feb 1677 in Andover, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony 
2 CONT Died 15 Mar 1756 at age 79 in Somers, Tolland, Connecticut 
2 CONT
