2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Returne (Ellenwood) Wardwell — married 20 Dec 1716 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts Bay 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Samuel Wardwell, Return Wardwell, Mary (Wardwell) Cross, Samuel Wardwell, David Wardwell, Benjamin Wardwell, Martha Wardwell, Unknown Wardwell, Rafe Wardwell and Ebenezer Wardwell
