1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Returne Wardwell''' was born on May 22, 1692, in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-19181513 Ralph Ellenwood, Jr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-19181522 Martha Elle
2 CONC nwood]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Returne married [https://www.geni.com/profile-27524430 Samuel Wardwell, II] on December 20, 1716, in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT #  [https://www.geni.com/profile-27524237 Samuel Wardwell, III]; 
2 CONT #  [https://www.geni.com/profile-34736471725 SamuelWardwell].  
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1775 in Somers, Tolland, Connecticut, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Ellenwood-8
