2 CONT Returne/Return was the daughter of Ralph & Martha (Rowlandson) Ellenwood/Ellingwood
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Samuel Wardwell, son of Samuel & Sarah (Hooper) Wardwell, on 20 Dec 1716 at Beverly, Essex, MA
