1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Elisha Kibbe Sr.=
2 CONT BIRTH 20 Nov 1644 Suffolk County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT DEATH 3 Apr 1735 (aged 90) Enfield, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT BURIAL Burial Details Unknown
2 CONT MEMORIAL ID 117096631 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisha Kibbe Sr. is the son of Mary Partridge and Edward Kibbey, Jr. who married Rachel Cooke.  They moved from Roxbury to Salem, 1663, then to Enfield, Connecticut, where he was one of the earliest settlers.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Edward Kibbe Jr 1611–1694
2 CONT Mary Partridge Kibbe 1618–1664
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Rachel Cooke Kibbe 1645–1740
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Mary Kibbe Hodgman 1640–1735
2 CONT James Kibbe 1642–1681
2 CONT Hannah Kibbe 1663–1695
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT John Kibbe 1667–1755
2 CONT Edward Kibbe 1670–1756
2 CONT James Kibbe 1675–1730
2 CONT Mary Kibbe Parker 1679–1769
2 CONT Isaac Kibbe 1683–1766
2 CONT Rachel Kibbe Meacham 1686–1786
2 CONT
