1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Benjamin Cooley
2 CONT BIRTH	5 Nov 1701, Springfield, Hampden County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT DEATH	1 Apr 1790 (aged 88), Pittsford, Rutland County, Vermont, USA
2 CONT BURIAL	Baptist Cemetery, Pittsford, Rutland County, Vermont, USA, MEMORIAL ID 40145383, hotos by Hutchinson & Cortright
2 CONT
2 CONT His tombstone in Pittsford, VT reads:
2 CONT In Memory of
2 CONT Mr. Benjamin COOLEY who died.
2 CONT April 1, 1790
2 CONT in 89th year of his age
2 CONT
2 CONT Behold & see & view this stone
2 CONT Prepare for death as I have done,
2 CONT Apply to Christ's all cleansing blood,
2 CONT Forsake your sins & Live to God
2 CONT & Live to God
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription
2 CONT In MEMORY of
2 CONT Mr. BENJAMIN COO
2 CONT LEY, who died April 1,
2 CONT 1790, in the 89 year
2 CONT of his age.
2 CONT
2 CONT Behold & fee & view this ftone,
2 CONT Prepare for death as I have done.
2 CONT Apply to Chrifts all cleanfing blood,
2 CONT For fake your fins & live to God.
2 CONT
2 CONT On the day Benjamin died he was 88 years old, and Ætatis suæ (i.e., Æ, "Aged," in the XX year of his Age) 89.
2 CONT
