2 CONT * http://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Essex/Salem/aDeathsP.shtml "(PEASE (Peas, Peeas, Pees)) Mary, w. John, Jan. 5, 1668. CTR"
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/191193268/mary-pease Mary was the daughter of Robert Goodale and the 1st wife to John Pease. She was the mother of five children from John: John, Robert, Mary, Abraham and Jonathen
