2 CONT ===Robert Pease===
2 CONT * Birth: May 14, 1656 Salem Essex County Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * Death: Jul. 21, 1744 Enfield Hartford County Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * Soldier in Kings Philips War
2 CONT * Father: John Pease 1632-1689
2 CONT * Mother: Mary Goodell 1630-1669
2 CONT * Wife: Abigail Randell 1660-1743
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Pease married Abigail Randall in a double wedding ceremony with his sister, Mary Pease.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
2 CONT ===family===
2 CONT
2 CONT From  "A Genealogical and Historical Record of the Descendants of John Pease,Sen.,Last of Enfield,Conn., compiled by Rev. David Pease, and Austin S. Pease, as associate editor" pubished 1869 by Samuel Bowles & Company, Printers of
2 CONC  Springfield, Mass.
2 CONT
2 CONT On page 6 it lists: 
2 CONT
2 CONT "Robert Pease,3(John,2 Robert,1) second son of John,Sen and Mary Goodell, born at Salem,May 14, 1656; married Abigail Randall, December 16, 1678, and first settled at Salem in the "Northfields".He shared with his elder brother (Jo
2 CONC hn) the enterprise of leaving the sea-coast to seek out and make ready new homes for himself, his relatives and neighbors, in the Connecticut Valley. (Enfield)To which place his family removed in 1681.He died at Enfield, 1744, age
2 CONC d 88 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT His 10 children were:
2 CONT * 1. William b Salem Sept 26, 1679
2 CONT * 2. Mary b Salem March 11, 1681
2 CONT * 3. Abigail b Enfield 1682
2 CONT * 4. Robert b Enfield Feb 2, 1684
2 CONT * 5. Samuel b Enfield December 30, 1686
2 CONT * 6. Ephraim b Enfield April 9, 1689
2 CONT * 7. Daniel b Enfield May 23, 1692
2 CONT * 8. Hannah b Enfield June 1694
2 CONT * 9. Margaret b Enfield December 1695
2 CONT * 10.Ebenezer b Enfield 1699
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT *Vital Records of Salem MA - Births  [http://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Essex/Salem/Images/SalemV2_B150.shtml link] "PEASE, Robert, s John and Mary, 14 dÂ 3m 1656 CTR"
2 CONT *Vital Records of Salem MA - Marriages  [http://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Essex/Salem/aMarriagesP.shtml link] "PEASE, Robert, jr., and Abigaile Randall, Dec 16 1678 CTR"
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=68905289 
2 CONT * http://brizendine.org/ps10/ps10_493.htm
2 CONT * http://www.genealogy.com/forum/surnames/topics/pease/300/
