2 CONC entley.  Page 358.  "PEASE, Robert (1608-1644) & Mariah?/Mary [?FRENCH], m/2 Richard HAYNES 1644+; in Eng, by 1628; Salem {Salem 1:370; EIHC 1:4, 50:330; LBDF&P (1913) 98; Pease (1869) 2:13-14; Kelly of CT 78; Gerry 160; Parker (#
2 CONC 9) 282; Morris-Converse 143; Harmon Anc. 34; Essex Ant. 5:56; Abbe-Abbey 18}"
