2 CONT * BIRTH	18 Dec 1700 Enfield, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH	4 Dec 1775 (aged 74) Enfield, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL	Enfield Street Cemetery, Enfield, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA, MEMORIAL ID 25778087, Photos by DottyJ
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah was the daughter of James Pease and Hannah Harmon, and the granddaughter of John Pease and Ann Cummings. She married Benjamin Terry, the son of Samuel Terry and his second wife, Martha Boardman Crane. They were married 29 M
2 CONC ar 1721 in Hartford and had eleven children
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT In Memory of 
2 CONT Mrs. HANNAH wife of
2 CONT Mr. BENJAMIN TERRY
2 CONT who died Dec'br 4th,
2 CONT 1775.
2 CONT Aged 75 Years.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''O Lord thy Judgments
2 CONT are Right;
2 CONT & thou in faithfulness
2 CONT does afflict.
2 CONT Blessed are the dead
2 CONT that die in the Lord.''
2 CONT
