2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Richard
2 CONT
2 CONT When Richard French Sr was born on 18 August 1676, in Topsfield, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Ephriam French, was 33 and his mother, Mary Ramsdale, was 34. He married Elizabeth Fearing in 
2 CONC 1699, in Topsfield, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 8 daughters. He lived in Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America in 1752. He died 
2 CONC on 13 March 1757, in Middlesex, Connecticut, United States, at the age of 80, and was buried in Enfield Street Cemetery, Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut, United States.
