1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===''Find a Grave bio:''
2 CONT George Lord, son of Jeremiah and Sara (Pease) Lord was born 18 February 1764 in Enfield, CT. He married Irene "Rana" (Hall?) and had several children born in East Windsor, CT including: Irene Lord (born 2 April 1791) and George Lo
2 CONC rd (born 8 April 1793).
2 CONT
2 CONT On 5 April 1803, George married Mrs. Huldah (Abbe) Allen, daughter of Capt. Richard Abbe and Mary (Bement) Abbe, widow of Isaac Allen.
2 CONT
2 CONT George and Huldah had two daughters, both born in Enfield:
2 CONT 1. Huldah Louise Lord, born 26 July 1804, married Frederick Pease
2 CONT 2. Dorothy Lord, born 20 December 1806, married Ira Simons.
2 CONT
2 CONT George Lord died on 3 September 1808 at age 44.----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''''Headstone Inscription:'''''
2 CONT ''In Memory of
2 CONT Mr. George Lord
2 CONT who died
2 CONT September 3rd 1808
2 CONT aged 44 years.''----
2 CONT ===''Reference:''
