2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Notes of Terry Families in the United States of America
2 CONT Mainly descended from Samuel, of Springfield, Mass.,
2 CONT By Stephen Terry, A.M.
2 CONT Member of Conn. Historical Society.
2 CONT Hartford, Conn.:
2 CONT Published by the Compiler
2 CONT 1887 - Page 10
2 CONT Ebenezer; b. in E. Mar. 31, 1696; d. in E. Aug. 2, 1780; m. Mary Helms, who was b. 1702, and d. in E. Apr. 5, 1764. He was a physician, and lived for a time in South Kingston, R.I., but afterwards (about 1722) settled in E., and w
2 CONC hile that town was still in the Colony of Massachusetts he represented it once or more in the Legislature. He was a man of wealth and prominence.
