2 CONC is David as being the father of Priest David Rose, which seems likely.
2 CONT
2 CONT * [S785] Salzman: e-familytree.net, accessed; 9 July 2010; http://www.e-familytree.net/F221/F221297.htm. Jonathan Rose settled in Branford and was confirmed as en ign of the rainband there in May 1716 lieuten nt of t h e first com
2 CONC pany in May 1722 and Captain of the company in the North Society in May 1726. He signed t he petition of the northern farmers of the town for a separate ecclesiastical society 7 May 1717, receipted 12 F eb. 17189, f or his part of
2 CONC  his mothers thirds in th e estate of his father was also deputy to the general court i n 1723 , 1727, 1732 and 1733. Jonathan Rose was involved in many lands transactions, including many in Branford, CT.
2 CONT
