2 CONT ROSE, JUSTUS DAR Ancestor #: A097735 Service:  MASSACHUSETTS    Rank: CIVIL SERVICE Birth:  BAPTISED 22 Mar 1724    DURHAM NEW HAVEN CO CONNECTICUT Death:  25 Sep 1781    GRANVILLE HAMPSHIRE CO MASSACHUSETTS Service Source:  MA GR
