2 CONT (f/g) Deacon Justus Rose Birth: 	Mar. 22, 1723 Durham Middlesex County Connecticut, USA Death: 	Sep. 25, 1781 Granville Hampden County Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Justus Rose, Dea., Sept. 25, 1781, in 58th y. GR1 [Dea. Justice [dup. Justus]. PR6]
2 CONT
