2 CONT Biographical Summary & Vital Statistics
2 CONT Full Name: Elisha Rose
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth / Baptism: Baptized June 1728 in Durham, New Haven County (now Middlesex County), Connecticut. (Some references note Hartford/Enfield County).
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: Died December 10, 1814 (aged 86) in Granville, Hampden County, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Buried at Main Road Cemetery in Granville Center, Hampden County, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Son of Jonathan Rose (1679–1768) and Abigail Hale (1688–1791).
2 CONT
2 CONT Military Service: Served as a Private during the Revolutionary War in Captain Cooley’s Company, Colonel John Mosley’s Regiment (Hampshire County, Massachusetts militia); also served under Captain Aaron Coe's Company.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Details
2 CONT First Marriage: Married Abigail [Maiden Name Unknown] (c. 1730 – 1775) before 1752 in Granville, Massachusetts. She passed away in Granville around 1775.
2 CONT
2 CONT Second Marriage: Married Sybil Griswold (1742–1829), daughter of David Griswold and Huldah Brown, on April 17, 1777, in Wintonbury Parish, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT Documented Children (In Chronological Order)
2 CONT The children of Elisha Rose are documented in the Granville Vital Records and corresponding family deeds:
2 CONT By First Wife, Abigail [Unknown]:
2 CONT 1. Dorothy Rose – Born January 8, 1752 in Granville, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Amos Rose – Born August 3, 1754 in Granville, MA (Died young).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Amos Rose (DAR Patriot #A097641) – Born March 6, 1756 in Granville, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Elisha Rose Jr. – Born May 1, 1758 in Granville, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Phinehas Rose – Born August 15, 1760 in Granville, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Abigail Rose – Born October 23, 1762 in Granville, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Olive Rose [1] – Born May 13, 1765 in Granville, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. Gamaliel Rose – Born August 17, 1767 in Granville, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. Roswell Rose – Born September 30, 1769 in Granville, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 10. Judah Rose – Born January 21, 1772 in Granville, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT -By Second Wife, Sybil Griswold:
2 CONT 1. Olive Rose [2] – Born April 9, 1778 in Granville, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Aaron Rose – Born September 10, 1784 in Granville, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Updated: 06/19/2026
2 CONT
2 CONT —-
2 CONT
