2 CONC . Shepard, 4th Mass. iii. Elisha b. 17 Feb. 1758,  iv. Phinehas b. 29 Feb. 1760, m. 1st, Sarah Gillette, m. 2nd, Luanda Webb, m. 3rd, Sarah Mittoon (Mattoon)  v. Abigail b. 13 Mar. 1762, dy 30 Jan. 1766, Granville VR  vi. Olive b.
