2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT John, son of Jonathan Rose, was born on 18 February 1719 in Durham, Hartford, Connecticut.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT John married Ruth Holkcomb on 9 May 1745 in Granville, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT John's wife Ruth died in 1759. John married Kisiah Haskil on 23 June 1761 in Granville, Hampden, Massachusetts, United States.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT John was mentioned on a memorial in Main Road Cemetery, Granville, Hampden County, Massachusetts, United States with a death date of 11 December 1788.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT John wrote his will on 13 September 1788. His estate passed probate on 7 October 1788.[5]
2 CONT
