2 CONT my beloved wife Keziah Rose
2 CONT the male heir of my son Enoch Rose
2 CONT my daughter Damaris Spelman
2 CONT my daughter Ruth Higley
2 CONT my daughter Huldah Foster
2 CONT my daughter Hannah Graves
2 CONT my daughter Sarah Stiles
2 CONT my daughter Adah Rose
2 CONT Son of Johanthan Rose and Abigail Hale.
2 CONT
2 CONT
