2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Henry /Chandler/
2 CONT Given Name: Henry
2 CONT Surname: Chandler
2 CONT Name Prefix: Dea.[1]
2 CONT Henry Chandler was born on 3 September 1696 in Andover, Essex, County Massachusetts.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Chandler married Hannah Foster in Andover, Massachusetts.[3] The family resided in Enfield, Connecticut, where their five children were born and where Henry Chandler died on 4 April 1735.[4]
