1 NOTE Sylvester Eggleston's date of birth is unknown. He died at Norwich, England and was buried in Saint Margaret's church at Norwich, England on 27 September 1612. The fact that he was buried in the church rather than in the church ya
2 CONC rd attests to his stature. He was a member of the bakers guild. He became a freeman at Norwich, England on 22 September 1582. He was appointed a Church-warden of St. Margaret's Church On 2 March 1590.
2 CONT Sylvester Eggleston married Ann Dye on 20 May 1582 at Saint Savior's Church. Ann DYE was buried at Saint Margarets Church on 4 October 1612.
2 CONT Children of Sylvester Eggleston & Ann Dye:
2 CONT 	i. Millicent Eggleston was baptized on 9 November 1585 in St. Savior's Church at Norwich, England. She probably died before 1612, as she is not mentioned in her father's will.
2 CONT 	ii. Sylvester Eggleston was baptized on 29 Nov 1586 in Saint Saviour's Church at Norwich, England. He was buried on 3 November 1599 at Saint Saviour's church at Norwich, England.
2 CONT 	iii. Edmund Eggleston was baptized in St. Saviour's Church at Norwich, England. He was mentioned in his father's will.
2 CONT 	iv. William Eggleston was baptized on 13 Sept 1589 in St. Margaret's Church at Norwich, England. He was buried on 2 May 1599 at Saint Margaret's Church at Norwich, England.
2 CONT 	v. Thomas Eggleston was baptized on 10 Sept 1590 at St. Margaret's Church in  Norwich, England. He was buried on 21 June 1593 at Saint Margaret's Church at Norwich, England.
2 CONT 	vi. Katherine Eggleston was baptized on 20 April 1593 in St. Margaret's Church at Norwich, England. She was buried on 30 March 1623 at Saint Margaret's church at Norwich, England. From reading the will of her father, it is obviou
2 CONC s that she was disabled, either physically or mentally. He provided money for her care to the church-wardens. She was unmarried at the time of her death.
2 CONT 	vii. Anne Eggleston was baptized on 3 March 1595 at St. Margaret's Church in Norwich, England. She was buried on 1 April 1598 at Saint Margaret's Church in Norwich, England.
2 CONT 	viii. Edward Eggleston was baptized on 29 April 1599 in St. Margaret's Church at Norwich, England.
