1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Payne''' (1649–1681) m. 1 August 1676, '''Mary (Hall) Martin'''. Their children included:
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Patience Payne''' was born in Middletown on August 19, 1678. She married '''Samuel Eggleston''' on July 8, 1703. Samuel was the son of Samuel Eggleston and Sarah Disbrough. Patience and Samuel resided in Middletown, where they 
2 CONC raised a large family that remained prominent in the local records for several generations.
2 CONT
