1 NOTE {geni:about_me} note from Ancestry message board ( 2002 )
2 CONT
2 CONT I don't know if you are aware of this bit of information about your Ambrose Eggleston. At the William L Clements Library at the Univ of Michigan, there is a collection of Eggleston Family History papers, assembled by your Ambrose 
2 CONC Eggleston. Here is a link to the webpage:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.clements.umich.edu/Webguides/EF/Egglestn.html
2 CONT
2 CONT It is possible I think to obtain copies of the documents from the Library, at least according to their website. I'm also wondering if the collection has ever been filmed and is available thru the LDS.
