1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Mary Bissell Pettibone=
2 CONT * BIRTH 16 Sep 1666 Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 25 Jun 1718 (aged 51) Simsbury, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Burial Details Unknown. Specifically: Burial location unknown 
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 163747295  
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was the daughter of Samuel Bissell and Abigail Holcomb. She had a sister Abigail who married James Eno. Jr. Mary Married John Pettibone (1665-1741) on 18 Dec 1690. Their daughter Sarah married Amos Phelps.
