1 NAME Bathsheba Winfred /Pettibone/
2 GIVN Bathsheba Winfred
2 SURN Pettibone
2 _MARNM Grimes
2 NICK Kanady Grimes
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 25 APR 1721
2 ADDR
