1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ichabod was the son of Samuel Miller (b.1655, d.1726) and Ruth Beamon (b.1660, d.1704). He first married Hannah Christian Van Horn (b.1709, d.1735) on 6 August 1731 in Springfield, Hampden Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah was the daughter of Christian Johannes Van Horn (b.1683, d.1765) and Hannah Ebenezer Jones (b.1685, d.1756).
2 CONT
2 CONT After Hannah's death in 1735 Ichabod married a second time.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ichabod's second wife was Sarah Holcomb (b.1719, d.1800). This second marriage was during 1742 in Simsbury, Hartford Co., Connecticut.
2 CONT
