2 CONT Her last will and testament, dated December 17, 1789 names daughters Dorcas Case, Judith Case, grandchild Amaziah Humphrey, three grandchildren Abraham Humphrey, Lot Humphrey and Ralph Humphrey, grandchild Ozias Phelps, son to my 
2 CONC granddaughter Sophia Humphrey, granddaughter Lois Case, four grandchildren born to my eldest deceased daughter Hepzibah Cornish: James Cornish, Elisha Cornish, Elizabeth Wilcox and Hepzibah Humphrey. Two grandsons Sylvanus Humphre
2 CONC y and Rufus Humphrey.  Her three daughters: Caroline Lovett, Hepzibah Wilcox, and Dorcas Case, wife of Giles. Granddaughter Moriah Nobles. Appoints son in law Dudley Case and grandson Amaziah Humphrey, executors of her estate. 
