1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Aaron Powers Sr.=
2 CONT * BIRTH Jun 1738 Hardwick, Worcester County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 9 Oct 1826 (aged 88) Greenwich, Hampshire County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Quabbin Park Cemetery, Ware, Hampshire County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 52750390
2 CONT
2 CONT Aaron, was the son of Jeremiah and Hannah (Fiske) Powers of Hardwick and Greenwich, MA. He married 1st: Olive Osborn, abt 1759. Aaron and Olive resided in Greenwich, MA, and had 5 known children.  After Olive's death, Aaron marrie
2 CONC d 2nd: Martha Tilson, abt 1791 in Greenwich. Aaron and Martha had one child, Patty Powers.  Aaron was Patriot of the American Revolution for MASSACHUSETTS with the rank of Private. [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Jeremiah Powers 1710–1795
2 CONT Hannah Fiske Powers 1712–1789
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouses'''
2 CONT Olive Osborn Powers1742–1790 (m. 1759)
2 CONT Martha Gilbert Powers 1746–1843 (m. 1791)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Jeremiah Powers 1732–1801
2 CONT Isaac Powers 1736–1811
2 CONT Esther Powers Gibbs 1741–1822
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' with Olive*, Martha**
2 CONT *Olive Powers Crossett 1762–1835
2 CONT *Stephen Powers 1763–1843
2 CONT *Polly Powers Moulton 1770–1832
2 CONT *Benjamin Powers 1776–1819
2 CONT *Rufus Powers 1778–1848
2 CONT *Martha Powers Sanderson 1792–1854
2 CONT **Patty Powers (1792-1854)
2 CONT
