1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Olive Powers Crossett=
2 CONT * BIRTH 9 Apr 1762 Greenwich, Hampshire County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 10 Mar 1835 (aged 72) Swanzey, Cheshire County, New Hampshire, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Mount Caesar Cemetery, Swanzey, Cheshire County, New Hampshire, USA
2 CONT * PLOT Lot 297 MEMORIAL ID 157196831 Photos by Stan Arnold
2 CONT
2 CONT Olive was the daughter of Aaron Powers and Olive Osborne of Greenwich, Mass. (a defunct town that is now mostly under the Quabbin Reservoir). She was married 9 Jan 1784 to Richard Crossett, the son of Robert Crossett and Mary Sava
2 CONC ge of New Salem, Mass.
2 CONT
