2 CONT She married as his first wife Isaac Catlin, son of Samuel & Elizabeth (Norton) Catlin, about 1738 in CT - parents of Isaac II & Ruth
2 CONT
2 CONT After her death he married Desire Bradley about 1757 in CT
2 CONT
2 CONT ——-
2 CONT
2 CONT 33. ELIZABETH Kilbourn , b. in Wethersfield, Oct. 19, 1716 ; m. Isaac Catlin, and had four children, viz., 
2 CONT
2 CONT *1. Elizabeth, m. Amos Barnes, and had Lois, Amos, Elizabeth and Anna ; 
2 CONT *2. Elisha, 
2 CONT *3. Isaac, and 
2 CONT *4. Charles.
2 CONT
2 CONT ——-
2 CONT
2 CONT CATLIN, ISAAC, of Samuel;
2 CONT
2 CONT m. Elizabeth Kilborn. Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT #Elizabeth, b. ;m. Amos Barnes.
2 CONT #Elisha.
2 CONT #Isaac, b. Aug. 20, 1739.
2 CONT #Charles.
2 CONT #Irene.
2 CONT #Polly.
2 CONT #Ruth.
2 CONT #Sarah.
2 CONT
