1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====Wikitree: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Harris-46820 Johanna (Harris) Blinn (abt. 1653 - 1716)]
2 CONT * ''' Daughter of''' [father unknown] and [mother unknown]
2 CONT *  '''Born''' about 1653. She passed away in 1716.[1]
2 CONT * '''Marriage date and place''' listed as 1725, Wethersfield, Hartford, Connecticut, which do not correlate with bio of husband. Changed to reflect that information.
2 CONT * '''There are a few genealogies''' that list her name as Johanna Mary Harris, but don't list parents for her.
2 CONT * '''Born''' about 1653 in Wethersfield, Hartford, Connecticut 
2 CONT * {sibling(s) unknown}
2 CONT * '''Wife of''' Peter Blinn — married 1 Jul 1675 in Wethersfield, Hartford, Connecticut Colony
2 CONT * '''Mother of''' William Blinn, Mary (Blinn) Hurlbut and Margaret (Blinn) Belden
2 CONT * '''Died''' 19 Apr 1716 in Wethersfield, Hartford, Connecticut Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Sources
2 CONT * Unsourced family tree handed down to MaryAnn (Dorn) Benson.
2 CONT * "New England Marriages Prior to 1700," on Ancestry.com, p. 78, text: Peter Blin (1641-1725) & 1/wf Joanna ? ; b. 1675; Wetherfield, CT, ditto (1641-1725) & 2/wf Mary  ? ; b. 1686; Wetherfield, CT.
2 CONT * Birth of daughter Margaret: "Connecticut Births and Christenings, 1649-1906," database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:F7WR-C5G : 11 February 2018), Johanna in entry for Margarett Blin, 10 Mar 1681; citing
2 CONC  ; FHL microfilm unknown.
