2 CONT # Unsourced family tree handed down to MaryAnn (Dorn) Benson.
2 CONT # Harris (1989), p 305, citing NEHGR 143(1988):325, 327
2 CONT # Harris (1989), p 304, citing Houghton Bulkeley, "A Discovery on the Connecticut Chest," in ''Connecticut Historical Society Bulletin'', 23, no. 1 [Jan. 1958], 17-19
2 CONT # Harris (1989), pp 307-308
