2 CONC a Tradition, by Gale Ion Harris, TAG Vol 83 (2008-9), pages 255-256
2 CONT # Tillotson, Edward Sweetser. ''Wethersfield Inscriptions'' (William F.J. Boardman, Hartford, Conn., 1899). – '''Page 22-3:''' "Here lieth the body of Mr. Peter Blin, who departed this life March ye 7th in the 85 year of his age."
2 CONC  This appears twice, on Page 22 and again on page 23.
