2 CONT ** '''23 Nathan Hurlbut'''3 (Samuel2, Thomas1) was born in Wethersfield, Ct., 4 Oct. 1670. He settled in his native town, where he m, 9 July 1699, Mary Blinn, dau. of Peter Blinn, of Wethersfield. When or where Mr. and Mrs, H. d.,
2 CONC  I have not learned.
