2 CONT # Stiles, Henry E.   ''Families of Ancient Wethersfield, Connecticut'', Vol. 2, page 863.  “The Wright Family.” [https://books.google.com/books?id=f_Aza7zZrTIC&lpg=PA863&dq=%22Ann%20Deming%22%20Nathaniel%20Wright&pg=PA863#v=onepag
2 CONC e&q=%22Ann%20Deming%22%20Nathaniel%20Wright&f=false GoogleBooks] Elizur Wright (1718/9 - 1787)  was the son of Nathaniel & Ann Deming Wright, and father of 1) daughter, died young 2) Elizur, Dea., b. So. Canaan, 30 July 1762.  Fam
2 CONC . 2.  
2 CONT
