2 CONT
2 CONT ===Mabel Nichols formerly Boardman aka Griswold===
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 30 May 1689 in Wethersfield, Hartford, Connecticut Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Daniel Boreman and Hannah (Wright) Treat
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Richard Boardman, Daniel Boardman, John Boardman, Hannah (Boardman) Abbe, Martha 
2 CONT (Boardman) Churchill, Israel Boardman, Timothy Boreman, Timothy Boardman, Joshua Boardman, Benjamin Boardman and Charles Boardman
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Griswold — married 18 Jan 1710 (to 24 Dec 1719) in Wethersfield, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Josiah Nichols — married about 1720 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Hannah Griswold, Jeremiah Griswold, Thankful (Griswold) Ward, Mabel Griswold, John Griswold and Daniel Nichols
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 25 Feb 1726 at age 36 in New Milford, Hartford, Connecticut Colony
