1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/22489508/joshua-boardman
2 CONT
2 CONT ''''''Joshua Boardman''', son of Daniel Boreman and Hannah Wright, was born 18 November 1702 at Wethersfield, Connecticut Colony, and died 1761 at Sheffield, Berkshire County, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married first to Sarah Stockwell (1704 - bef 1742) on 14 Feb 1725 at Litchfield.  She was the daughter of Eleazer Stockwell and Sarah Pearse.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married second to Amy Case (1703 - abt 1792) in 1742 at Sheffield, Berkshire, Massachusetts Bay.  She was the daughter of Richard Case and Amy Reade, and the widow of Jonathan Holcomb.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sarah Stockwell and Joshua Boardman:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Miriam Boardman
2 CONT # Elizabeth Boardman
2 CONT # Daniel Boardman
2 CONT # Joshua Jr Boardman
2 CONT # Olive Boardman
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Amy Case and Joshua Boardman:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Rosanna Boardman Abt 1742 - 1761
2 CONT # Elijah Boardman Est 1744 - 1771
2 CONT # Mary Boardman Est 1747 -
2 CONT # Hannah Boardman Est 1749 -
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Goldthwaite, Charlotte. Boardman Genealogy, 1525-1895: The English Home and Ancestry of Samuel Boreman, Wethersfield, Conn.; Thomas Boreman, Ipswich, Mass. : With Some Account of Their Descendants (Now Called Boardman) in America.
2 CONC  (Hartford, Conn.: William F. J. Boardman, 1895) pages 235, 237.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT >'Joshua Bordman ([son of] Daniel...), of Sheffield, Mass., born in Wethersfield Nov. 18, 1702; married Feb. 14, 1724-5, Sarah Stockwell. ... [The marriage and birth of their first child Elizabeth in 1725 are] all that is known of
2 CONC  Joshua's family, except as it appears in his will, for the records of Sheffield, both church and town, are almost entirely wanting for that period. Sarah Stockwell is supposed to have been the mother of either four or five of the
2 CONC  eight children of whom mention is found, while another wife, Amy, was mother of the remainder.'
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000186602026891&size=large}}
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Younger children of Joshua Bordman (exact order not known) & Amy Case 
2 CONT
