2 CONT ==Comments==
2 CONT
2 CONT John Moore of Windsor Connecticut had six children, but none of them were named George, and none of his children went to Virginia. He was also not the father of MARY ALLYN.
2 CONT
2 CONT See Great Migration Begins: Immigrants to N.E. 1620-1633, pp 1276-78
