2 CONT Hannah?? (1st wife??) (probably not Abigail  she's his 2nd wife)
2 CONT ***notation in New England, The Great... - wife probably gave birth to all of his children***</line><line /><line>12/12/20</line><line /><line>Possible Parents:
2 CONT Deacon John Moore 1603–1677 9HWP-F48​​
2 CONT Marriage: before 1628 England
2 CONT Mrs. John Moore 1606–1677</line><line /><line>12/24/20</line><line /><line>***Update***
2 CONT Martha Sarah Yonges  (1613–1671) 
2 CONT Ancestry suggestion.</line><line /><line>1/17/22
