1 NOTE {geni:about_me} >'''Anderson's "New England: The Great Migration'''
2 CONT >"vi JOHN, b.Windsor6 December1 645 {Grant 50]; m. (1) Windsor 2,1 September 1664 Hannah Goffe [Grant 51]; m. (2) 17 December 1701 Martha Farnsworth {Windsor Hist 501]; m. (3) Mary [Flagg 279]."
2 CONT
2 CONT John Moore BIRTH	5 Dec 1645, Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA DEATH	21 Jun 1718 (aged 72), Dorchester, Suffolk County, Massachusetts, USA BURIAL	Unknown, MEMORIAL ID 55070539
2 CONT
2 CONT JOHN, 6th & last known child of John Moore, was born at Windsor 5 Dec 1645. He married (1) at Windsor 21 Sep 1664, Hannah Goffe. He Married (2) 17 Dec 1701, Martha Farnsworth. He married (3) Mary ____. Source: Anderson's Great Mig
2 CONC ration Begins.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents	 John Moore, 1603–1677 wife Moore, 1618–1677
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse Hannah Goffe Moore, 1643–1697 (m. 1664)
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings Hannah Moore Drake, 1627–1686 Thomas Moore, 1637–1682 Elizabeth Moore Case, 1638–1728	 Abigail Moore Sanders, 1639–1725 Mindwell Moore Bissell, 1643–1682	 Andrew Moore, 1649–1719
2 CONT
2 CONT Children	 Thomas Moore, 1667–1735	 Samuel Moore, 1669–1733
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/55070539/john-moore
2 CONT ---------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT The first of the Moores to be born in America.<br/>
