1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bissell-243
2 CONT
2 CONT Esther was the daughter of Thomas II & Hester (Strong) Bissell
2 CONT
2 CONT She married first Jonathan Drake, son of Job & Elizabeth (Alvord) Drake, on 14 Apr 1708 at Windsor, Hartford, CT - parents of Benjamin, Esther & Eunice
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of Jonathan she married Joseph Skinner, son of Joseph & Mary (Grant) Skinner, on 21 Aug 1718 at Windsor, Hartford, CT - their children were Azariah, Lucy & John
2 CONT
