2 CONT Brief Life History of Daniel
2 CONT
2 CONT When Capt. Daniel White was born on 4 July 1671, in Hatfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Daniel White, was 33 and his mother, Sarah Crow, was 25. He married Sarah Bissell about 1691,
2 CONC  in Hatfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 3 daughters. He died on 22 June 1726, in East Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 54.
