2 CONT Avis was the daughter of 2nd. Lt. Thomas Catlin, Jr., and Avis Buell, both of Litchfield. She married Josiah McCall in Litchfield Co. on Sept. 16, 1798. The couple had five children, Jacob (1799), Ira (1801), Chauncey Warner (1803
2 CONC ), Benjamin J. (1806) and Mary (1810).
