1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ELIZABETH SCOTT, youngest daughter of Thomas & Ann (____) Scott, was born say 1628. She married at Windsor 3 February 1648[/9?] John Loomis, son of JOSEPH LOOMIS {1638, Windsor}. She died 7 May 1696 at Windsor.   
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were
2 CONT
2 CONT # Deacon John Loomis
2 CONT # Deacon Joseph Loomis
2 CONT # Thomas Loomis
2 CONT # Samuel Loomis
2 CONT # Sgt. Daniel Loomis
2 CONT # James Loomis
2 CONT # Timothy Loomis
2 CONT # Ens. Nathaniel Loomis
2 CONT # David Loomis
2 CONT # Deacon Samuel Loomis
2 CONT # Isaac Loomis
2 CONT # Elizabeth Loomis(m. John Brown of Windsor)
2 CONT # Mary Loomis
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT # from TORREY: LOOMIS, John (ca 1622, 1620-1688) & Elizabeth SCOTT (ca 1622-1696); 6? Feb 1648, ?3 Feb, 1648/9; Windsor, CT {Brainerd Anc. 209; Stevens-Miller 354; TAG 35:21; Hartford Prob. 1:35; Boddie 203; Bosworth 416; Dawes-Ga
2 CONC tes 2:57; Windsor CT VR 174, 254; Windsor CT 2:433; Loomis 129; Flagg Anc. 278; Smith-Hale 173, 185; Cross Anc. 60, 135; Blackman Anc. 128; Porter 10; Paine (#5) 133, 134; Brady Anc. 334}
