2 CONT *5. Grace (1684-1735) Webster #118, 
2 CONT *6. Lydia (1686-1776) 
2 CONT *7. Lyman #119, 
2 CONT *8. Sarah (1693-1776) Birge #120
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.coltechpub.com/hartgen/htm/loomis.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT John Loomis - was born on 9 Nov 1649 in Windsor, CT and died on 31 Aug 1715 in Windsor, CT . He was the son of Deacon John Loomis and Elizabeth Scott.  John married Sarah Boltwood on 20 Dec 1696 in Hadley, MA. Sarah was born about
2 CONC  1650 in Hadley, MA. She was the daughter of Robert Boltwood and Mary Gernor. She died on 14 Jul 1726 . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah - widow of Isaac Warner. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John - His first wife's name is unknown as "History of Ancient Windsor Vol. 2" and "Descendants of Joseph Loomis in America" show her name as a blank. He had 9 children with her.
