1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===John Bissell III of Windsor & Coventry, CT
2 CONT * b 4 May 1661
2 CONT * bapt.12 May 1661
2 CONT
2 CONT John III was the son of John II and 1st wife Izrael (Mason) Bissell.
2 CONT
2 CONT m. 12 Nov 1689 Mrs. Sarah (White) Loomis She was the widow of Thomas Loomis of Hartford.She was the dau. of Lt. Daniel White of Hatfield. She was b. 5 Feb 1662 in Lebanon, CT.d. 25 Aug 1751.
2 CONT
2 CONT John III, notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the 1st settler of Coventry.  He moved to Lebanon in 1707/08.  He recvd his deed from Isaac Everett of Lebanon, Oct 1715.  He was the first Capt. of Trained Band in the town.  He owned slaves.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children born to John III & Sarah:
2 CONT # Sarah (info above)
2 CONT # Capt John IV born 10 Sep 1693 Windsor
2 CONT # Daniel born 4 Jan 1698 Windsor
2 CONT # Benjamin born 22 Mar 1701 Windsor
2 CONT # daughter born 15 Oct 1714 Lebanon
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
