1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Daniel Bissell''' was born 4 JAN 1697/98 in Windsor, Conn. His parents were John Bissell and Sarah White. Daniel died 3 Oct 1776 in Lebanon, CT. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Elizabeth Fitch on 15 Feb 1747; b. 26 May 1718, d 18 Dec 1747  in New London, Connecticut.  She was the daughter of Nathaniel Fitch and Anne Abell.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Elizabeth Fitch  and Daniel Bissell
2 CONT #Daniel Bissell , Jr. b: 6 DEC 1747;d. 1813; m. 1768 to Sarah Wattles b: 11 JUL 1749
