1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sarah Crow was born at Hartford on March 1, 1647, the daughter of John Crow and Elizabeth Goodwin.  Her father was an early settler of Hartford and Hadley, and became one of the larest landholders in the colony of 
2 CONC Connecticut.  Her mother was the only child of Elder William and Susannah Goodwin.  Elder Goodwin was a fellow-passenger with Elder John White, in the ship Lyon and was one of the leaders in the settlement of Hadley.
2 CONT Sarah married Daniel white on November 1, 1661.  She was only 14 years and 8 months old at the time of her marriage.  She was one of seven daughters, who married into some of the best families in the valley of the Connecticut.  A 
2 CONC high authority in such matters has said, "Those Crow girls made smart women." Mrs. Sarah White died at Hatfield on June 26, 1719, age 72.
2 CONT Her inventory shows she was not only well supplied, but seems to have been a little extravagant, for that day, for residing in a small town.
2 CONT Source:  "Memorials of Elder John White...and of his descendants by Allyn S. Kellogg"
2 CONT ***************************************************************************************************************
2 CONT Sarah White:
2 CONT Born 15 Oct 1662 Hatfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts.  Married 1) Thomas Loomis 2) John  Bissell. 
2 CONT she had :  11 children 
2 CONT # Mary (1). Died 5 Sep 1664, Hatfield.	 
2 CONT # Mary (2).  Born 5 Aug 1665. Married 1) Wells 2) Barnard.
2 CONT # Elizabeth.  Born 13 Nov 1667 Windsor, Hartford Co., Connecticut.  Married Samuel Loomis. 
2 CONT # (Capt) Daniel.  Born 4 Jul 1671.  Hatfield, Hampshire Co., Massachusetts.  Married 1) Sarah Bissell  2) Sarah Conant .. Others.
2 CONT # Esther (1) Born 1673, Hatfield.  Died 1675.
2 CONT # Hannah (1) Born 4 Jul 1674, Hatfield.  Died in infancy.
2 CONT # John.  Born 16 Nov 1676, Hatfield.  Died Aug 1677.
2 CONT # Esther (2).  Born abt 1676, Hatfield.  Married John Ellsworth.
2 CONT # Hannah (2) Born Sept. 1679, Hatfield.  Married Nathaniel Dickinson.
2 CONT # Mehitable.  Born 14 Mar 1682/83, Hatfield.  Married Jeremiah Bissell.  	 
2 CONT *******************************************************************************************
