2 CONT Lieut. Daniel White, s. of Elder John, sett. In Hat. In 1662. His home lot was the fourth lot south of the Middle Lane. He m. Nov. 1, 1661, when she was a. 14 years and 8 months, Sarah, dau. of John Crow. She was b. in Hart., Mar.
2 CONC  1, 1647, and d. in Hat., June 26, 1719. He d. in Hat., July 27, 1713. (2)
2 CONT
