2 CONT [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/130260961/israel-loomis Find A Grave Memorial # 130260961]
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Israel Loomis and Rebecca Bingham of Lebanon, CT he came to the NYS wilderness with several other families from the area to settle on 300 acres of land purchased from Wm. Cooper in 1791.
2 CONT
2 CONT He and his wife Catherine Mattison had nine children, all born in Otsego County on their homestead.
2 CONT
2 CONT His obituary stated that throughout his life he "sustained the character of an honest, upright, useful citizen."* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/130260961/israel-loomis Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.c
