1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rebecca Loomis Bailey, daughter of Israel Loomis and Rebecca Bingham, married Seth Bailey on January 26, 1799 in Whitesboro, Oneida County, New York by Rev. Dodd. Their Children are: 1. Andrew S. Bailey 2. Israel L
2 CONC oomis Bailey 3. Rebecca Bailey  4. William Hammond Bailey 5. Althea Bailey 6. Esther Bailey 7. Pamilia Bailey (1806-1888) 8. Seth Bailey, Jr. 9. Malinda Bailey 10. Isaac Newton Bailey 11. Isaiah Loomis Bailey ∼Remains relocated to
2 CONC  Brookside Cemetery. See Find A Grave Memorial# 15928062 _____________________________________________________
