1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Peter Graves served in the 3rd Connecticut Regiment. He enlisted in May 1777 for three years, under Capt. Edward Eells and Col. Samuel Wyllys. He served three years as a Sgt., and was discharged at Westfield, New J
2 CONC ersey, May 9, 1780. His pension papers were filed from Richfield, New York, April 6, 1818.
2 CONT
2 CONT Information above refers to this Peter's son, Sgt. Peter Graves b. circa 1744.
