2 CONT
2 CONT I found the following information on Family Search:  "When Roger Prier was born about 1555, his father, William Cyril Prior, was 28 and his mother, Alice Herett, was 26. He married Alice House on 6 November 1581, in Lower Sundon, 
2 CONC Bedfordshire, England. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 2 daughters. He died before 30 April 1620, and was buried in Sundon, Bedfordshire, England."
2 CONT
2 CONT I would appreciate any constructive input from others about this.  Thank you in advance. 
2 CONT
