2 CONT Robert Davis was born in 1608 in England. Robert moved to Yarmouth, MA in 1643, where he married Ann.  They moved to Barnstable, MA in 1645 where Ann became a member of the church in 1685.  Robert’s will was written on April 14, 1
2 CONC 688 and probated June 29, 1693.  Ann was born in 1608 and died in 1701.  Her will was written May 6, 1699 and probated on April 1, 1701.  They had the following children.
2 CONT
2 CONT   1. Deborah Davis, born January 1645 at Yarmouth, married Thomas Green, and died in 1736.
2 CONT
2 CONT   2. Mary Davis, born April 28, 1648 in Barnstable, married Benjamin Dexter and died in Yarmouth.
2 CONT
2 CONT   3. Andrew Davis, born March 1650
2 CONT
2 CONT   4. John Davis, born March 1, 1652
2 CONT
2 CONT   5. Robert Davis, born August 1654 and married Sarah Archer
2 CONT
2 CONT   6. Josiah Davis, born September 1656, married Anne Taylor and died in 1710.
2 CONT
2 CONT   7. Hannah Davis, born September 1658, married a Dexter
2 CONT
2 CONT   8. Sarah Davis, born October 1660, married Joseph Young
2 CONT
2 CONT   9. Joseph Davis, born on March 28, 1665 in Barnstable. He married Hannah Cobb, daughter of James Cobb and Sarah Lewis, at Barnstable in March of 1695.
2 CONT
2 CONT  10 Mercy Davis married 1st Nathaniel Young and 2nd Nathaniel Mayo.
