1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I found this web site: http://bigelowsociety.com/rod2005/davis05.htm with the following entry:
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph was born on March 28, 1665 in Barnstable.  He married Hannah Cobb, daughter of James Cobb and Sarah Lewis, at Barnstable in March of 1695.  She was born March 28, 1671 in Barnstable.  Joseph joined the local church on July 
2 CONC 14, 1706; Hannah had joined early on March 6, 1702.  Joseph was a proprietor of the new meetinghouse built in 1717.  Joseph died on August 10, 1735 at age seventy and Hannah died on May 3, 1739, aged sixty-eight, both at Barnstabl
2 CONC e.  Their children were:
2 CONT  * 1. Robert Davis, born March 7, 1696, married Jane Annable, and died Jul 1765
2 CONT
2 CONT     2. Joseph Davis, born March 23, 1698, died in 1698
2 CONT
2 CONT     3. James Davis, born July 30, 1700, married Thankful Hinckley, and died in 1745.
2 CONT
2 CONT     4. Gershom Davis, born September 5, 1702 in Barnstable, Massachusetts, married Elizabeth Sturgis, who died   after the birth of their first child in 1727.
2 CONT
2 CONT     5. Hannah Davis, born March 5, 1705, married Samuel Hinmcock and died on 
2 CONT         September 13, 1755.
2 CONT
2 CONT     6. Mary Davis, born June 5, 1707, married Mathias Gorham
2 CONT
2 CONT     7. Lydia Davis, born February 12, 1709, died on December 30, 1763
2 CONT
2 CONT     8. Daniel Davis, born August 28, 1713, married 1st Mehitable Lothrape and 2nd 
2 CONT         Mehitable Sturgis.  He died on April 22, 1799, aged eighty-five.
2 CONT
2 CONT I found this website:https://archive.org/stream/cu31924028819212/cu31924028819212_djvu.txt with the following entry:
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. Joseph Davis resided in Barnstable. His family was one of the most respectable in town. He died, say the Church Records, Aug. 10, 1735, aged about 70 years, and his widow Hannah May 2, 1739, aged 68. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  (10-9) Joseph Davis, son of Robert, married, by Mr. Thatcher, March 1695, to Hannah, daughter of James Cobb.  Children born in Barnstable. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/9423101/joseph-davis Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 5 2020, 16:45:32 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
