1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sarah (Davis) Young (1656 - 1721)''', daughter of Robert Davis (1615 - 1688) and Ann Davis (d. 1701), was born 25 October 1656 at Eastham, Barnstable County, Massachusetts. She died at the age of 65 on 20 Novemb
2 CONC er 1721 at Eastham. She married '''Joseph Young (1654 - 1723)''', son of John Young and Abigail Howland, on 23 October 1679 at Yarmouth, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children of Joseph and Sarah  Young==
2 CONT # Samuel Young (23 September  1680 Eastham, Barnstable County, Massachusetts)
2 CONT # Joseph Young, twin (born 19 December 1682 Eastham, Barnstable County, Massachusetts)
2 CONT # Isaac Young, twin (born 19 December 1682 Eastham, Barnstable County, Massachusetts)
2 CONT # James Young (born 4 April 1685 Eastham, Barnstable County, Massachusetts)
2 CONT # Lydia Young (born 1687)
2 CONT # Sarah Young (born 1689 Eastham, Barnstable County, Massachusetts)
2 CONT
