2 CONT Brief Life History of Mercy
2 CONT When Mercy Davis was born in 1656, in Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Robert Davis, was 37 and her mother, Ann, was 30. She married Nathaniel Young on 1 July 1680, in Barnstable, Massach
2 CONC usetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 5 daughters. She died on 12 February 1756, in her hometown, at the age of 100, and was buried in Cove Burying Ground, Eastham, Barnstable, M
2 CONC assachusetts, United States.
