2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT When MERCY DAVIS was born in 1662 in Barnstable, Massachusetts, her father, ROBERT, was 54, and her mother, ANN, was 36. [citation needed]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married NATHANIEL YOUNG in 1680 in Massachusetts.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were Nathan, Rebecca, Mary, Hope, Elisha, Hannah & Mercy Young.[citation needed]
2 CONT
2 CONT NATHANIEL YOUNG died in 1706.[citation needed]
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of Nathaniel she married as his second wife, Nathaniel Mayo on 10 Jun 1708 at Eastham, Barnstable, MA Bay - no known children from this marriage.[citation needed]
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1710, Mercy quitclaimed her rights to Nathaniel Mayo's estate to his sons, Nathaniel Mayo and Samuel Mayo.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1733 in her hometown at the age of 71.[citation needed]
