2 CONT Birth: 1621, England Death: 1726 Preston New London County Connecticut, USA  Son of Jonathan Geer (1580-1635) and wife Eleanor (1608-1635). Married Sarah Allyn on 17 Feb 1658 in New London. Father of Sarah, Jonathan, Mary, Joseph,
2 CONC  Hannah, Margaret, Daniel, Robert, Anne, Isaac, Jeremiah and David.  George came to the colonies in 1635 at age 14 with his 12 year old brother, Thomas. He purchased land that would increase to 150 acres in the area that would bec
2 CONC ome Ledyard. Additional land near New London was granted to him from Owaneco, son of Uncas. He was elected a Selectman of New London. He moved in with his daughter, Margaret, after his wife Sarah died. He became blind when he was 
2 CONC about 102, and lived to be 105 years old.
2 CONT
