2 CONT
2 CONT Zebulon Jones Jr.
2 CONT Male
2 CONT 19 March 1746–25 November 1836
2 CONT •
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Zebulon
2 CONT
2 CONT When Zebulon Jones Jr. was born on 19 March 1746, in Somers, Tolland, Connecticut, United States, his father, Zebulon Jones, was 22 and his mother, Annah K Kibbey, was 18. He married Mary Cooley on 7 October 1767, in Somers, Tolla
2 CONC nd, Connecticut, United States. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 4 daughters. He registered for military service in 1831. He died on 25 November 1836, in Cornwall, Addison, Vermont, United States, at the age of 90, and
2 CONC  was buried in Fair Cemetery, Cornwall, Addison, Vermont, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT FamilySearch
