1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  From: George Sparks & Vivian Retherford of Wisconsin - Family Ties:Information about Clarissa Hale
2 CONT
2 CONT Clarissa Hale (daughter of John Hale and Clara Terry) was born March 25, 1784 in Enfield, Hartford County, Connecticut, and died March 11, 1843 in Eaton, Quebec, Canada.She married Daniel Chandler on August 17, 1802 in Enfield, Ha
2 CONC rtford County, Connecticut, son of Joseph Chandler and Mary Chapin. More About Clarissa Hale: Burial: Unknown, Canada. More About Clarissa Hale and Daniel Chandler: Marriage: August 17, 1802, Enfield, Hartford County, Connecticut.
2 CONT  Includes Notes Marriage Notes for Clarissa Hale and Daniel Chandler: In the book, Hale, House and Related Families by Donald Lines Jacobus and Edgar Francis Waterman, the authors give a marriage date of August 11, 1803.However, D
2 CONC aniel and Clarissa's oldest daughter was born January 9, 1804, so the marriage date of August 17, 1802 is most likely the correct date.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Clarissa Hale and Daniel Chandler are:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Laura Chandler, b. January 09, 1804, Enfield, Hartford County, Connecticut948, d. date unknown.
2 CONT * Dorcas Hale Chandler, b. September 08, 1805, Enfield, Hartford County, Connecticut948, d. date unknown.
2 CONT * Lorin Chandler, b. November 22, 1808, Enfield, Hartford County, Connecticut948, d. October 29, 1879, Lincoln, Monroe County, Wisconsin949.
2 CONT * +Clarissa Chandler, b. July 07, 1809, Enfield, Hartford County, Connecticut950, d. Aft. 1880, Wisconsin951.
2 CONT * Marian Chandler, b. April 07, 1811, Somers/Tolland, Tolland County, Connecticut952, d. date unknown.
2 CONT * Ruth Emeline Chandler, b. June 26, 1814, Colebrook, Coos County, New Hampshire952, d. date unknown.
2 CONT * Zenia Chandler, b. September 03, 1816, Colebrook, Coos County, New Hampshire952, d. date unknown, Newport, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT * John Hale Chandler, b. August 03, 1819, Clifton, Quebec, Canada952, d. 1860953.
2 CONT * Elvira Chandler, b. August 21, 1821, Eaton, Quebec, Canada954, d. date unknown.
2 CONT * Lucinda Chandler, b. December 30, 1823, Eaton, Quebec, Canada954, d. date unknown.
2 CONT * Amanda Chandler, b. February 24, 1828, Eaton, Quebec, Canada954, d. date unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Link''':http://www.genealogy.com/ftm/s/p/a/Katherine-A-Sparks-WI/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-1246.html
