1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT [[Category: Braintree, Massachusetts]]
2 CONT == Biography ==Thomas, known as Thomas French Jr. or 2nd, was born in Braintree, Suffolk County, Massachusetts Bay Colony, 5 Aug 1698.≤ref name="Birth">[https://www.wikitree.com/photo.php/9/94/French-12827-1.jpg  Birth Record]: "T
2 CONC homas French, son of [[French-5048|Thomas French]] and [[Belcher-929|Elizabeth]] his wife was borne the fifth day of August, instant 1698."   Braintree (Mass.), and Samuel A. Bates. 1886. ''Records of the Town of Braintree, 1640 t
2 CONC o 1793.'' Randolph, Mass: Daniel H. Huxford, printer. Page 676. Available online without restriction courtesy of Hathitrust, [https://hdl.handle.net/2027/inu.30000084021215?urlappend=%3Bseq=684 here].≤/ref> He was the son of [[Fre
2 CONC nch-5048|Thomas French]] and [[Belcher-929|Elizabeth Belcher]]
2 CONT .≤ref name="Birth"/>
2 CONT Thomas was married on 5 November 1723 to Mary Owen (born Feb. 15, 1702/3), a daughter of Nathaniel and Mary  (___) Owen.≤ref name=Sprague1774>Sprague, #1774.≤/ref>
2 CONT He passed away in 1759.{{citation needed}}. Sprague does not show a date of death. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Research Notes ==He did not have a wife Rebecca or son Thomas. Thomas, identified in town records as the son of  Thomas & Rebecca who was born Jul. 1, 1723,was a son of Jonathan and Rebecca French. An error in town records mist
2 CONC akenly assigned him to Thomas≤ref name=Sprague1774/>
2 CONT Although the Sprague note above states that he did not have a son Thomas, that is intended for the Thomas that was born 1723.  The list of children for Thomas French and Mary Owen does include a son Thomas, whowas born 3 Apr 1743.
2 CONC  ≤ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20230308182900/https://worldconnect.rootsweb.com/trees/226319/I15601/thomas-french/individual  Thomas French 1698 - ?] saved on Wayback machine, on Worldconnect.rootsweb, citing using Sprague Gen
2 CONC ealogies ≤/ref> 
2 CONT
