1 NOTE {geni:about_me} LIEUT. MARTIN DEWEY was born on May 18th, 1716, at Westfield, Massachusetts. By trade, he was a blacksmith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Martin married first, Elizabeth Dewey, his cousin, the daughter of James and Elizabeth (Ashley) Dewey. She was born on 29 September 1722, at Westfield. She died at Westfield on 12 October 1756, at 34 years of age.
2 CONT
2 CONT Martin married secondly, his widow’s sister, Anna Dewey who was born 30 August 1724.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1755, Martin Dewey’s name appears on “a list of 151 men voluntarily inlisted in to his Majesty’s service for reinforcing the army destined for Crown Point, out of the Southern regiment in Hampshire county”. In 1756, he served 1
2 CONC 3 weeks in Capt. Benjamin Day’s co. of Springfield, roll dated March 5th. And he was credited with 26 days of service on an alarm in August, 1757, for the relief of the garrison at Fort William Henry, in Capt. David Mosely’s compa
2 CONC ny. Martin was a Selectman at Westfield in the years 1757-58.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Elizabeth (Dewey) Dewey:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Martin Dewey II was born 26 December 1740. He was in the army, and appears as private in Lieut. John Shephard’s co., marched from Westfield on the Lexington Alarm, April 19, 1775. He enlisted on April 28th for eight mnonths in 
2 CONC Capt. Warham Park’s co., Col. Danielson’s Regt., and died in service.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Elizabeth Dewey was born 12 July 1743.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Rhoda Dewey was born 23 March 1747. She married about 1766, Stephen Hopkins, the son of Capt. Stephen and Jemima (Bronson) Hopkins, of Harwinton, Connecticut. They were in Harwinton 1738 and in Nine Partners, NY in 1742. He was
2 CONC  born about 1740, and died in Burlington Flats, Otsego Co., NY in 1813.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. .Mercy Dewey was born 26 September 1749.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.  Lucretia Dewey as born 27 March 1750; married Daniel Harmon.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.  Grace Dewey was born in October 1753; married (-) Harmon. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Anna (Dewey) Dewey
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  Anna Dewey was born 17 June 1760.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Archibald Dewey was born 14 January 1764. He married in 1785, Jerusha Hopkins (b. 1766 at Nine Partners, NY, the dtr. of Benjamin and Zaresh (Rudd) Hopkins. 
