2 CONT >.
2 CONT >'''[https://www.ancestry.com/imageviewer/collections/12139/images/dvm_GenMono001562-00024-0?pId=205 ''Andrew Moore of Poquonock and Windsor, Conn., and his Descendants'']''' @Ancestry.com.
2 CONT >'''page 46:'''
2 CONT >Samuel Moore, b. Simsbury, CT...married Eunice, the dau. of '''Capt. Isaac''' and Susannah (Root) >'''Gilette'''...'''Capt. Isaac Gillett was the son of Dea. Isaac and Honorah (Stevens) Gillett; m. 28 Dec 1742.''' 
2 CONT >'''Dea. Isaac, the son of Isaac and Elizabeth (Griswold) Gillett; m. 29 Oct 1719.''' 
2 CONT >Isaac was the son of Nathan and Rebecca (Owen) Gillett; m. 30 Jun 1692. 
2 CONT >Nathan was the son of Nathan Gillett, the immigrant, Dorchester, 1630, Windsor, CT 1635. He served in the Pequot War. His wife d. Simsbury, CT, 21 Feb 1670. Susannah was dau. of Elisha and Mary (Scott) Root; m. 22 Apr 1730...
2 CONT >.
2 CONT >'''from [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/28050146/isaac-gillet ''Find A Grave Index'']'''
