2 CONT BENJAMIN [Griswold][2], b. Windsor, Conn., Apr. 16, 1671 (George[2], Edward[1]); m. in Windsor, 4 Jan 1693, Elizabeth Cook, daughter of Moses and Elizabeth (Clark) Cook, of Westfield, Mass., b. Aug. 25, 1673. 
