2 CONT DAR records show he was born in Windsor, Hartford, CT and died in Farmingbury, New Haven Co., CT.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Zaccheus married Ruth Phelps Gillet on December 15, 1743 in Simsbury, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT Zaccheus's grandfather was,
2 CONT Nathan Gillett Jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT Zaccheus's great grandfather was,
2 CONT Nathan Gillett Sr.
