3 STAE CT
3 CTRY United States
1 BURI
2 DATE 1748
2 PLAC Old Center Cemetery, Suffield Depot, Suffield, Hartford, Connecticut, United States
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Various publications have birth as the 2nd, 4th or 12th day of Apr. 1699. Ebenezer was granted land at Suffield in 1709, 1713, 1716 and 1717.  He served the town in a number of offices between 1700 and 1741, being 
2 CONC selectman four times, constable three times, moderator of the town meeting four times, and surveyor of highways once. Admitted to the Suffield church on Feb. 27, 1725. Ebenezer's will was made on Aug. 22, 1748 and recorded Aug. 7,
2 CONC  1750. His estate at Suffield was inventoried Feb. 2, 1748/9, and his land at Windsor was inventoried Jun. 30, 1749. Married at Suffield, Hartford Co., CT in Nov. 1725.
2 CONT --------------------
