2 CONC 29. More About WIDOW JANE FOWKES: Died in: England, after she went there with William. Moved to England by: 1671, Was in Tiverton, Devon Co, England CONT Widow of: Henry Fowkes Children of WILLIAM HORSFORD and FLORENCE HAYWARD are
