2 CONC r, Hartford Co., Ct.; m. STEPHEN TAYLOR, November 01, 1642, Windsor, Hartford Co., Ct. 2. iii. JOHN HORSFORD, b. Bef. October 03, 1627, Beaminster, Dorsetshire, England; d. August 07, 1683, Windsor, Hartford Co., Ct. iv. JOANNA HO
2 CONC RSFORD, b. Abt. 1630, Beaminister, Dorsetshire, England; d. September 18, 1649, Windsor, Hartford Co., Ct. Generation No. 2. JOHN2 HOSFORD (WILLIAM1) was born Bef. October 03, 1627 in Beaminster, Dorsetshire, England, and died Aug
2 CONC ust 07, 1683 in Windsor, Hartford Co., Ct. He married PHILLIPA (PHILLURY ) THRALL November 05, 1657 in Windsor, Hartford Co., Ct, daughter of WILLIAM THRALL and ELIZABETH GOODE. She was born November 05, 1637 in Windsor, Ct, and d
2 CONC ied May 1698 in Windsor, Ct. Notes for JOHN HORSFORD: SOURCE *see his father William's notes. John Hosford was a man of considerable estate. He left his son William oe 225, sons John II and Timothy oe 121 each, and sons Samuel and
2 CONC  Nathaniel oe 114 each; he left his daughters, Hester, Mary and Sarah, each oe 100, his son Obadiah oe 122 and his widow oe 85 and his personal estate for life. His 9 children were all born in Windsor (Ct.), and were living at his
2 CONC  death in 1693, or 1698. (As written in Cooley Genealogy) A mistake was made with his daughter Esther's name and written as Hester. (In Savage Genealogy *see notes of William Hosford 1, his d. date is given as Nov or May 08, 1698,
2 CONC  Stiles) Notes for PHILLIPA (PHILLURY) THRALL: Source LDS files, gives her death as August 08, 1683 in Windsor, Ct. Children of JOHN HOSFORD and PHILLIPA THRALL are: i. WILLIAM3 HOSFORD, b. October 25, 1658, Windsor, Hartford Co.,
