2 CONC tember 20, 1675, Windsor, Hartford Co., Ct.; d. November 08, 1698; m. DEBORAH BROWN, April 09, 1692; b. April 20, 1673, (Marlborough, Middlesex Co., MA); d. December 20, 1731, Windham, Windham Co., CT. Notes for JOHN HOSFORD: NOTE
