2 CONC  she died Jan 08, 1701/02, he married 2nd on Jan. 24, 1706 Abigail Buckland, daughter of Thomas Buckland 1 ( a freeman in 1635, probably of Dorchester, England) Timothy had six children; four of whom were by his 1st wife and two b
2 CONC y his second wife. Children of TIMOTHY HOSFORD and ABIGAIL BUCKLAND are: 5. i. ABIGAIL4 HOSFORD, b. February 28, 1706/07, Hartford County,Ct. 6. ii. TIMOTHY HOSFORD, b. September 03, 1709, Litchfield, Ct; d. April 08, 1787, South 
