2 CONT #3 Ye Horseforde booke Horsford-Hosford families in the United States of America by Hosford, Henry Hallock 3. ESTHER (3)=^ (William1) Esther (?) Horsford was born in England. She married first, Richard Samwiss (Samos, Samwais, Sam
2 CONC mis, etc.) who died Jan. 4, 1654. She married, second....Williams. The second marriage with Williams is inferred from a Conn, court record of Oct. 27, 1674, reading in part as follows: "We the underwritten; In behalf of ourselves 
2 CONC and Joan and Mary, the daughters of Richard Samwais, having received this day of the Sect y a bond, made to colony of Conn, of 60 pounds obligating ye grandfather Hosford or uncle John Hosford or our father Williams, etc. Signed: 
2 CONC John Samwais Richard Brush (or Beach)" Children of Richard and Esther (?) : i. John, born 1643. li. Johannah, born 1648. iii. Mary, born 1650.
