2 CONT Samuel Kent Jr.
2 CONT Born 26 Oct 1661 in Gloucester, Massachusettsmap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Son of Samuel Kent and Frances (Woodall) Kent
2 CONT Brother of Sarah (Kent) Crowfoot, Mary Kent and John Kent
2 CONT Husband of Priscilla (Hunter) Kent — married 1 Nov 1683 (to 7 Mar 1695) in Gloucester, Massachusettsmap
2 CONT Husband of Martha (Allen) Kent — married 28 Jul 1696 (to 23 Feb 1698) in Suffield, Hartford, Connecticutmap
2 CONT Husband of Hester (Hosford) Phelps — married 1704 [location unknown]
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Father of Samuel Kent, Samuel Kent IV, Thomas Kent, John Kent, Josiah Kent, Priscella (Kent) Brown, Martha Kent, Martha Kent, Daniel Kent, Mary (Kent) Granger and Benjamin Kent
2 CONT Died 31 May 1740 at age 78 in Suffield, Hartford, Connecticutmap
