1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Mary Kent, wife of Samuel Granger (third generation Granger in Suffield)=
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Kent was the daughter of Samuel Kent and his third wife, Hester Hosford Phelps, a widow.   Mary was the SECOND daughter named Mary that Samuel Kent and Hester Hosford had.  She was born circa 1708 in Suffield, Connecticut.  S
2 CONC he married Samuel Granger, son of Samuel Granger and Esther Hanchett, grandson of Launcelot Granger II, the first Granger to settle in Suffield.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hester Hosford, her mother was the daughter of John Hosford & Phillury Thrall; b. 27 May 1664, Windsor, CT; d. 18 Jan 1760, Suffield, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hester's two daughters named Mary were as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Mary Kent, b. 10 Jul 1704, Suffield, CT.
2 CONT * Mary Kent, b. ca. 1708, Suffield, CT; m. Samuel Granger.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hester Hosford was the third wife of Samuel Kent.  She was the widow of Joseph Phelps of Windsor who d. 1695.
