1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A Patriot of the American Revolution for CONNECTICUT.  [https://services.dar.org/Public/DAR_Research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A090082  DAR Ancestor # A090082]
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:  Information below may vary slightly with the public DAR database.  (FD)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Capt Ichabod Phelps
2 CONT * BIRTH	3 Apr 1707 
2 CONT *DEATH	8 Jan 1794 (aged 86) 
2 CONT *BURIAL	 Gilead Cemetery Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA 
2 CONT *MEMORIAL ID	7560767 · 
2 CONT *Spouse Photo	 Martha Tillotson Phelps 1715–1786
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT ''The Phelps Family of America, and Their English Ancestors, With Copies of Wills, Deeds, Letters, and Other Interesting Papers, Coats of Arms and Valuable Records,'' Compiled By Judge Oliver Seymour Phelps, of Portland, Oregon, a
2 CONC nd Andrew T. Servin of Lenox.  Fourth generation, p. 143.  < [https://archive.org/details/phelpsfamilyofam01phel/page/142/mode/2up Archive.Org] >
2 CONT
2 CONT No. 168  Capt. Ichabod Phelps, b. Windsor, Ct., 3 April, 1708, m. 10 Dec., 1730, Martha Tillotson, b. 1715, d. Hebron, Ct., 3 Feb., 1786, aged 71 years.  He m. 2nd widow Hubbell of Bolton; by her he had no issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Phelps settled in that part of Hebron known as Gilead Hill, and about twenty rods south of the Gilead meeting house.  He served in the Revolutionary war in Capt. Skinner's Co. as sergeant, enlisting Aug. 25, discharged Nov. 8,
2 CONC  1777.  He also served in the war of 1755, as captain in Col. Quartus's company.  Frequent reference is made to Captain Ichabod Phelps in manuscript records in State Library, Albany, N. Y., in war of 1755.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children, b. Hebron, Ct., by 1st wife:
2 CONT # Martha, b. 23 Sept., 1732, m. Rev. Dr. Trumbull
2 CONT # Ichabod, b. 24 Jan., 1735, d. 14 Aug., 1736
2 CONT # Abiah, b. 21 Feb., 1736-7, m. John Talcott
2 CONT # Ichabod, b. 11 Feb., 1738, m. Mary Trumbull
2 CONT # Abitha, b. 8 Feb., bpt. 19, 1940, m. Thomas Post
2 CONT # Azubah, b. 30 Oct., 1745, d. 26 Dec., 1745
2 CONT # Azelphia, b. 30 Oct., 1745, m. Dea. Asaph Trumbull
2 CONT # Daniel, b. 4 Oct., 1747, d. Oct. 3, 1753, age 6.
2 CONT # Azubah, b. 7 July, 1752, m. Zeo Case
2 CONT # Anna, b. 20 Feb 1755, m. Daniel Brown.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
