2 CONT
2 CONT Mindwell Phelps Horsford BIRTH	1682 East Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA DEATH	unknown Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA BURIAL	 Andover Road Cemetery Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA MEMORIAL ID	19416033
2 CONC 1 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 0 FLOWERS 1 Mindwell was the daughter of Joseph and Mary (Porter) Phelps.
2 CONT
2 CONT Obadiah and Mindwell were buried in "Obadiah's Nine Acres" (now Andover Road Cemetery) where Obadiah allowed the privilege of burial to all persons from the town. No marker for Mindwell remains.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Obadiah and Mindwell: 1. Anna (1705/06-aft 1773) 2. Obadiah (1) second child born in Hebron, died in infancy 3. John (Mar 7 or 9, 1707-Mar 23, 1709) 4. Daniel (1712-1773) 5. Joseph (1715-1761) 6. Aaron (1717/18-1745/46
2 CONC ) 7. Mindwell (1722-1807) 8. Obadiah (2) (1724/25-1783) Source: Ye Horseforde booke : Horseford-Hosford families in the United States of America, p. 26 The Phelps family of America and their English ancestors, p. 29
2 CONT
