1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Adam Waters, son of Samuel Waters and Anne Sterling, was born in Hebron, Tolland Co., Connecticut on June 25, 1720. He married with MARY BIGELOW, dau of Isaac Bigelow and Mary Bond. Mary and Adam moved to Rensselae
2 CONC r Co., New York. Adam died on June 2, 1804 and is buried in Maple Grove Old Cemetery, Hoosick Falls, Rensselaer Co., New York. He was known as Capt. Adam Waters.
