2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/42722996/person/19882413538/facts Ancestry Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Apr 21 2019, 23:35:14 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter to Timothy Bruce & Susanna Joslin, estimated birth 1752 or 1753.  Married first to Timothy Fisher Aug 1775 at Croydon, NH.  They had 7 children.  They lived in Bethel, VT at the time he disappeared between 1793 and 1799. 
2 CONC  She married 2nd to widower Sylvanus Owen by 1799 and their son Luman was born in the Woodstock/Bethel area.  Her burial place is undetermined but may be at Fairview or Gilead Cemetery in Bethel.
