2 CONT George Phelps was born about 1613, in England as the son of Phelps. He married Philura Randall about 1637, in Windsor, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 1 daughter. He lived
2 CONC  in Windsor, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America in 1636 and Westfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America in 1672. He died on 8 May 1687, in Westfield, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonia
2 CONC l America, at the age of 74, and was buried in Old Burying Ground, Westfield, Hampden, Massachusetts, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/37333352/george-phelps
