1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jacob Phelps Married Dorothy Ingersoll on 15 Nov 1672 in Hartford, Hartford, CT. with issues: Jededah Phelps, Benjamin Phelps, and Joseph Phelps. He had three wives.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob Phelps[1] b. Windsor, Ct., 7 Feb., 1649-50, m. Dorothy Ingersoll, 2 May, 1672, daughter and 2nd child of John and Dorothy (Lord) Ingersoll, and b. Hartford, 1654, d. Westfield, Mass. Her father, John Ingersoll, of England, i
2 CONC n Hartford in 1651, Northampton. Mass., 1666, Westfield 1668-9. He married three times. Dorothy Ford was daughter of Thomas Ford, Gentleman', and Dorothy his wife, of England, and one of the first and most prominent settlers of Ha
2 CONC rtford. Mr. Phelps settled in Westfield, Mass., where he died 6 Oct., 1689, in his 40th year. His widow, Dorothy, m. for 2nd husband a Mr. Root.[2] Children, b. Westfield. Mass.:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Phelps-78
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob Phelps was born 7 Feb 1650 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut to George Phelps and Frances (Unknown) Phelps. He is the brother of Abigail Phelps [half], Mary (Clark) Strong [half], Thomas Dewey [half], John Dewey [half], Abra
2 CONC ham Phelps [half], Josiah Dewey [half], Anna (Dewey) Woodward [half], Israel Dewey [half], Abigail (Dewey) Cutler [half], Joseph Phelps [half], Jedediah Dewey Sr [half], John Phelps and	Nathaniel Phelps
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Rachel (Clark) Phelps — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Dorothy (Ingersoll) Phelps — married 2 May 1672 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT His children are Dorothy (Phelps) Kibbe, Hannah (Phelps) Kibbe, Israel Phelps, Benjamin Phelps, Joseph Phelps and Jedediah Phelps.Jacob died 6 Sep 1689 in Westfield, Hampden, Massachusetts Profile managers: Lydia Vierson, John Ell
2 CONC is private message,  John Putnam and William Biggs  Profile last modified 20 Jun 2018 | Created 13 Sep 2010
2 CONT
