2 CONT Nathaniel Phelps (1654 - 1723)
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel Phelps
2 CONT Born 9 Dec 1654 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut Colonymap
2 CONT Son of George Phelps and Frances (Unknown) Phelps
2 CONT Brother of Abigail Phelps [half], Mary (Clark) Strong [half], Isaac Phelps [half], Thomas Dewey [half], Abraham Phelps [half], Josiah Dewey [half], Anna (Dewey) Woodward [half], Israel Dewey [half], Joseph Phelps [half], Jedediah 
2 CONC Dewey Sr [half], Jacob Phelps and John Phelps
2 CONT Husband of Grace Martin — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT Husband of Eunice (Owens) Phelps — married 1678 [location unknown]
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Father of Nathaniel Phelps Jr, Jonathan Phelps, Eunice (Phelps) Moore, Lois (Phelps) Humphrey and Lois (Phelps) Griswold
2 CONT Died 5 Jun 1723 at age 68 [location unknown]
2 CONT PROBLEMS/QUESTIONSProfile managers: April Dauenhauer private message [send private message] and Peter Spencer private message [send private message]
2 CONT Profile last modified 6 Jul 2024 | Created 28 Nov 2010
2 CONT This page has been accessed 1,138 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel was the son of George and Frances Phelps. He was born 9 Dec 1653 and died 5 June 1723 in Westfield, Hampden, Massachusetts. He married Eunice in 1673. She died 17 Dec 1738. Their children were born at Westfield.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel, born 10 Oct 1678; married Abigail Fowler, 25 Mar 1707. He died 12 Aug 1711, in the 33rd year of his age. He had children Abigail, born 15 Dec 1708, and Nathaniel, born 5 Nov 1710.
2 CONT Eunice, born 19 May 1680; died 19 May 1686.
2 CONT Jonathan, born 28 Dec 1682. Fam 18
2 CONT Thomas, born 15 May 1685; died 17 June 1686.
2 CONT Eunice, born 12 Oct 1688.
2 CONT Lois, born 7 Sep 1691; possibly married Joseph Griswold of Windsor 13 Oct 1720.
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT Memorial: Find a Grave (no image)
2 CONT Find A Grave: Memorial #256283302 (accessed 5 July 2024)
