2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT WikiTree contributors, "Timothy Buckland (1639-1689)," WikiTree: The Free Family Tree, (https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Buckland-2600 : accessed 15 August 2024).
2 CONT
2 CONT Timothy Buckland was born March 10, 1638; the son of Thomas and Temperance (Denslow) Buckland. He married Abigail Vore, daughter of Richard Vore at Windsor on March 27, 1662.[1]
2 CONT
