1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Aaron Phelps was born	19 November 1716 	Windsor, CT, son of Josiah Phelps and Abigail Griswold.  He died Apr 26 1776 at  Blandford, Hampden, Colony Of Massachusetts.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Aaron Phelps married to Mercy  Kent (1722-1748)  Aug 13 1742 at   Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut.  She was the daughter of John Kent and Mary Smith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Aaron Phelps responded with the men of Simsbury to the Lexington Alarm, April 1775.
2 CONT
