2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Hannah Phelps, daughter of Timothy and Mary (Griswold) Phelps, born b4 Aug 1684 married in 1708 to Thomas Phelps (born 21 Aug 1687 in Poquonock, CT) son of John and Sarah (Buckland) Phelps. Hannah had 8 children with William befor
2 CONC e she died in 1726.<ref>"The Phelps family of America and their English ancestors: with copies of wills, deeds, letters, and other interesting papers, coats of arms and valuable records" by Oliver Seymour Phelps, and Andrew Tinkey
2 CONC  Servin publ 1899 , p 96-97,p 111 https://archive.org/stream/phelpsfamilyofam01phel#page/111/mode/1up</ref> It appears that there may have been a Hannah Phelps who married ThomasPhelps, and an Ann Phelps, who married David Porter.
2 CONC  Both were daughters of Timothy Phelps and Mary Griswold.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT
2 CONT *S1. [http://person.ancestry.com/tree/103204003/person/390043225354/facts Ancestry.] Hannah Phelps, born 4Aug1684 in Poquonock, CT. Died Mar1728 in Windsor. Unknown parents. No sources.
2 CONT *S2. [http://person.ancestry.com/tree/103204003/person/390024861135/facts Ancestry.] Hannah or Anna Phelps, born 2Oct1686 in WIndsor CT. Died24Jan1767 in Hebron CT. Daughter of Lt. Timothy William Phelps and Mary Griswold. Wife of
2 CONC  Thomas Phelps and David Porter. 9 listed children. Many sources.
2 CONT *S3. [http://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll indiv=1&dbid=4725&h=2955875&ssrc=pt&tid=103204003&pid=390024861135&usePUB=true Family Data Collection.] Anne Phelps married David Porter on 3Jan1706 in Windsor CT. Parents: Timothy 
2 CONC and Mary William Phelps. Anne Phelps born 2Oct1686 in Windsor CT, Died 24Jan1767.
2 CONT *S4. Anne Phelps Porter, born 2Oct1686. Died 24Jan1767. Parents: Timothy Phelps and Mary Griswold. Spouse:David Porter. Unknown Burial.
2 CONT *S5. [http://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll?indiv=1&dbid=7249&h=1080812&ssrc=pt&tid=103204003&pid=390024861135&usePUB=true Millennium File.] Hannah Phelps, born 2 Aug1684 in Windsor. Spouse: Thomas Phelps.
2 CONT *S6. [http://interactive.ancestry.com/61157/46155_b289955-00021/1463356?backurl=http://person.ancestry.com/tree/103204003/person/390024861135/facts/citation/1080150233520/edit/record#?imageId=46155_b289955-00021North American Fami
2 CONC ly Histories.] Hannah Phelps, born 4Aug1684 to Timothy Phelps and Mary Griswold. There is also Ann, born 2Oct1686.
2 CONT *S7.[http://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll?indiv=1&dbid=7836&h=952300&ssrc=pt&tid=103204003&pid=390024861135&usePUB=true US and International Marriages.] Hannah Phelps, born in 1684, married Thomas Phelps in 1704.
2 CONT *S8. HISTORY OF THE TOWN OF STONINGTON, County of New London, Connecticut, from its first settlement in 1649 to 1900, by Richard Anson Wheeler, New London, CT, 1900, p. 537
