1 NOTE He came to Mass. around 1635 in the company of his uncle, Rev. Ephraim Huit. he was the executor of Huit's will in 1644.  He moved to Windsor in 1639.  Huit was fromKenilworth, England.  His second wife was thewidow of Simon Wolco
