1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Mary Newberry''' was christened 22 Oct 1626 in Whitchurch Canonicorum, Dorset, England. She died 29 Aug 1688 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut. [1] [2] [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:  Thomas Newberry (1594-1635) and Jane Dabinot (1600-1629).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:
2 CONT # on 13 June 1644 in Windsor CT to '''Capt. Daniel Clark''' (ca. 1622-1710) as his first wife [4], who married Martha Pitkin, the widow of Mr. Wolcott, as his second wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary Newberry and Daniel Clark: [1] [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT # Mary born 24 Apr 1645 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut.
2 CONT # Josiah born 21 Jan 1648 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut.
2 CONT # Elizabeth born 28 Oct 1651 and died 22 Dec 1729.
2 CONT # Daniel born 4 Apr 1654 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut.
2 CONT # John born 10 Apr 1656 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut.
2 CONT # Mary born 22 Sep 1658 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut.
2 CONT # Samuel born 6 Jul 1661 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut.
2 CONT # Sarah born 7 Aug 1663 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut.
2 CONT # Hannah born 29 Aug 1665 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut.
2 CONT # Nathaniel born 8 Sep 1666 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Weblinks==
2 CONT
