2 CONC #v=onepage&q=Mary%20Beane%201625&f=false Torrey, Clarence A, and Elizabeth P. Bentley. New England Marriages Prior to 1700. Baltimore, Md: Genealogical Pub. Co, 1985. p. 154]
2 CONT
