2 CONT
2 CONT * [1] Stiles, Henry Reed, The History and Genealogies of Ancient Windsor, Connecticut (Camden, Maine: Picton Press, 1992.), 2:153, 2:161, 2:179, 2:518, Los Angeles Public Library, Gen 974.62 W77St-1 1992.
2 CONT
2 CONT * [2] Bartlett, Joseph Gardner, Newberry Genealogy (Boston: J. G. Bartlett, 1914.), p. 45, Los Angeles Public Library, 929.2 N535.
2 CONT
2 CONT * [3] Flagg, Ernest, Genealogical Notes on the Founding of New England (Hartford, Connecticut: Case, Lockwood & Brainard, 1927.), p. 282, Los Angeles Public Library, 929.2 F574.
2 CONT
2 CONT * [4] Torrey, p. 154.
2 CONT
