1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Josiah Clark was born Jan. 21, 1648, son of Daniel and Mary (Newberry)Clark. He was baptized January 28, 1648. He married Mary (Burr) Crow before 1682. He died after Jan. 13, 1682.<ref>D., Payne-Joyce. "Pane-Joyce Genealogy." Pane
2 CONC -Joyce Genealogy. Accessed September 24, 2016. http://aleph0.clarku.edu/~djoyce/gen/report/rr04/rr04_027.html.</ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Josiah and Mary:
2 CONT #Josiah b. 1682.
2 CONT
