1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Elizabeth Clark''' was born 28 Oct 1651 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut. She died 22 Dec 1729 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut. [1] [2] [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:  Captain Daniel Clark (1622-1710) and Mary Newberry (1626-1688).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:
2 CONT # on 25 Nov 1669 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut to Moses Cooke, (1645-1676), son of Major Aaron Cooke and Mary Cooke.
2 CONT #  on 13 Sep 1677 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut to Lieutenant Job Drake (1652-1711), son of Sergeant Job Drake and Mary Wolcott.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Clark and Job Drake:
2 CONT # Job born 26 Oct 1678 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut. He died 15 Oct 1712 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut. [1]
2 CONT # Mary born 29 Apr 1680 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut. [1]
2 CONT # Jacob born 29 Jan 1683 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut. [1]
2 CONT # Sarah born 10 May 1686 and died 20 Jan 1748.
2 CONT
