2 CONT * [2] Anderson, Robert Charles, The Great Migration Begins: Immigrants to New England, 1620-1633 (Boston: New England Historic Genealogical Society, 1995-), 1:466, Los Angeles Public Library, Gen 974 A549.
2 CONT * [3] Bartlett, Joseph Gardner, Newberry Genealogy (Boston: J. G. Bartlett, 1914.), p. 45, Los Angeles Public Library, 929.2 N535.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Moses Cooke (1669 until his death in 1676) and then  Job Drake (m.9-13-1677) who was born 3-28-1652 and died 12-19-1711.  Mother of Sarah Drake Wolcott (#31933749) who was wife of Governor Roger Wolcott (#10173164).  Also 
2 CONC mother of Jacob Drake (#83925592).* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/54474430/elizabeth-drake Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 16 2021, 19:34:17 UTC''
