2 CONT 1690, 29 Apr: Nathaniel CLARKE of Windsor, Connecticut wrote his will. Gives his estate, both of housing and lands, that by deed of gift is passed over to me by my honoured father Capt. Da niel CLARKE, and all other estate that I 
