1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *  Title History of the town of Goshen, Connecticut: with genealogies and biographies based upon the records of Deacon Lewis Mills Norton, 1897
2 CONT *     Authors Augustine George Hibbard, Lewis Mills Norton
2 CONT *     Publisher Press of the Case, Lockwood & Brainard Co, 1897
2 CONT *     Original from Princeton University
2 CONT *     Digitized Oct 20, 2010
2 CONT *     Length 602 pages
2 CONT *     Subjects Goshen (Conn.) Registers of births, etc
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 476
2 CONT
2 CONT III. NATHANIEL LEWIS (s. William and Mary (Cheever) Lewis, William), b. Farmington Oct. 1, 1676; d. Feb. 24, 1752; m. (1) Nov. 25, 1699, Abigail, dau. of David and Hannah (Grover) Ashley, b. Westfield, Mass., April 27, 1681; d. Ap
2 CONC ril 11, 1723; (2) July 4, 1726, Widow Thankful (Pomeroy) Lyman, b. Northampton, Mass., May 31, 1769; d. Sept. 18, 1733; dau. of Medad and Experience (Woodward) Pomeroy and widow of Lieut. Benjamin Lyman, by whom she had 12 childre
2 CONC n. She returned to Northampton after her husband's death, in 1752. Mr. Lewis owned the covenant May 9, 1708, and, with his wife, joined the church March 19, 1710.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children, born Farmington, by first wife:
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Abigail''', b. Nov. 15, 1701; m. Joseph Lyman.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel, b. Jan. 1, 1703; m. Rachel Kelsey.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisha, b. Dec. 3, 1705; d. April 28, 1708.
2 CONT
2 CONT Noadiah, b. April 27, 1708; m. Elizabeth Smith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisha, b. July 23, 1710; m. .
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah, b. May 8. 1712; m. Joseph Hooker.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary, b. Dec. 18. 1714; m. (1) James Stimson; (2) Eliahaz Andrews.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mercy, b. April 16, 1717: d. Aug. 2, 1718.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ezekiel. b. Nov. 19. 1718: m. (1) Sarah Wait; (2) Widow Anne Porter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Phineas, b. April 11, 1722; m. Sarah Norton.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://books.google.com/books?id=OutSAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA476&lpg=PA476&dq=%22Nathaniel+Lewis%22+1676&source=bl&ots=_I2aSLXbWA&sig=juc2Fg55yzempEk9SBrwj86ASNw&hl=en&sa=X&ei=eVb-U_njBpTmoATBoYKoAQ&ved=0CGgQ6AEwCTgK#v=onepage&q=%22Nathanie
2 CONC l%20Lewis%22%201676&f=false
2 CONT
