1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *     Title: The Clark genealogy; some descendents of Daniel Clark, of Windsor, Conn., 1639-1913 (1913)
2 CONT *     Author: Walton, Emma Lee, b. 1874
2 CONT *     Subject: Clark, Daniel, 1622-1710; Clark family
