2 CONT Page 84
2 CONT
2 CONT 231 Joseph Clark (Samuel 4, Samuel 3, Samuel 2, Daniel 1), born Oct. 8, 1749; died Dec. 18, 1828; married (1) Anna Barnard; (2) Lydia Cook, who died Aug. 13, 181 5. Northampton, Mass.
2 CONT
2 CONT 435 i Anna Laura, child of first wife, died in infancy.
2 CONT
2 CONT 436 ii Anna Laura, born July 4, 1788; died Aug. 15, 1 86 1 ; unmarried.
2 CONT
2 CONT 437 iii Joseph Hawley, born March 30, 1790; died Nov. 22, 1825 ; married Nancy Gardner.
2 CONT
2 CONT 438 iv George Miller, born Dec. 1, 1792; died March 22, 1826; married Parthenia Dunkin.
2 CONT
2 CONT 439 v Elizabeth Owen, born Dec. 28, 1799; died Sept. 27, 1863; married Oct. 16, 1830, Dr. Samuel Shaw.
2 CONT
2 CONT 440 vi '''Frederick Watson''', born July 29, 1804; died June 20, 1883; married Feb. 14, 1837, Lucinda Boleyn.
2 CONT
2 CONT 441 vii Francis Ellis, born April 3, 1807; died Sept. 8, 1809.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia Cook was the daughter of Capt. Joseph Cook and Lydia Miller.
2 CONT
2 CONT (Stiles' Windsor Appendix; Miss Anna Clark of Northampton.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 130
2 CONT
2 CONT 440 '''Frederick Watson Clarke''' (Joseph 5, Samuel 4,  Samuel 3, Samuel 2, Daniel 1), born July 9, 1804; died  June 20, 1883; married Feb. 4, 1837, Lucinda Boleyn,  daughter of Elijah Boleyn and Electa Pease, who died  June 20, 1
2 CONC 887. Northampton, Mass. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 834 i Julia Cook, born Aug. 25, 1838. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 835 ii Elizabeth Wright, born Nov. 15, 1840; died Sept. 28, 1848. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 836 iii Annie Barnard, born Nov. 17, 1842. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 837 iv Josephine Hawley, born Oct. 11, 1846; died Oct. 18, 1850. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Miss Annie B. Clarke.) 
