2 CONT 235 Samuel Clarke (Samuel 4, Samuel 3, Samuel 2, Daniel 1), born July 2, 1758 ; died July 10, 1847; married ( 1 ) 1783, Jerusha Phillips, who died Aug. 30, 1795; (2) 1800, Lucretia Sheldon, who died July 10, 1847.
2 CONT
2 CONT 442 i Abigail Phillips, born July 10, 1784; died Oct. 10, 1851 ; unmarried.
2 CONT
2 CONT 443 ii Richard, born Dec. 4, 1785; died June 29, 1876; married May 25, 1809, Olive Cleveland.
2 CONT
2 CONT 444 iii Samuel, born July 23, 1787; died Sept. 16, 1874; married (1) Ann Stebbins ; (2) Aurelia Burt Woodbury.
2 CONT
2 CONT 445 iv John, born May 13, 1789; died July 5, 1869; married Prudence Graves.
2 CONT
2 CONT 446 v Edward, born April 25, 1791 ; died July 21, 1858; married (1) Frances Blake; (2) Mary Blake.
2 CONT
2 CONT 447 vi Christopher, born July 31, 1793; died Sept. 28, 1838; married Harriet Butler.
2 CONT
2 CONT 448 vii '''Jerusha Phillips''', born Aug. 31, 1802; died March 31, 1859; married Oct. 16, 1828 (Changed her name to '''Jerusha Clarke Phillips'''), Daniel Parish.
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 133
2 CONT
2 CONT 448 '''Jerusha Phillips Clarke''' (Samuel 5, Samuel  4, Samuel 3, Samuel 2, Daniel 1), born Aug. 31, 1802;  died March 31, 1859; married Daniel Parish. Mrs.  Parish changed her name to '''Mrs. Jerusha Clarke Phillips'''. Northampt
