2 CONT He served in Colonel Phelps Regt. during the Revolutionary War and died at age 76, per Hale Cemetery records and headstone. W1104
2 CONT
2 CONT Do not confuse this Reuben Phelps with Ens. Reuben Phelps, who married Mary Hosford.
