2 CONT John was known as a hardworking man, and bore the reputation in the community for being clever and talented, and capable of accomplishing almost any sort of handicraft. Loditha's parents were born in Connecticut. Loditha's brother
2 CONC  Truman Messenger married John's sister Lois Higley. John died on the farm upon which he was born, probity buried there, Canton, Hartford County, Connecticut.
