2 CONT Married three times, (1) 1 Apr 1737 to Ruth Holcomb (2) married 1740 to Sarah Case she died June 12, 1756. (3) married abt 1763 after seven years to Mrs Eunice Smith
2 CONT No Marker
2 CONT Joseph's occupation; owner of considerable amounts of land. Sarah's parents were born in Connecticut. Chosen Surveyor of Highways, and district committeeman. Military; First Company Train Band and promoted to rank of Captain. He w
2 CONC as fond of his flip, apple-jack and cider-mug. Ruth's sister Hester Holcombe married Joseph's brother Brewster Higley.
2 CONT 10 children are known.
