2 CONT "John Burr died May 5, 1741, age about 71." On September 21, 1741, his heirs settled his estate. The agreement was signed by wife Sarah; sons Ebenezer, John, Stephen, Noahdiah, Gideon and Nathaniel; daughters Thankful and her husb
2 CONC and Ephram Brown, Sarah and her husband Joseph Gillette, Miraim and her husband Nathaniel Case, and Eunice and her husband Samuel Case. 
2 CONT
