1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "The Four Spencer Brothers", 1950, compiled by Donald Lines Jacobus, "The American Genealogist. New Haven, CT: D. L. Jacobus, 1937-. (Online database. AmericanAncestors.org. New England Historic Genealogical Societ
2 CONC y, 2009 - .)" viewed by Kris Stewart, Jun 11, 2013
