2 CONT *http://books.google.com/books?id=UdEUAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA1332&lpg=PA1332&dq=Jared+Spencer+1614&source=bl&ots=q7gzXj3diO&sig=CH_fn5Nek5iWcm0Bw21ZHFvZbwY&hl=en&ei=6JGLTdvKG4TWtQO_pY2FCQ&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=3&ved=0CCAQ6AE
2 CONC wAjgK#v=onepage&q=Jared%20Spencer%201614&f=false
