2 CONT *	"THE ENGLISH ORIGIN OF AGNES HARRIS OF HARTFORD, CONN., WIFE OF WILLIAM1 SPENCER AND WILLIAM 1 EDWARDS" by Douglas Richardson; The American Genealogist. New Haven, CT: D. L. Jacobus, 1937-. (Online database. AmericanAncestors.or
2 CONC g. New England Historic Genealogical Society, 2009 - .) viewed by Kris Stewart, May 11, 2013.  excellent article explaining how the parents of Agnes are known. Link to subscription database: < [https://www.americanancestors.org/da
