1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Elizabeth Spencer''', daughter of Rev. William Spencer & Agnes Harris, married 1) William Wellman and, after his death, Jacob Joy. She & William had 8 children. Jacob & Elizabeth had 4 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth's ancestry can be traced back to Charlemagne, through her mother, Agnes Harris. "The Royal Ancestry of Agnes Harris" 
2 CONT
