1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.holcombegenealogy.com/g0/p41.htm#i2038
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Holcombe was born on 23 June 1668 at Windsor, Hartford Co., CT. She was the daughter of Joshua Holcombe and Ruth Sherwood. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Holcombe married John Case, son of John Case and Sarah Spencer, in 1693. Sarah Holcombe died in 1763 at Simsbury, Hartford Co., CT. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >Bowman: Weir is in error here stating that Sarah married Bartholomew Case.
2 CONT
2 CONT >Ruth Cost Duncan does not show a marrige by Sarah to a Bartholomew and does not show a marriage of Bartholomew (John's younger brother) to anyone other than Mary Humphrey.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Updated 29 October 2023''.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children are listed in Goodwin and Savage's Genealogical Dictionary.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of John Case and Mary Olcott:
2 CONT # John Case b. 6 Aug 1685, d. young
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Case and Sarah Holcomb:
2 CONT # John Case+ b. 22 Aug 1694, d. 2 Dec 1752. Married Abigail Humphrey,   
2 CONT # Sgt. Daniel Case+ b. 7 Mar 1695/96, d. 28 May 1733. Married Penelope Buttolph.  
2 CONT # Mary Case b. 1698, d. 1732.  Married Josiah Alford.
2 CONT # Sarah Case+ b. 14 May 1699, d. 5 Oct 1750.  Married John Alderman.
2 CONT # Capt. Jonathan Case+ b. 15 Apr 1701, d. Jun 1787. Married Mary Beaman.
2 CONT # Hannah Case+ b. 1709, d. 18 Sep 1799.  Married Capt. Noah Humphrey.  
