1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Drake-Alford/6000000003681267560?through=6000000003017353920 or https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Adams/6000000003017327063
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mary Case was born in 1698.''' and died about 1732.  She was the daughter of John Case and Sarah Holcombe. As of 29 October 2023, there do not seem to be records for her birth, marriage, or death, although she appears in variou
2 CONC s compilations.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage notes
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.holcombegenealogy.com/g0/p41.htm#i2043
2 CONT
2 CONT Bowman discussed in detail the Mary Case's and Joseph Adams'. There was this pair, on page 54 of her genealogy and then another pair on page 56.  “Mary Case married Joseph Adams in 1726. Mary Case died in 1732.”
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE:
2 CONT Source:  WikiTree (10/29/23) refutes the information presented below, in that it attributes the wife of Joseph Adams, Mary (Case) Adams, as the daughter of William Case and Elizabeth (Holcomb) Case-Marshall, and the Adams marriage
2 CONC  occurring 30Apr1719, Simsbury, she being born 23Aug1696, Simsbury.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Goodwin, Nathaniel.  (1899). “Genealogical Notes, or Contributions to the Family History of Some of the First Settlers of Connecticut and Massachusetts”. Page 276-277.  ([https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000199625842
2 CONC 900 document attached]) lists this Mary Case as married to Josiah Alford.
2 CONT
2 CONT However, that Mary is well described in Simsbury Vital Records as the daughter of Samuel Case and Mary Westover, who married 1) John Drake 2) Josiah Alford (1696-1768).   https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Drake-Alford/6000000003681
2 CONC 267560?through=6000000003017353920.  Her family is described in Gay, Frank. ''The Descendants of John Drake of Windsor, Connecticut'' (Tuttle Co., Rutland, VT, 1933) Page 30-1. < [https://archive.org/details/descendantsofjoh00gaya
2 CONC /page/30/mode/1up Archive.Org] >
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Birth date 
2 CONT
2 CONT Was showing as October 01, 1698.  Cannot find a source for the date.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/59573421/sarah-case Shows:  Mary Case b: 15 NOV 1697 in Simsbury Hartford co CT.  But that  is the date for Mary Case, daughter of Samuel Case.
2 CONT
2 CONT There does not seem to be a listing of her birth at “The Barbour Collection.”  The Holcomb genealogy books (not available online)  have her born about 1698.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
