2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === 	Sarah Case
2 CONT * Gender	Female
2 CONT * Birth: before 14 May 1699 - Simsbury, Hartford County, Connecticut
2 CONT * Baptized: 14 May 1699 - Simsbury, Hartford County, Connecticut
2 CONT * Death: Oct 5 1790 - Simsbury, Hartford County, Connecticut
2 CONT * Burial: East Granby Cemetery, Hartford County, Connecticut
2 CONT * Parents: John Case (d. 1733) and Sarah Holcomb
2 CONT * Spouse: John Alderman - married Oct 28 1719 - Simsbury, Hartford County, Connecticut 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.holcombegenealogy.com/g0/p41.htm#i2045
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sarah Case''' was baptized on 14 May 1699. She was the daughter of John Case and Sarah Holcombe. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Case married John Alderman, son of William Alderman and Mary Case, on 28 October 1719 at Simsbury, Hartford Co., CT. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Case died on 5 October 1750 at age 51.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sarah Case and John Alderman
2 CONT # John Alderman Jr. b. 19 Aug 1720, d. 6 Jul 1778
2 CONT # Elijah Alderman+ b. 1722, d. 11 Jan 1779
2 CONT # Ezekiel Alderman b. 1724, d. 4 Feb 1765
2 CONT # Sarah Alderman b. c 1727
2 CONT # Naomi Alderman
2 CONT # Daniel Alderman+ b. 8 Oct 1738, d. 15 Jul 1790
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Tombstone inscription:
2 CONT
2 CONT >Mrs Sary the wife of John Alderman died Oct 5th 1750 aged 52
2 CONT
