1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT 5 Amy Reade, daughter of Dr. Philip Reade and Abigail Rice, was born on 3 Mar 1678/1679 in Concord, Middlesex, MA. Amy died in 1746, she was 67.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Richard Case on 1 September 1701, in Simsbury, Hartford, Connecticut Colony.  He was born on 27 August 1669, in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut, son of John Case and Sarah Spencer, and died on 27 April 1746, in Simsbury
2 CONC , Hartford, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 76.
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of Richard Case and Amy Reade were:
2 CONT
2 CONT # F Amy Case 1702-1703
2 CONT # F Amy CASE 1704-1792
2 CONT # M Timothy Case 1708-1754
2 CONT # M Richard Jr Case 1710-1769
2 CONT # F Margaret CASE 1713-1750
2 CONT # M Edward CASE 1715-1746
2 CONT # F Lydia CASE 1718-1740
2 CONT # M Abraham Case 1720-1800
2 CONT # F Mary CASE 1722-1740
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Goodwin, Nathaniel. ''Genealogical Notes, or Contributions to the Family History of Some of the First Settlers of Connecticut and Massachusetts''. New Orleans, LA, USA: L. Graham & Son, printers, 1899.  “Case Family.”  Page 287, P
2 CONC erson # VI.  < [https://www.ancestry.com/sharing/38883676?mark=7b22746f6b656e223a226f624f73684770793931435850346e356463713047477744344b74314b57513176756f6e7272455042424d3d222c22746f6b656e5f76657273696f6e223a225632227d AncestryShar
2 CONC ing] > 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000219030965846&size=large}}
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # Concord, Middlesex, Massachusetts, United States. Births, Marriages, and Deaths, 1635-1850. (Boston: Beacon Press, 1891), 22. “Amy daught'r of Philip Read born 3. 1. 78-9. [3 Mar 1678/79]”
2 CONT # McCracken, George E. "Dr. Philip Reade and His Earlier Descendants", in The New England Historical and Genealogical Register. (Boston: New England Historic Genealogical Society), 112:125. “Children of Dr. Philip Reade and Abigai
2 CONC l Rice: Amy, b. Concord 3 Mar 1678/9, living in 1746 [date of husband's probate], m. Simsbury, CT, 1 Sep 1701 Richard Case.”
2 CONT # Bates, Albert C. Simsbury, Connecticut, Births, Marriages and Deaths. (Hartford, Connecticut), 19. “Richard case the son of John case of Simsbury was Marryd to Ammi the daughter of philip reade of concord September first day one
2 CONC  thousand seven Hundred and one.”
