1 NAME Sarah /Griswold/
2 GIVN Sarah
2 SURN Griswold
2 _MARNM Pinney
2 NICK Sarah (Griswold) Phelps
2 NICK Phelps
2 NICK Pinney
1 SEX F
1 BAPM
2 DATE 10 JAN 1635
2 PLAC Kenilworth, Warwickshire, England
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1638
2 PLAC Kenilworth, Warwickshire, England
2 ADDR
1 BURI
2 DATE AFT 16 NOV 1715
