1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====
2 CONT Mary Phelps b: 26 OCT 1658 in Poquonock CT. d. Mar. 1715, Simsbury, CT), daughter of Samuel PHELPS
2 CONT
2 CONT DANIEL ADAMS of Simsbury, Conn., born 1652, died 17th November 1713; served under Major Willard in King Philip's War; member of Connecticut House of Representatives from Simsbury, 1699 to 1703; married 20th September 1677, Mary PH
2 CONC ELPS, daughter of Samuel and Sarah (Griswold) PHELPS.
2 CONT
2 CONT ISSUE:
2 CONT * I     Daniel, b. 1679, d. 11 Jan 1713
2 CONT * II.   Sarah, m. 22 Feb 1704, Thomas Stevens.
2 CONT * III.  Samuel, d. Apr, 1772, m. 2 Jul 1713, Elizabeth Read
2 CONT * IV.   Joseph, b. 1685.
2 CONT * V.   Thomas b. 1689, d. 24 Feb 1784; m. 25 Dec 1712, Martha Buttolph
2 CONT * VI.   Benjamin, b. 1695, d. 3 Oct 1770; m. (firstly) 25 Mar 1712, Rachel Case; m. (secondly) 27 May 1734, L____ Griswold.
2 CONT * VII.  Thankful, bap. 4 Mar 1697, d. 21 Feb 1699.
2 CONT * VIII. Marcy, bap. 16 Jan 1698; m. Daniel Porter.
2 CONT * IX.   Mary, bap. 16 Jan 1698; d. 29 Mar 1700.
2 CONT * X.    Ephraim, bap. 25 May 1701; m. 5 May 1726, Ruth Beaman.
2 CONT * XI.  Thankful, m. 17th May 1721, Robert Westland.
2 CONT
