1 NOTE CONFUSION ON MAIDEN NAME-  From the book, Arza Adams, Chronicle of a Pioneer, Expanded Edition by Dale W. Adams. p. 11, footnote 14.  "There is confusion about the maiden name of Daniel's wife and also about their marriage date.  
2 CONC Stiles and also Holbrook state that Mary's maiden name was Pinney, daughter of Samuel Pinney.  Holbrook also list two dates for Daniel and Mary's marriage, December 20, 1677 and September 20 1677.  The name confusion may have aris
2 CONC en because Mary Phelps' father died and her mother remarried Nathaniel Pinney.  Daniel's older brother John married Abigail Pinney on December 6, 1677.
