1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Josiah Phelps 
2 CONT *BIRTH	15 Dec 1667 Poquonock, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH	4 Mar 1773 (aged 105) Poquonock, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA 
2 CONT *BURIAL	Unknown, Specifically: Buried in Poquonock, Hartford County, Connecticut MEMORIAL ID	148239116 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/148239116/josiah-phelps
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 0 FLOWERS 0 
2 CONT
2 CONT Josiah Phelps was born December 15, 1667 at Poquonock, Hartford County, Connecticut to Samuel and Sarah Griswold Phelps. He married Sarah Winchell April 26, 1690 at Poquonock and their children were: Samuel, Sarah, Lois, Damaras, 
2 CONC Mary (#72698698), Jerusha, Pinney (possible child), Josiah, Lois, Ruth, Ruth (again) and Isaac. Josiah died at the age of 105, March 4, 1773 and is buried in Poquonock.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bio by John E. Sherman
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members Parents Photo	 Samuel Phelps 1621–1669
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Griswold Phelps Pinney 1631–1715
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse Photo	 Sarah Winchell Phelps 1674–1733 (m. 1690)
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings Sarah Phelps Moore 1653–1732
2 CONT
2 CONT Half Siblings Photo	 Nathaniel Pinney 1671–1764
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Pinney Grant 1673 – unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT Children Photo	 Josiah Phelps 1708–1791
2 CONT
