1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Note: Listing of all his children and most of his grandchildren are contained in the Litchfield book by Woodruff
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT GIBBS, BENJAMIN, from Windsor, Conn.; b. 1675 ; m. Abigail Marshall, Sept. 16, 1708; she d. Jan. II, 1767, ae. 80.
2 CONT
2 CONT Between 1711 and 1734, they had 14 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Benjamin, b. April 23, 1710, in Windsor; d. Sept. 29,1798.
2 CONT # Zebulon, b. Aug. 10, 1711, in Windsor.
2 CONT # Henry, b. Aug. 5, 1713, in Windsor.
2 CONT # Abigail, b. March 16, 1715, in Windsor.
2 CONT # Hannah, b. Nov. 2, 1716, in Windsor.
2 CONT # David, b. , in Windsor.
2 CONT # William, b. June 10, 1718, in Windsor.
2 CONT # Gershom, b. July 28, 1721 ; first white male born in Litchfield. (See Exodus II, 22. G. C. W.)
2 CONT # Zadock, b. April 9, 1723.
2 CONT # Elizabeth, b. Feb. 3, 1725.
2 CONT # Sarah, b. Jan. 28, 1727.
2 CONT # Caleb, b. Nov. 13, 1729.
2 CONT # Justice, b. July Ig, 1731.
2 CONT # Remembrance, b. Feb. 4, 1734.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
