1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Mercy Ruggles''', daughter of Rev. '''Benjamin Ruggles''' and '''Mercy Woodbridge''', born of record Nov. 6, 1697 at Suffield, later until 1740 located in Massachusetts, now in Connecticut She died November 10, 
2 CONC 1761 at Simsbury, Æ 65.
2 CONT
2 CONT On June 30, 1714 of record at Simsbury, '''Mercy''' married '''Jonathan Humphry''' (q.v. Humphrey), son of Lieut. '''Samuel Humphry''' and '''Mary Mills''', born of record at Simsbury, Connecticut December 2, 1688, where he died o
2 CONC f record June 17, 1749, Æ 61, not June 7, 1743 as transcribed in 1934 for the Hale Connecticut Cemetery database. They had one known child, daughter '''Marcy''', who in 1735 married her cousin '''Dea. Michael Humphrey'''.
