2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marcy Humphrey''' (q.v. Humphry), daughter of '''Jonathan Humphrey''', Esq. and '''Mercy Ruggles''', b. of record Oct. 21, 1717 at Simsbury. She died of record at Norfolk, May 14, 1793, Æ 76, but no extant gravestone exists for
2 CONC  her.
2 CONT
2 CONT On September 15, 1735 at Simsbury, '''Marcy''' m. her cousin '''Deacon Michael Humphrey''' (q.v. Humphry), Esq., eldest son of '''Deacon John Humphrey''' and '''Sarah Pettibone''', born of record November 20, 1703 at Simsbury, Con
2 CONC necticut.  He died of record January 26, 1778 at Norfolk, Conn., Æ 75 (g.s.). They had nine children born of record at Simsbury before relocating to Norfolk, Connecticut and will be (are) summarized in their father's memorial.
