2 CONT * Sarah Stebbins
2 CONT * Born 1622 England
2 CONT * His wife died Springfield November 9, 1649
2 CONT * Children John, James, Mary
2 CONT
2 CONT Second Marriage January 2, 1651
2 CONT * Married Widow Martha KRITCHWELL (Martha Chapman)
2 CONT * Martha's first marriage, Samuel Ketcherel 1619-1650
2 CONT * Born 1616 Apr 7 Tring, Hertfordshire, England
2 CONT * She died December 17, 1662 Springfield, MA
2 CONT * Father Simon Chapman 1583-1616
2 CONT * Mother Marye Heath 1594-1629
2 CONT * Children with Samuel Kitcherell-Samuel, Martha, Hannah
2 CONT * Children with Anthony Dorchester-Benjamin, Sarah, Hester
2 CONT
