2 CONT #  Joanna Loomis b. 22 Oct 1665
2 CONT #  Benjamin Loomis b. 11 Feb 1667 or 1668, d. 1726
2 CONT #  Nehemiah Loomis b. 15 Jul 1670, d. 4 Feb 1740
2 CONT #  William Loomis+ b. 18 Mar 1672, d. 1738
2 CONT #  Philip Loomis+ b. 22 Feb 1675, d. 1 Dec 1746
2 CONT #  Mary Loomis b. 16 Aug 1678
2 CONT
