2 CONC orcas, Thankful b. 1744 married Isaac Warren and a Mr. Johnson, Joseph (1747-1831) married Sabrina Ann Darwin and Elizabeth Noble, Naomi (1748-1843) married Gideon King, Sarah b. 1750, Margaret b. and d. 1751, Mehitable (1754-1818
2 CONC ) married Aaron Bagg, Ezra (1756-1845) married Anna Squires, Ann (1760-1828) married Hickock Hubbell, and Esther (b. 1762).
