2 CONT EBENZER5 KILBURN, SR. (JOHN4, SGT. JOHN3, THOMAS2, JOHN1) was born March 10, 1678/79 in Glastonbury Hartford CT, and died 1732 in Hanover Twp, Hunterdon New Jersey. He married (1) SARAH FOX June 01, 1698 in Glastonbury Hartford CT
2 CONC , daughter of JOHN FOX and SARAH LARRABEE. She was born 1681 in New London CT, and died October 18, 1714 in New Jersey. He married (2) ELIZABETH DAVIS May 04, 1715. 
2 CONT
