2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebecca Ordway was born on 16 Jan 1713/4 in Lebanon, Connecticut the daughter of Jacob and Rebecca Wright[1].
2 CONT
2 CONT On 7 Jun 1732 in Lebanon she married Gideon Hunt[2] son of Thomas Sr. and Mary Hunt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children Include:
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Hunt 1734–1805
2 CONT Dorothy Hunt 1738–1762
2 CONT Theodore Hunt 1741–1747
2 CONT
2 CONT
