2 CONT When Benjamin Lyman Sr. was born on 30 January 1734, in Lebanon, New London, Connecticut, United States, his father, Issac Lyman, was 52 and his mother, Rebecca Ordway, was 21. He married Sarah French on 14 January 1759, in Lebano
2 CONC n, New London, Connecticut, United States. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 2 daughters. He died on 15 September 1799, in Bolton, Warren, New York, United States, at the age of 65.
2 CONT
