2 CONT ==brief biography and family==
2 CONT From her Find A Grave memorial:
2 CONT
2 CONT >Mary Sexton was daughter of Gershom Sexton and Hannah Pease of Enfield, CT. She married first, Joseph Bartholomew on Jan 13,1741 in Wallingford and second, Benjamin Atwater on Jul 17, 1784. One of her children was Isaac Bartholom
2 CONC ew who married Martha Moss, both of Wallingford.
