2 CONT
2 CONT The Connecticut Town Birth Records, pre 1870 show that Elizabeth Wilcox and her twin sister Martha Wilcox were born on 03 Mar 1737 in Hebron, Tolland, Connecticut, USA. Family tree information in Ancestry shows that Elizabeth died
2 CONC  in Sandsfield, Berkshire, Massachusetts, USA and was buried in Elizabeth, Union, New Jersey, USA Their father was Ebenezer Wilcox and her mother was Elizabeth Dewey Wilcox. She married Jonathan Webster on 11 May 1763 in Hebron, T
2 CONC olland, Connecticut, USA. Children: Jonathan Webster 1764 – 1817 Joel Webster 1772 – 1813 Martha Webster 1770 - 1844 Elizabeth Betsey Webster 1768 - 1847 Ebenezer Webster 1766 - 1809
