1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Spofford-178
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mehitable Spofford''' was the daughter of Thomas Spofford and Bethiah Haseltine.[1]. She was born 31 Jan 1707 in Boxford, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony.[1], and died 11 Feb 1767 in Rehoboth, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony.
2 CONC [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Nathaniel Bliss 4 Sep 1723 in Lebanon, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bliss-390
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel Bliss, son of Nathaniel Bliss and Mary Wright, was born 26 Oct 1704 in Enfield, New London, Connecticut, and died on 23 Nov 1771.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Born to Nathaniel and Margaret Spofford Bliss:
2 CONT
2 CONT Surname: BLISS
2 CONT
2 CONT # Elijah b. 1727-09-09 d. single in Cornwallis Nova Scotia in 1788 of smallpox's
2 CONT # Mehitable b. 1728-08-10
2 CONT # Mary b. 1731-01-04 d. 1731-01-04
2 CONT # Mary b. 1732-03-02 m: on Oct 11, 1750 Daniel Bascum
2 CONT # Joseph b. 1733-02-08 d. 1734-06-11
2 CONT # Patience b 1734-06-02
2 CONT # Nathaniel b. 1736-08-05 d. 1778
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
