2 CONC is native land in 1630; and no trace is seen at Roxbury of him, pr his family, nor can the name be found there before 1649.  At Springfield he married July 14, 1639, Sarah, daughter of Rowland Stebbins which was the third marriage
2 CONC  in that town, of any English "GD FSNE Freeman 1665."
2 CONT
