2 CONT Name[1]	Nathaniel Dumbleton
2 CONT Gender	Male
2 CONT Birth[1][2][3]	10 Jun 1664	Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts, United States
2 CONT Marriage Banns	28 Nov 1696	Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts, United States
