0 @N6000000000337364619@ NOTE 125.  ENSIGN JOB LOOMIS, b. Jan. 21, 1686; m. April 27, 1710, Abigail Filley, b. Jan. 
1 CONT       3, 1679, d. 1758. He was appointed an ensign in 1729, and d. Jan. 6, 1765. One of the 
1 CONT       136 Torrington Twp. patentees, 1732. Windsor. 3 ch'n. 
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT 343.  JOE, b. Mch. 11, 1710-11.+ 
1 CONT 344.  ABIGAIL, b. Apr. 10, 1713-14; m. Aug. 
1 CONT       9, 1733, General Benjamin, d. 
1 CONT       Mch 18, 1776, son of Benjamin Allyn. 
1 CONT       She d. May 29, 1795. Windsor. 
1 CONT       Ch'n: 1. Abigail, 2. Benjamin, 3. 
1 CONT       Abigail, 4. John. 5. Samuel, 6. Eunice, 
1 CONT       7. Ann, 8. Job. 9, Dorothy, 10, Job. 
