1 CONT
1 CONT Mary Ellsworth (1254) b. Windsor, Mch. 1, 1706; [prob. the one who d. Feb. 1, 1778, "in 71st yr.," and m. Ensign Isaac Owen (d. Jan, 3, 1775, ‘ 72; s. of Isaac Owen and Sarah Holcomb)]. 
