1 CONC iege of Louisburg; 4 chil. 
1 CONT
1 CONT Hannah Ellsworth (1257) b. Windsor, Sep. 10, 1713; d. Dec. 7, 1796; m. Apr. 28, 1743, Alex. Allyn [b. Dec. 25, 1718; d. Mch. 3, 1790; s. of Alex. Allyn (1520)]; res. W.; merchant. 
1 CONT
1 CONT Jonathan Ellsworth (1258) b. Windsor, Aug. 22, 1716; d. Apr. 12, 1775; m. Sarah Allyn, who d. Jan. 25, 1807, ‘ 82; 3 chil. 
1 CONT
