1 CONT     * Christened: St Sidwell's Devon England
1 CONT     * Married: 13 Apr 1629, Saint Sidwell Exeter Devon England
1 CONT     * Died: 21 May 1641, Windsor Hartford CT
1 CONT     * Buried: 21 May 1641, Windsor Hartford CT
1 CONT
