1 CONT GIBBS Descent Email from Jackie Towner dated May 15,1999:
1 CONT Gyles Gibbs, will
1 CONT Know alll men by these presents, that I, Gyles Gibbs, of Windsor, on
1 CONT Connecticutt, yeoman, being weake in body but of perfect understanding
1 CONT and memory, doe ordain this to be my last will and testament as
1 CONT followeth:
1 CONT Impr. my will is that my sonne Gregory bee put fortj an Apprentice to
1 CONT some Godly man for the space of five years at the discretion of my
1 CONT evecut. and the overseers of this my last will: and if hee submitt there
1 CONT unto and stay out his time to the likinge of my overseers, I doe then
1 CONT bequeath unto him my lott over the great River, to him and his heirs
1 CONT forever; in case my overseers have any incouragement to judge him
1 CONT worthy, otherwise at their discretion, I bequeath him £5 to bee paid
1 CONT him at age of 21 yeares. Also I give my two sonnes, Samuel & Benjamin,
1 CONT £20 apiece; to my daughte Sarah £20; to bee paid at age 21 yeares.
1 CONT And to Jacob, my sonne, I give my howse and lotts, meadows, home lotte,
1 CONT and great lott and lottes whatsoever, on this side of the great River,
1 CONT after his mothers life. And to my wife I give all my lottes, howses, all
1 CONT my househould goods, Cattells, and Chattells, my debts beign discharged;
1 CONT provided that in case my said overseers have no good incouragement
1 CONT cconcerning the disposition of my sonne Gregory, but doe judge him
1 CONT unworthy a fathers blessing under theire hands, my will is that my
1 CONT execut.: shall have the said lotte towards the Education of my children
1 CONT until my sonne Jacob shall attain the age of 21 yeares, and then my will
1 CONT is that my sonne Jacob shall have it to him and his heirs forever. And
1 CONT my Executrixe, of this my Will and Testament, I appoint the Deacons of
1 CONT the Church of Wyndsor, at all times in being. Blessed bee God.     Gyles
1 CONT Gibbs
1 CONT 18 May 1641
1 CONT witness:
1 CONT John Warham
1 CONT Ephraim Huitt
1 CONT Postscript: I give to Elizaphatt Gregory 10 bushells of corne in case
1 CONT hee discharge the debt I gave my worde for him to Mr. Huitt. And to
1 CONT Richard Wellar I give 40s by 20s a yeare, beginning from September next.
1 CONT
