1 CONT Y-Line 9: Giles Gibbs - b. Bet. 1596 - 1597 in (possibly) Co. Dorset, England; d. 1641 in Palisado, Windsor, CT
1 CONT
1 CONT As Submitted By: James Hemenway Gibbs
1 CONT
1 CONT This page was updated on: 1/20/05
1 CONT Basic Information
1 CONT Born 1596 - 1597 in (possibly) South Perrott, Hundred of Beaminster-Forum and Redhone, Bridport Division, Co. Dorset, England
1 CONT Died between May 18 - 21, 1641 in Palisado, Windsor, Hartford Co., CT
1 CONT Parents
1 CONT Father: probably the great-grandson of Anthonie Gibbs of Netherbury, Co. Dorset, possibly via Anthonie's son
1 CONT John Gibbs and Johns's son John Gibbs (see Additional Notes... below).
1 CONT Mother: Not stated
1 CONT Marriages
1 CONT Married 1st: HELEN CARY on July 29, 1617 in Alford, Co. Somerset, England
1 CONT She was born 1604, and died Bet. 1623
1 CONT Married 2nd: KATHERINE CARWYTHAM on April 13, 1629 in St. Sidwell's Church, Exeter, Co. Devon, England
1 CONT She was born in 1604 in Topsham or Exeter, Co. Devon, England, and died October 24, 1660 in Palisado,
1 CONT Windsor, Hartford Co., CT. Her parents were ROGER CARWYTHAM and ELIZABETH WESTCOTT.
1 CONT Notes
1 CONT
1 CONT Generation No. 1
1 CONT GILES1 GIBBS (JOHNA, JOHNB, ANTHONIEC GIBBES, ROBERTD, ROBERTE, THOMASF GYBBES, ROBERTG, ROBERTH)
1 CONT was born Bet. 1596 - 1597 in (possibly) South Perrott, Hundred of Beaminster-Forum and Redhone, Bridport Division, Co. Dorset,
1 CONT England, and died Bet. May 18 - 21, 1641 in Palisado, Windsor, Hartford Co., CT.
1 CONT He married (1) HELEN CARY July 29, 1617 in Alford, Co. Somerset, England. She was born in 1604, and died Bet. 1623 - 1628
1 CONT in Crewkerne or Exeter?, England. He married (2) KATHERINE CARWYTHAM April 13, 1629 in St. Sidwell's Church, Exeter,
1 CONT Co. Devon, England, daughter of ROGER CARWYTHAM and ELIZABETH WESTCOTT. She was born in 1604, in Topsham or
1 CONT Exeter, Co. Devon, England, and died October 24, 1660 in Palisado, Windsor, Hartford Co., CT.
1 CONT
