1 CONT ii. MARGARET2 GIBBS, b. October 01, 1620, Crewkerne, Co. Somerset, England; d. December 15, 1620 Crewkerne,
1 CONT Co. Somerset, England.
1 CONT iii. ELIZABETH2 GIBBS, b. January 16, 1620/21, Crewkerne, Co. Somerset, England; d. Bef. 1632, Crewkerne or Exeter?,
1 CONT England.
