1 CONC enry Adams of Braintree, Mass., and His Descendants" by Andrew N. Adams (LC #CS71.A2 1898). !Source: "Family Memorial Part I - Genealogy of Fourteen Families of the Early Settlers of New=England" by Elisha Thayer. LC# CS71.T37 183
1 CONC 5.
