1 CONT George came to America with his brothers William and Richard, landing on the Mary and John at Nantasket, now Hull on May 30, 1630.  He received a grant of six acres in Dorchester in January 1632; was a freeman May 6, 1635; and mov
1 CONC ed to Wind sor, Conn.,probably with the first emigration from Dorchester in the fall of 1635.  He moved with his second wife to Westfield, Mass, probably about 1670.
