1 CONT SECOND GENERATION
1 CONT 2. Hannah2 Ingersoll (John1), was born 1652 at Hartford, Connecticut; married Nov. 15, 1672, Stephen Kelsey, born 1647; died Nov. 30, 1710, son of William Kelsey, one of the first settlers of Hartford.
1 CONT
1 CONT Children:
1 CONT i  Hannah, b. 1675
1 CONT vii  Stephen, b. Sept. 20, 1677.
1 CONT iii  John, b. Jan. 20, 1680.
1 CONT iv  Daniel, b. Sept. 14, 1682.
1 CONT v  William, b. Feb. 19, 1685.
1 CONT vi  James, b. Aug. 21, 1687.
1 CONT vii  Charles, b. June 15, 1692; d. July 1, 1777.
1 CONT
1 CONT 3. Dorothy2 Ingersoll (John1), was born 1654 at Hartford, Connecticut; married May 2, 1672, Jacob Phelps of Westfield, Mass., born February 7, 1649; died October 6, 1689, son of George and Frances Phelps; married second time to Mr
1 CONC . Root.
1 CONT
1 CONT Children:
1 CONT i  Dorothy, b. Dec. 18, 1673; d. Feb. 2, 1674.
1 CONT ii  Dorothy, b. May 10, 1675; m. Nov. 30, 1693, Edward Kibbe of
1 CONT Enfield, Conn.
1 CONT iii  Hannah, b. Nov. 26, 1677; m. John Kibbe.
1 CONT iv  Israel, b. Apr. 3, 1681.
1 CONT v  Benjamin, b. Jan. 8, 1683.
1 CONT vi  Joseph, b. Aug. 5, 1686.
1 CONT vii  Jedediah, b. Dec. 7, 1688.
1 CONT 4. Margery2 Ingersoll (John1), was born Jan., 1656 at Northampton, Mass., married Dec. 5, 1679, Jacob Goffe of Wethersfield, Conn. He died Oct. 21. 1697, in the 49th year of his age; married second, Jonathan Buck of Wethersfield;
1 CONT
1 CONT Children:
1 CONT i  Jacob, b. Nov. 5, 1680; d. Dec. 14, 1680.
1 CONT ii  Moses, b. March 10, 1682; d. before 1708, when his father's estate
1 CONT was distributed, as he was not mentioned in the order of distribution.
1 CONT iii  Mabel, b. Oct. 31, 1690; d. May 9, 1768; m. Oct. 30, 1707, Daniel
1 CONT Andrus of Wethersfield, Conn.; d. June 16, 17--.
1 CONT iv  Mary, b. Nov. 15, 1693; d. Sept. 7, 1769; m. June 26, 1712, John
1 CONT Andrus of Wethersfield; d. June 16, 1790.
1 CONT v  Eunice, b. March 7, 1696.
1 CONT
1 CONT 5. Abigail2 Ingersoll (John1), was born Jan. 11, 1659; married Thomas Rix of Wethersfield; died May 21, 1690; married second, 1696, Lieut. Joshua Wills of Windsor, Conn.; died Jan. 6, 1721, in the seventy-fifth year of his age (Gr
1 CONC avestone, East Windsor old burying ground.) She was his third wife.
1 CONT
1 CONT Child:
1 CONT i  Abigail, m. Oct. 1710, John Burt, Jr., of Springfield, Mass. They
1 CONT had six children. She died Feb. 17, 1727.
1 CONT
1 CONT 6. Abiah2 Ingersoll (John1), was born Aug. 24, 1663 at Northampton; died Nov. 2, 1732; married about Jan. 1, 1688, Jedediah Strong, Jr., of Northampton, where he resided until about 1695 when he removed to Lebanon, Conn., where he
1 CONC  died Oct. 12, 1709.
1 CONT
