1 CONT Jacob Phelps moved to Westfield and d. there Oct. 6, 1689, ag. 40; m. May 2, 1672, Dorothy Ingerscl, dau. of John; they had Dorothy, b. May 10, 1675, m. Edward Kibbe of Enfield, Conn.; Hannah, b. Nov. 26, 1677, m. John Kibbe of En
1 CONC field; Israel, b. April 3, 1681; Benjamin, b. Jan. 8, 1684; Joseph, b. Aug. 5, 1686; and Jedadia, b. Dec. 7, 1688; d. Feb. 13, 1752, m. Elizabeth Janes. The boys removed to Lebanon, Conn.
