1 CONC lford;Hann ah, bapt. 4 Apr 1680, wh. m. Joseph Woodruff of Farmington, and d.bef. her f.; and Martha, then unm." --From Savage, p. 395: SAVAGE: 'Genealogical Dictionary of the FirstSettlers of NewEngland'
