0 @N6000000000337376833@ NOTE Source #1:  Gary Boyd Roberts, "The Royal Descents of 500 Immigrants to the American Colonies or the United States, Who Were Themselves Notable or Left Descendants Notable in American History" (Baltimore:  Genealogical Publishing 
